<br/>And you had the guts to submit this to a dpchallenge? Some of the rule-abiding voters must have had a fit. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-03 22:04:41.</i></td>', 'This is a great shot! I actually like the guy being in soft focus. However, some of the tiles seem in sharper focus (they probably aren''t but it just seems that way) and therefore compete with the guy for attention. Imho, this shot would have tremendous power if the whole thing would be very soft (gaussian blur on the tiles maybe? ;)And you had the guts to submit this to a dpchallenge? Some of the rule-abiding voters must have had a fit. ', '2003-06-03 23:01:42.000000', '2003-06-03 23:04:41.000000', 0),
(354924, 1860, 10145, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast...subject is exactly where he should be for the composition of the shot</td>', 'Nice color contrast...subject is exactly where he should be for the composition of the shot', '2003-07-12 22:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(410682, 1912, 10985, '<td valign="top">This is such a great photo. Although there may be many children playing, the background is perfectly neutral as none of them can be seen. The positions of the boy and umbrella are perfect and the weight of the water can be seen, almost felt! I also like very much the fact that the boy has his back to the camera. Very cool shot!</td>', 'This is such a great photo. Although there may be many children playing, the background is perfectly neutral as none of them can be seen. The positions of the boy and umbrella are perfect and the weight of the water can be seen, almost felt! I also like very much the fact that the boy has his back to the camera. Very cool shot!', '2003-09-05 17:26:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(429167, 1912, 9441, '<td valign="top">Fabulous photo...I like the posture of the boy, the effect of the water coming off the umbrella is wonderful....this photo has a very realistic quality to it....I can almost ''hear'' the water as it pours down.  Great job!</td>', 'Fabulous photo...I like the posture of the boy, the effect of the water coming off the umbrella is wonderful....this photo has a very realistic quality to it....I can almost ''hear'' the water as it pours down.  Great job!', '2003-09-24 18:38:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(562277, 1841, 14157, '<td valign="top">That''s how people look at me in the mall..... Anyway let''s get over my problems, I love this picture (but mainly the guy XP) that kids expression in HILARIOUS. Makes me laugh whenever I see it.</td>', 'That''s how people look at me in the mall..... Anyway let''s get over my problems, I love this picture (but mainly the guy XP) that kids expression in HILARIOUS. Makes me laugh whenever I see it.', '2004-01-29 18:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
