(742808, 1905, 19025, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the blanket blocking the baby''s mouth and chin. I would also like to see the face more in focus. The blanket looks a little overexposed. Maybe a little bit less light behind the baby''s head too. The window light seems a little distracting and the window seal looks like it is protruding from the baby''s head. I would have come from up under the baby around the chin area and the hand would have been involved too. I have taken portraits of my niece and have learned what to do and what NOT to do. Just a bit of advice...from a person not even close to being pro..but going to college to get there. but my art work and other photos are on the following website. <br/><a href="//photos.yahoo.com/fivepointstar26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//photos.yahoo.com/fivepointstar26</a> <br/></td>', 'I don''t like the blanket blocking the baby''s mouth and chin. I would also like to see the face more in focus. The blanket looks a little overexposed. Maybe a little bit less light behind the baby''s head too. The window light seems a little distracting and the window seal looks like it is protruding from the baby''s head. I would have come from up under the baby around the chin area and the hand would have been involved too. I have taken portraits of my niece and have learned what to do and what NOT to do. Just a bit of advice...from a person not even close to being pro..but going to college to get there. but my art work and other photos are on the following website. //photos.yahoo.com/fivepointstar26 ', '2004-05-30 19:05:57.000000', NULL, 0),
