(967808, 1930, 24613, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand MandarinElements comments (although she''s entitled to her opinion).  This is an excellent shot!  The lighting is fabulous, the hair coming down on the face, the pose, the expression; it all works so well.  Someday I''ll be able to shoot this well (I hope!).  Wonderful job!!</td>', 'I don''t understand MandarinElements comments (although she''s entitled to her opinion).  This is an excellent shot!  The lighting is fabulous, the hair coming down on the face, the pose, the expression; it all works so well.  Someday I''ll be able to shoot this well (I hope!).  Wonderful job!!', '2004-10-21 01:20:59.000000', NULL, 0),
