(64452, 1818, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favourite kid photo here... it''s much nicer photographed and better lit than all the snapshots, but spontaneous and real, not staged. Full of pathos.</td>', 'I think this is my favourite kid photo here... it''s much nicer photographed and better lit than all the snapshots, but spontaneous and real, not staged. Full of pathos.', '2002-05-28 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
