(64454, 1818, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, cute kids.  Good color, focus, framing.  No "gripes" to suggest improvement.  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 10 total 9</td>', 'Nice photo, cute kids.  Good color, focus, framing.  No "gripes" to suggest improvement.  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 10 total 9', '2002-05-28 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64455, 1818, 1, '<td valign="top">Cute image, nice green/yellow complementing colors, but I think the background could use some work.</td>', 'Cute image, nice green/yellow complementing colors, but I think the background could use some work.', '2002-05-28 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64456, 1818, 885, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  Like the soft lighting, and the yellow and green colors.  The blah brown background allows them to stand out, but maybe a tad on the busy side on the right.  Photos of me and my brother like this always end up with him making an "ick, get away from me!" face.</td>', 'Very cute.  Like the soft lighting, and the yellow and green colors.  The blah brown background allows them to stand out, but maybe a tad on the busy side on the right.  Photos of me and my brother like this always end up with him making an "ick, get away from me!" face.', '2002-05-29 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64457, 1818, 509, '<td valign="top">Wow, a brother and a sister getting along....certainly not the case with my sister and I when we were young.  Nice job. Is this shot at an airport?  At first I thought it was shot in a minivan or something, but how many minivans have what looks like a hardwood floor.  Very good lighting for this indoor scene.  I think that a more level angle might have worked better here, but that''s just my opinion</td>', 'Wow, a brother and a sister getting along....certainly not the case with my sister and I when we were young.  Nice job. Is this shot at an airport?  At first I thought it was shot in a minivan or something, but how many minivans have what looks like a hardwood floor.  Very good lighting for this indoor scene.  I think that a more level angle might have worked better here, but that''s just my opinion', '2002-05-29 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64458, 1818, 587, '<td valign="top">There he is!  Was wondering if he was going to make it into this challenge :)  He''s so adorable - and his sister is a cutie too!  Are they wringing each others necks? :) I really like the colors (yellow blue and green) but the chairs....where was this taken? Ah well, very crisp and clear good job!</td>', 'There he is!  Was wondering if he was going to make it into this challenge :)  He''s so adorable - and his sister is a cutie too!  Are they wringing each others necks? :) I really like the colors (yellow blue and green) but the chairs....where was this taken? Ah well, very crisp and clear good job!', '2002-05-29 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64459, 1818, 142, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  I love the clarity and the lighting.  I am sure this is a photo for their family to cherish.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  I love the clarity and the lighting.  I am sure this is a photo for their family to cherish.', '2002-05-29 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64460, 1818, 301, '<td valign="top">Certainly not art, but definitely one to be proud of and place in the family album</td>', 'Certainly not art, but definitely one to be proud of and place in the family album', '2002-05-30 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64461, 1818, 1679, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh, aren''t they cute! Nice photo and strong eye contact! A good ''un.</td>', 'Ohhhh, aren''t they cute! Nice photo and strong eye contact! A good ''un.', '2002-05-30 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64462, 1819, 772, '<td valign="top">I wish i was at the beach this week.. lol... good job!</td>', 'I wish i was at the beach this week.. lol... good job!', '2002-05-27 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64463, 1819, 661, '<td valign="top">I like the shot of the guys playing soccer.  The folks in front detract a little from that image.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten closer.</td>', 'I like the shot of the guys playing soccer.  The folks in front detract a little from that image.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten closer.', '2002-05-27 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
