(64531, 1827, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but wow, I can barely make it out.  Too much motion everywhere, good motion effects are usually better when limited.  Lighting is poor, too bright on the left, too dark on the right.  The person in the foreground is very unhelpful to your score.<br/>Photo 4 Creativity 8 People 4 total 5</td>', 'Good idea, but wow, I can barely make it out.  Too much motion everywhere, good motion effects are usually better when limited.  Lighting is poor, too bright on the left, too dark on the right.  The person in the foreground is very unhelpful to your score.Photo 4 Creativity 8 People 4 total 5', '2002-05-28 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64532, 1827, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the title is the name of the band?  IMO, this photo is too dark (especially with the blurry person in the foreground blocking much of the center) and blurry.  Maybe more light, a higher ISO setting (if your camera allows that)?  My eye keep on trying to move around the center (front figure) to find something to focus on.</td>', 'I''m assuming the title is the name of the band?  IMO, this photo is too dark (especially with the blurry person in the foreground blocking much of the center) and blurry.  Maybe more light, a higher ISO setting (if your camera allows that)?  My eye keep on trying to move around the center (front figure) to find something to focus on.', '2002-05-29 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64533, 1827, 255, '<td valign="top">this is a cool picture. i wish the lighting were different--a little lighter in the front and maybe blur  the 4th guy also,  to match the the rest of the band.</td>', 'this is a cool picture. i wish the lighting were different--a little lighter in the front and maybe blur  the 4th guy also,  to match the the rest of the band.', '2002-05-29 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
