(64535, 1827, 1078, '<td valign="top">The shot overall is so dark, I can hardly see anybody or anything.  If it weren''t for the drummer (good smile on his face) and the drum set, I''m not sure if I''d be able to tell what this is even a photo of.  I think the idea of using motion blur for this kind of shot is great -- just wish I could see more of it.</td>', 'The shot overall is so dark, I can hardly see anybody or anything.  If it weren''t for the drummer (good smile on his face) and the drum set, I''m not sure if I''d be able to tell what this is even a photo of.  I think the idea of using motion blur for this kind of shot is great -- just wish I could see more of it.', '2002-05-30 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64536, 1827, 1175, '<td valign="top">Image is too out of focus.  Its hard to take pictures of bands without a tripod  The light to the left of the drummer is distracting from the rest of the picture.</td>', 'Image is too out of focus.  Its hard to take pictures of bands without a tripod  The light to the left of the drummer is distracting from the rest of the picture.', '2002-05-31 07:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
