(64601, 1836, 1209, '<td valign="top">Heart-tugging photo for me. My greatgrandfather died as a Union soldier in 1864. This is a very well done picture, and the clarity is amazing!  I especially like the sepia tones.</td>', 'Heart-tugging photo for me. My greatgrandfather died as a Union soldier in 1864. This is a very well done picture, and the clarity is amazing!  I especially like the sepia tones.', '2002-05-28 03:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64602, 1836, 1325, '<td valign="top">I like the setting, the choice of subject but especially I like it relevant to the colors you choose.  The civil war was a dirty war with out food, blankets for warmth, clean clothes etc. and your coloring reflects the somberness of that.   Others may critize your technique but I give you a ten based on your creaitivity.</td>', 'I like the setting, the choice of subject but especially I like it relevant to the colors you choose.  The civil war was a dirty war with out food, blankets for warmth, clean clothes etc. and your coloring reflects the somberness of that.   Others may critize your technique but I give you a ten based on your creaitivity.', '2002-05-28 05:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64603, 1836, 301, '<td valign="top">Nicely set up.  The sepia toning doesn''t seem quite right for me.  I toned down the red colour a lot, and the green a little, and the effect seemed more authentic to me</td>', 'Nicely set up.  The sepia toning doesn''t seem quite right for me.  I toned down the red colour a lot, and the green a little, and the effect seemed more authentic to me', '2002-05-28 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64604, 1836, 1834, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2002-05-28 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64605, 1836, 907, '<td valign="top">awesome, like the sepia here!!</td>', 'awesome, like the sepia here!!', '2002-05-28 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64606, 1836, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice subject! Where did you dig this guy up?</td>', 'Nice subject! Where did you dig this guy up?', '2002-05-28 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64607, 1836, 1005, '<td valign="top">Best use of sepia EVER!  Good photo, only 10 so far.  Can''t think of a single thing to improve, sorry.  Photo 10 Creativity 10 People 10 total 10 perfect score!!!!!<br/>This one HAS to win!</td>', 'Best use of sepia EVER!  Good photo, only 10 so far.  Can''t think of a single thing to improve, sorry.  Photo 10 Creativity 10 People 10 total 10 perfect score!!!!!This one HAS to win!', '2002-05-28 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
