(64676, 1841, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cute subject, but I think that being chopped at the knees and at the heads creates unecessary tension. Also might try a wide open aperture to blur the distractive background. Here''s my thought FWIW :-) It might have worked better to get higher, back furthar, more behind the man, and inline with the baby at an angle looking downward and using a telephoto to compress the distance between the man and the baby.</td>', 'Cute subject, but I think that being chopped at the knees and at the heads creates unecessary tension. Also might try a wide open aperture to blur the distractive background. Here''s my thought FWIW :-) It might have worked better to get higher, back furthar, more behind the man, and inline with the baby at an angle looking downward and using a telephoto to compress the distance between the man and the baby.', '2002-05-28 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64677, 1841, 737, '<td valign="top">Great title for the expression. In my top 10.</td>', 'Great title for the expression. In my top 10.', '2002-05-28 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
