(64679, 1841, 1009, '<td valign="top">I would have voted slightly higher (than the 6 I gave you) if the heads weren''t cropped out. Nice idea for a pic though...</td>', 'I would have voted slightly higher (than the 6 I gave you) if the heads weren''t cropped out. Nice idea for a pic though...', '2002-05-28 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64680, 1841, 757, '<td valign="top">i realize the baby is supposed to be the center attraction of the pic, but it would have been nice to not had the heads of the other two subjects cut off</td>', 'i realize the baby is supposed to be the center attraction of the pic, but it would have been nice to not had the heads of the other two subjects cut off', '2002-05-28 23:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64681, 1841, 1325, '<td valign="top">You caught a great moment.  Me and the babe make two--the very young and the old cannot help but wonder where he came from and why would he want to look like that.</td>', 'You caught a great moment.  Me and the babe make two--the very young and the old cannot help but wonder where he came from and why would he want to look like that.', '2002-05-29 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64682, 1841, 1005, '<td valign="top">I know the baby was your subject, but you chopped off the object of his/her interest.  Aim up a foot or two.  (I wanted to stare at the mowhawk, too.)<br/>Good focus, color.  Swing up and move to your right just a hair (ha) and this would have been a 10.  Very humorous!<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 8 People 8 total 8</td>', 'I know the baby was your subject, but you chopped off the object of his/her interest.  Aim up a foot or two.  (I wanted to stare at the mowhawk, too.)Good focus, color.  Swing up and move to your right just a hair (ha) and this would have been a 10.  Very humorous!Photo 8 Creativity 8 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-29 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64683, 1841, 255, '<td valign="top">cute idea, I just can''t really get into the chopping half of people''s faces off. It bugs me! The dude''s hair would have really made an impact into what baby was looking at, had it been left in the frame.</td>', 'cute idea, I just can''t really get into the chopping half of people''s faces off. It bugs me! The dude''s hair would have really made an impact into what baby was looking at, had it been left in the frame.', '2002-05-29 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64684, 1841, 748, '<td valign="top">It would have been better with the camera shifted up to catch the faces of the other two people, nothing would have been lost at the bottom.</td>', 'It would have been better with the camera shifted up to catch the faces of the other two people, nothing would have been lost at the bottom.', '2002-05-29 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64685, 1841, 1582, '<td valign="top">I Love the look on the baby''s face, the ladies red shirt and the green in the boy shirt add a nice contrast. You must be a really exceptional photographer, and handsome too!</td>', 'I Love the look on the baby''s face, the ladies red shirt and the green in the boy shirt add a nice contrast. You must be a really exceptional photographer, and handsome too!', '2002-05-29 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
