(64689, 1841, 1679, '<td valign="top">Photos with heads cut in half are not the best. If you just wanted to concentrate on the baby, then maybe zooming in closer would have made a better photo.</td>', 'Photos with heads cut in half are not the best. If you just wanted to concentrate on the baby, then maybe zooming in closer would have made a better photo.', '2002-05-30 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64690, 1841, 1175, '<td valign="top">The rule of thirds says that those breasts in red is the subject of the photo.  Without reading the title its hard to tell what the subject really is.  Try to fill the frame with more of your subject.  Its probably a bit awkward to try and take this photo.</td>', 'The rule of thirds says that those breasts in red is the subject of the photo.  Without reading the title its hard to tell what the subject really is.  Try to fill the frame with more of your subject.  Its probably a bit awkward to try and take this photo.', '2002-05-30 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
