(64692, 1841, 811, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the baby''s face.  However, cropping the top of the left person''s head off causes some of the impact to be lost.  The busy background being blurry helps the viewer focus on the three people "in front."</td>', 'Great expression on the baby''s face.  However, cropping the top of the left person''s head off causes some of the impact to be lost.  The busy background being blurry helps the viewer focus on the three people "in front."', '2002-06-01 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
