(64712, 1842, 1005, '<td valign="top">The photo is good, focus, color, etc well done.  The background hurts your shot.  In your case, try standing tall (or on a chair/box/etc) and shoot more down at the subject and the fountain.  Watch your lighting, notice the fingers on the fretboard?  (hint: no finger tips visible)<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 8 total 8</td>', 'The photo is good, focus, color, etc well done.  The background hurts your shot.  In your case, try standing tall (or on a chair/box/etc) and shoot more down at the subject and the fountain.  Watch your lighting, notice the fingers on the fretboard?  (hint: no finger tips visible)Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-29 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64713, 1842, 885, '<td valign="top">The background is really nice and makes for an excellent effect.  The lighting seems a little too harsh though.  Not that you would want real soft lighting for this subject, but the shadows are really deep here.</td>', 'The background is really nice and makes for an excellent effect.  The lighting seems a little too harsh though.  Not that you would want real soft lighting for this subject, but the shadows are really deep here.', '2002-05-29 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
