(64720, 1846, 509, '<td valign="top">Very cool angle.  Is this a reflection?  I''d say no, since the Elvis poster in the top left isn''t reversed.  If not, I''d like to know how you got this effect.  It''s a good band shot, but the lighting could be better, and the colors are a bit bland (then again, they seem to all be playing black instruments)  nice job</td>', 'Very cool angle.  Is this a reflection?  I''d say no, since the Elvis poster in the top left isn''t reversed.  If not, I''d like to know how you got this effect.  It''s a good band shot, but the lighting could be better, and the colors are a bit bland (then again, they seem to all be playing black instruments)  nice job', '2002-05-27 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
