(64917, 1858, 1005, '<td valign="top">VERY scary!!!!  If this were a scary dog challenge you would win hands down.  Unfortunately for you, this is a PEOPLE challenge.  Yes, you have a person in the frame, but he is fully secondary.  Black and white may have also hurt this shot, the leaves on the ground wash out, look bad.  This might have worked better in color.<br/>Photo 7 (9 in color, I think) Creativity 8 People 5 total 7</td>', 'VERY scary!!!!  If this were a scary dog challenge you would win hands down.  Unfortunately for you, this is a PEOPLE challenge.  Yes, you have a person in the frame, but he is fully secondary.  Black and white may have also hurt this shot, the leaves on the ground wash out, look bad.  This might have worked better in color.Photo 7 (9 in color, I think) Creativity 8 People 5 total 7', '2002-05-29 14:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
