(64939, 1860, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great catch.  I like how you got a little further down to his level.  IMO, this photo would''ve had a lot more impact though if it had been cropped much tighter, to exclude the shutters in the back and have just teh walls and pinkish doors as the background.  That would''ve also moved the scholar out of the center of the shot and made it follow the ROT.</td>', 'Great catch.  I like how you got a little further down to his level.  IMO, this photo would''ve had a lot more impact though if it had been cropped much tighter, to exclude the shutters in the back and have just teh walls and pinkish doors as the background.  That would''ve also moved the scholar out of the center of the shot and made it follow the ROT.', '2002-05-28 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64940, 1860, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous! Great composition, great camera angle, the lighting is lovely and soft bringing out all the texture of the surroundings, and you captured this guy in a great moment of concentration.</td>', 'This is gorgeous! Great composition, great camera angle, the lighting is lovely and soft bringing out all the texture of the surroundings, and you captured this guy in a great moment of concentration.', '2002-05-28 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
