(64942, 1860, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Could you have filled the frame with the subject more?  (What is in his right hand? espresso?)  I like the three purple doors, but could have lived w/o the slatted doors and brick.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8</td>', 'Good photo.  Could you have filled the frame with the subject more?  (What is in his right hand? espresso?)  I like the three purple doors, but could have lived w/o the slatted doors and brick.Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-28 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
