(64944, 1860, 1897, '<td valign="top">What is the poin?  Need to focus on the subject.  I close up of the face with the hat may have been more compelling.  Get close and personal.</td>', 'What is the poin?  Need to focus on the subject.  I close up of the face with the hat may have been more compelling.  Get close and personal.', '2002-05-28 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
