(64946, 1860, 1379, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  I like how his rear end is hovering above the ground to keep his pants clean.... This is a posture I know well.  He looks good against the pale wall with the pastel shutters.</td>', 'This is really nice.  I like how his rear end is hovering above the ground to keep his pants clean.... This is a posture I know well.  He looks good against the pale wall with the pastel shutters.', '2002-05-28 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
