(64992, 1861, 1750, '<td valign="top">Tells a sad story.  Makes me wonder how it started. There''s a great triangle composition here (the smoke, the fire, the end of the house).  Really balances out the frame.</td>', 'Tells a sad story.  Makes me wonder how it started. There''s a great triangle composition here (the smoke, the fire, the end of the house).  Really balances out the frame.', '2002-06-02 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(64993, 1861, 203, '<td valign="top">I did not "set" this one up.  It is a rental the occupant is a single Mom with two kids all are well.  The house next door was damaged but still occupied.  Everyone got out before the fire was put out except the cat who may have used up a life but was rescued in the end.  The photo was sold to the local daily paper where I am a stringer.  Crisa i thought they could have moved the car as well.  I had to pull over to let the fire truck pass and was shooting the scene before they were set up.  The car was not on fire when I got there.</td>', 'I did not "set" this one up.  It is a rental the occupant is a single Mom with two kids all are well.  The house next door was damaged but still occupied.  Everyone got out before the fire was put out except the cat who may have used up a life but was rescued in the end.  The photo was sold to the local daily paper where I am a stringer.  Crisa i thought they could have moved the car as well.  I had to pull over to let the fire truck pass and was shooting the scene before they were set up.  The car was not on fire when I got there.', '2002-06-04 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
