(65002, 1862, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo!  This is an excellent portrait shot... i would love to see this set on a white background... this is one of my favorites this week!</td>', 'Very nice photo!  This is an excellent portrait shot... i would love to see this set on a white background... this is one of my favorites this week!', '2002-05-28 09:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65003, 1862, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot.  It''s crisp, colorful, and she looks right at me and has a glint in her eyes.  Very well done.  If I was to say something nitpicky, it would be that the buttons are cropped off at the bottom of the frame, just a fraction more photo there would''ve had them included all the way.</td>', 'I like this picture a lot.  It''s crisp, colorful, and she looks right at me and has a glint in her eyes.  Very well done.  If I was to say something nitpicky, it would be that the buttons are cropped off at the bottom of the frame, just a fraction more photo there would''ve had them included all the way.', '2002-05-28 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65004, 1862, 907, '<td valign="top">she is beautiful, but I want to see the whole traditional costume!! btw, traditional for for what culture? please post ;)</td>', 'she is beautiful, but I want to see the whole traditional costume!! btw, traditional for for what culture? please post ;)', '2002-05-28 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65005, 1862, 773, '<td valign="top">Love the vivid colors!</td>', 'Love the vivid colors!', '2002-05-28 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65006, 1862, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice, well composed and colorful! The background is the only thing that detracts from this photo.</td>', 'Nice, well composed and colorful! The background is the only thing that detracts from this photo.', '2002-05-28 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65007, 1862, 255, '<td valign="top">is this a national geographic cover?! ;) great picture, love the color contrasts.</td>', 'is this a national geographic cover?! ;) great picture, love the color contrasts.', '2002-05-28 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65008, 1862, 1175, '<td valign="top">Great color and clarity.  Really nice photo.</td>', 'Great color and clarity.  Really nice photo.', '2002-05-28 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65009, 1862, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo, but was there any more of interest with the rest of the costume?  Red silk might be a little (tiny) bit overexposed.  Good color and focus!<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 8 People 9 total 9</td>', 'Really nice photo, but was there any more of interest with the rest of the costume?  Red silk might be a little (tiny) bit overexposed.  Good color and focus!Photo 10 Creativity 8 People 9 total 9', '2002-05-28 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65010, 1862, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, pretty subject, and I like the contrasting yellow background.  Wish her lips were a more matching color with her costume, but you''ll have to take that up with her makeup artist.</td>', 'Nice colors, pretty subject, and I like the contrasting yellow background.  Wish her lips were a more matching color with her costume, but you''ll have to take that up with her makeup artist.', '2002-05-29 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65011, 1862, 1603, '<td valign="top">Good shot... Like the color also..</td>', 'Good shot... Like the color also..', '2002-05-29 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65012, 1862, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice colors...</td>', 'Nice colors...', '2002-05-29 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65013, 1862, 616, '<td valign="top">The color contrast is beautiful, and the focus is great. The model in this photo is perfect!</td>', 'The color contrast is beautiful, and the focus is great. The model in this photo is perfect!', '2002-05-29 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65014, 1862, 543, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl, great colors and clarity.  I don''t know if the fill flash was necessary (can''t tell what the lighing conditions were), but I''d have moved her a little farther from the bg to minimize the shadows and get those horizontal lines out of the field of focus.  The one running through her neck is a no-no (according to the "rules").  That said, one of the best this round.</td>', 'Beautiful girl, great colors and clarity.  I don''t know if the fill flash was necessary (can''t tell what the lighing conditions were), but I''d have moved her a little farther from the bg to minimize the shadows and get those horizontal lines out of the field of focus.  The one running through her neck is a no-no (according to the "rules").  That said, one of the best this round.', '2002-05-31 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65015, 1862, 811, '<td valign="top">The yelow background contrasts nicely with the red and black.</td>', 'The yelow background contrasts nicely with the red and black.', '2002-06-01 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65016, 1862, 878, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.</td>', 'Very nice colors.', '2002-06-02 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65017, 1862, 1750, '<td valign="top">Lovelysubject. Lively mix of colors and shapes. Would like to see a hair light on her. Nice tight shot.</td>', 'Lovelysubject. Lively mix of colors and shapes. Would like to see a hair light on her. Nice tight shot.', '2002-06-02 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65018, 1863, 668, '<td valign="top">if it werent for the title</td>', 'if it werent for the title', '2002-05-27 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65019, 1863, 661, '<td valign="top">Must be somewhere warm.</td>', 'Must be somewhere warm.', '2002-05-27 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65020, 1863, 1750, '<td valign="top">Light, bright, airy, casual. Like the direct angle. Would like to see the complete head.</td>', 'Light, bright, airy, casual. Like the direct angle. Would like to see the complete head.', '2002-05-27 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65021, 1863, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo... I would like it even more if the head wasn''t clipped off at the top...</td>', 'This is a nice photo... I would like it even more if the head wasn''t clipped off at the top...', '2002-05-27 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65022, 1863, 1379, '<td valign="top">A peewee paddler!  He looks like he is having fun!</td>', 'A peewee paddler!  He looks like he is having fun!', '2002-05-27 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65023, 1863, 509, '<td valign="top">Ah summer time, can''t wait!  nice shot, contrast of colors is nice here, very vibrant blue (water)</td>', 'Ah summer time, can''t wait!  nice shot, contrast of colors is nice here, very vibrant blue (water)', '2002-05-27 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65024, 1863, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty color and nice shot. Sorry ya cut the top of his head off. Handsome boy, looks like a fun day at the pool. Good job.</td>', 'Pretty color and nice shot. Sorry ya cut the top of his head off. Handsome boy, looks like a fun day at the pool. Good job.', '2002-05-27 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65025, 1863, 1041, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot.  Clear, he''s looking right at the camera, the background color works well as a contrast to his life-vest.  Good job!</td>', 'This is a very nice shot.  Clear, he''s looking right at the camera, the background color works well as a contrast to his life-vest.  Good job!', '2002-05-28 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65026, 1863, 907, '<td valign="top">darling little boy, beautiful colors - wish his head and fingers were still there. ;P Nice photo.</td>', 'darling little boy, beautiful colors - wish his head and fingers were still there. ;P Nice photo.', '2002-05-28 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65027, 1863, 570, '<td valign="top">needs hair on his chest first.</td>', 'needs hair on his chest first.', '2002-05-28 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65028, 1863, 1005, '<td valign="top">Doctor, doctor!  You cut off my head!  Good color, focus, but his head, ouch!  Photo 8 Creativity 6 People 8 total 7</td>', 'Doctor, doctor!  You cut off my head!  Good color, focus, but his head, ouch!  Photo 8 Creativity 6 People 8 total 7', '2002-05-28 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65029, 1863, 811, '<td valign="top">I am not sure, but I think having more picture at the top, and less at the bottom would have made him seem more complete.  I like the colors and brightness of the picture.</td>', 'I am not sure, but I think having more picture at the top, and less at the bottom would have made him seem more complete.  I like the colors and brightness of the picture.', '2002-05-29 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65030, 1863, 1817, '<td valign="top">great color</td>', 'great color', '2002-05-29 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65031, 1863, 1455, '<td valign="top">We are so glad that he like to swim now!!!!!!!!!  That''s my boy.</td>', 'We are so glad that he like to swim now!!!!!!!!!  That''s my boy.', '2002-05-30 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65032, 1863, 573, '<td valign="top">While viewing this I could smell the chlorine, but it is still just a nice snapshot.</td>', 'While viewing this I could smell the chlorine, but it is still just a nice snapshot.', '2002-05-30 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65033, 1863, 1175, '<td valign="top">Looks good for the cover of the box that life vest came in.  Nice color in the water and in the boys skin.  I don''t find alot of interest in this picture though.</td>', 'Looks good for the cover of the box that life vest came in.  Nice color in the water and in the boys skin.  I don''t find alot of interest in this picture though.', '2002-05-31 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(65034, 1863, 549, '<td valign="top">nice colors, great shot. So you waited by the ladder for this?</td>', 'nice colors, great shot. So you waited by the ladder for this?', '2002-05-31 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65035, 1863, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hope you can find a decent agent -- there ARE a few...</td>', 'Hope you can find a decent agent -- there ARE a few...', '2002-06-01 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65036, 1863, 1585, '<td valign="top">I would like to thank all that commented on this photo, many great people out there. The lesson has been learned.<br/>I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS.<br/>I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS.<br/>I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS.<br/>I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS.<br/></td>', 'I would like to thank all that commented on this photo, many great people out there. The lesson has been learned.I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS.I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS.I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS.I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS. I WILL NOT CUT OFF HEADS.', '2002-06-05 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65037, 1864, 1211, '<td valign="top">great idea here, I think if you cropped out the gentleman on the far left, that would have helped a bit.</td>', 'great idea here, I think if you cropped out the gentleman on the far left, that would have helped a bit.', '2002-05-27 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65038, 1864, 842, '<td valign="top">Is this SeaTac or Chicago? It looks very familiar...</td>', 'Is this SeaTac or Chicago? It looks very familiar...', '2002-05-27 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65039, 1864, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice color, little over exposed on the newspaper, but I''m sure it''s the overhead lights. The blue is so rich with the touch of red. Nice work here.<br/></td>', 'Nice color, little over exposed on the newspaper, but I''m sure it''s the overhead lights. The blue is so rich with the touch of red. Nice work here.', '2002-05-27 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65040, 1864, 772, '<td valign="top">I see the people :)</td>', 'I see the people :)', '2002-05-27 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65041, 1864, 1520, '<td valign="top">I like the way this picture conveys killing time.  However, I might''ve used a larger aperture to focus more on the people and keep the background (doors, etc) out of focus.<br/></td>', 'I like the way this picture conveys killing time.  However, I might''ve used a larger aperture to focus more on the people and keep the background (doors, etc) out of focus.', '2002-05-28 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65042, 1864, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I got so many problems with this shot.  Techically, it''s O.K., except for the washed out newspaper in the ladies'' hands, but this looks like an accident more than anything else.  (What''s that shot?  Your finger, oops....)<br/>Photo 6 Creativity 4 People 4 total 5 (sorry, but in the mood I''m in, that''s the best I can do.)<br/></td>', 'Sorry, but I got so many problems with this shot.  Techically, it''s O.K., except for the washed out newspaper in the ladies'' hands, but this looks like an accident more than anything else.  (What''s that shot?  Your finger, oops....)Photo 6 Creativity 4 People 4 total 5 (sorry, but in the mood I''m in, that''s the best I can do.)', '2002-05-28 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65043, 1864, 1379, '<td valign="top">How familiar....</td>', 'How familiar....', '2002-05-29 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65044, 1864, 1907, '<td valign="top">i liked "Killing Time" more...</td>', 'i liked "Killing Time" more...', '2002-05-30 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65045, 1864, 885, '<td valign="top">I think it''s weird that that old lady has red sneakers.   I have red sneakers.  And I''m not old.  I think maybe you could have focused more on ''busy airport'' or ''lonely airport''.  this seems to be in the middle with the guy off to the left.  also, you don''t seem to be using the pattern of the chairs to enhance your composition which I know from experience in airports must be there.</td>', 'I think it''s weird that that old lady has red sneakers.   I have red sneakers.  And I''m not old.  I think maybe you could have focused more on ''busy airport'' or ''lonely airport''.  this seems to be in the middle with the guy off to the left.  also, you don''t seem to be using the pattern of the chairs to enhance your composition which I know from experience in airports must be there.', '2002-05-30 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65046, 1864, 689, '<td valign="top">Too many empty chairs.</td>', 'Too many empty chairs.', '2002-05-31 00:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65047, 1864, 1037, '<td valign="top">The colour is highly saturated in this. I like the blue tones, but the skin tones are a bit too green. Playing with the curves for each colour, or the channel mixer, or some other method that alters the colour balance for red, green and blue separately could have helped (in case you don''t know). I really like the angle you got. It''s nice that some people try to be a bit different :P</td>', 'The colour is highly saturated in this. I like the blue tones, but the skin tones are a bit too green. Playing with the curves for each colour, or the channel mixer, or some other method that alters the colour balance for red, green and blue separately could have helped (in case you don''t know). I really like the angle you got. It''s nice that some people try to be a bit different :P', '2002-05-31 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65048, 1864, 1750, '<td valign="top">Interesting pic, but I keep getting the feeling that something''s missing.</td>', 'Interesting pic, but I keep getting the feeling that something''s missing.', '2002-06-02 02:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65049, 1864, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice picture.</td>', 'nice picture.', '2002-06-02 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65050, 1865, 1211, '<td valign="top">Love the placement of the subject in this photo.  The colors are great.  What does he have in his hand?</td>', 'Love the placement of the subject in this photo.  The colors are great.  What does he have in his hand?', '2002-05-27 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65051, 1865, 661, '<td valign="top">Would have like the sheep (? closer?) or a dog in the photo with him.</td>', 'Would have like the sheep (? closer?) or a dog in the photo with him.', '2002-05-27 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65052, 1865, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice pix----but where''s the sheep?Are they out of focus in the background?</td>', 'Nice pix----but where''s the sheep?Are they out of focus in the background?', '2002-05-27 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65053, 1865, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  But where is his flock?  Or wait.... are YOU his flock?<br/>I like the slant of the sunshine on his face.</td>', 'Very cool.  But where is his flock?  Or wait.... are YOU his flock?I like the slant of the sunshine on his face.', '2002-05-27 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65054, 1865, 327, '<td valign="top">Love your shot. Very well done. Great light, interesting photo. Good work.</td>', 'Love your shot. Very well done. Great light, interesting photo. Good work.', '2002-05-27 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65055, 1865, 772, '<td valign="top">Where are his sheep? :))  Nice photo!</td>', 'Where are his sheep? :))  Nice photo!', '2002-05-27 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65056, 1865, 671, '<td valign="top">Good use of space to evoke a feeling of openness.</td>', 'Good use of space to evoke a feeling of openness.', '2002-05-27 23:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65057, 1865, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great composition, follows the ROT, that''s always good.  It would be a stronger picture IMO if the horizon was level and you had taken this from a lower angle and slightly further left, that way his face would''ve not been in the deep shadow.</td>', 'Great composition, follows the ROT, that''s always good.  It would be a stronger picture IMO if the horizon was level and you had taken this from a lower angle and slightly further left, that way his face would''ve not been in the deep shadow.', '2002-05-28 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65058, 1865, 1658, '<td valign="top">At first I wasn''t sure about this picture, but the more I look at it, the more I really like the context the subject is put in.  It''s a shame his hat has one of those Calvin peeing on something logos on it.</td>', 'At first I wasn''t sure about this picture, but the more I look at it, the more I really like the context the subject is put in.  It''s a shame his hat has one of those Calvin peeing on something logos on it.', '2002-05-28 11:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65059, 1865, 975, '<td valign="top">National Geographicish... I like it!</td>', 'National Geographicish... I like it!', '2002-05-28 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65060, 1865, 1446, '<td valign="top">Sure dont have backgrounds like this in Detroit!  Compositon-7 Background-9 Focus and dof-8  overall-8</td>', 'Sure dont have backgrounds like this in Detroit!  Compositon-7 Background-9 Focus and dof-8  overall-8', '2002-05-28 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65061, 1865, 1005, '<td valign="top">Almost missed the herd in the middle background, I thought they were rocks at first glance.  A little more face, more obvious herd would have been helpful.  (Curious:  What is in his hands?)<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 9 People 9 total 9</td>', 'Almost missed the herd in the middle background, I thought they were rocks at first glance.  A little more face, more obvious herd would have been helpful.  (Curious:  What is in his hands?)Photo 10 Creativity 9 People 9 total 9', '2002-05-28 15:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65062, 1865, 301, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the subject in this photo.  It allows us to see the landscape as well.  Perhaps getting a little closer and showing some detail in his face would create a more compelling image</td>', 'I like the placement of the subject in this photo.  It allows us to see the landscape as well.  Perhaps getting a little closer and showing some detail in his face would create a more compelling image', '2002-05-29 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65063, 1865, 1679, '<td valign="top">Fill-in flash would definetely improve things.</td>', 'Fill-in flash would definetely improve things.', '2002-05-29 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65064, 1865, 1585, '<td valign="top">Person looks good. Wish that the flock was closer. What''s that on his hat?</td>', 'Person looks good. Wish that the flock was closer. What''s that on his hat?', '2002-05-29 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65065, 1865, 509, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, sure to place.  Nice depth of field.  What is he holding though?  To me it takes away (only slightly) from the rustic quality of this.  Interesting hat as well.  Is that Calvin p***ing on an oldsmobile logo? (from Calvin and Hobbes - comic strip)</td>', 'This is a great photo, sure to place.  Nice depth of field.  What is he holding though?  To me it takes away (only slightly) from the rustic quality of this.  Interesting hat as well.  Is that Calvin p***ing on an oldsmobile logo? (from Calvin and Hobbes - comic strip)', '2002-05-29 19:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65066, 1865, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I love the way the light falls over the subject especially.</td>', 'Beautiful. I love the way the light falls over the subject especially.', '2002-05-30 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65067, 1865, 878, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, at first I didnt like the harsh shadows on the face but its growing on me.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, at first I didnt like the harsh shadows on the face but its growing on me.', '2002-05-30 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65068, 1865, 689, '<td valign="top">Would have been nice if he could have been closer to the animals ... they are hard to make out.</td>', 'Would have been nice if he could have been closer to the animals ... they are hard to make out.', '2002-05-31 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65069, 1865, 1325, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the subject with the broad expanse of the farm lands &amp; hills behind it but it did take me a while to decide that the sheep were there in the background.  Even though I can hardly make them out I like the colors in the photo.</td>', 'I like the placement of the subject with the broad expanse of the farm lands & hills behind it but it did take me a while to decide that the sheep were there in the background.  Even though I can hardly make them out I like the colors in the photo.', '2002-05-31 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65070, 1865, 1, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot for some reason...  The shadow on his face makes him out to be pretty mysterious... I would''ve cropped out the sky and some of the mountains.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot for some reason...  The shadow on his face makes him out to be pretty mysterious... I would''ve cropped out the sky and some of the mountains.', '2002-06-02 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65071, 1867, 661, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, nice color (red), the bottle and cup with red straw detract slightly.</td>', 'Interesting photo, nice color (red), the bottle and cup with red straw detract slightly.', '2002-05-27 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65072, 1867, 668, '<td valign="top">haha</td>', 'haha', '2002-05-27 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65073, 1867, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  The bottle is a little odd but this is nice, none-the-less... good job!</td>', 'Nice shot!  The bottle is a little odd but this is nice, none-the-less... good job!', '2002-05-27 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65074, 1867, 327, '<td valign="top">Okay she must be a saint. &amp;lt;g&amp;gt; My gosh all those pieces!! &amp;lt;g&amp;gt; Fun shot of a fun _people_.</td>', 'Okay she must be a saint. &lt;g&gt; My gosh all those pieces!! &lt;g&gt; Fun shot of a fun _people_.', '2002-05-27 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65075, 1867, 1750, '<td valign="top">Like the color in this one though it''s too dark. Skin tones is bluish. the bottle and the straw in the cup at the forground is distracting. It does show the concentration of the model quite well. Focus and separation of subject from background are quite good.</td>', 'Like the color in this one though it''s too dark. Skin tones is bluish. the bottle and the straw in the cup at the forground is distracting. It does show the concentration of the model quite well. Focus and separation of subject from background are quite good.', '2002-05-28 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65076, 1867, 1658, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, and would have given it a higher vote if the dragon puzzle had gone the other way across her front with the line of her open overalls, and the water bottle and soda hadn''t been in the bottom.  But otherwise a fun and interesting shot overall.</td>', 'I really like this shot, and would have given it a higher vote if the dragon puzzle had gone the other way across her front with the line of her open overalls, and the water bottle and soda hadn''t been in the bottom.  But otherwise a fun and interesting shot overall.', '2002-05-28 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65077, 1867, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject, caught with an expression of mixed concentration and pleasure.</td>', 'Very interesting subject, caught with an expression of mixed concentration and pleasure.', '2002-05-28 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65078, 1867, 1379, '<td valign="top">Looks like dragon is going for the soda bottle....<br/>I wish the dragon were a different color, or else the lattice behind the model were darker or something.... The final shape of the puzzle is lost in the whiteness.  Great expression of concentration!</td>', 'Looks like dragon is going for the soda bottle....I wish the dragon were a different color, or else the lattice behind the model were darker or something.... The final shape of the puzzle is lost in the whiteness.  Great expression of concentration!', '2002-05-28 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65079, 1867, 811, '<td valign="top">Would it have been possible to get another angle/cropping so that the drink, etc. didn''t show?</td>', 'Would it have been possible to get another angle/cropping so that the drink, etc. didn''t show?', '2002-05-28 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65080, 1867, 1005, '<td valign="top">The dragon is eating the water bottle, save the water!  Nearly great!  Stand up and shoot over the junk in the foreground and this would have been a 10.  Good focus, color, subject interest.  Keep up the good work, w/o the obscuring stuff.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 9 total 9</td>', 'The dragon is eating the water bottle, save the water!  Nearly great!  Stand up and shoot over the junk in the foreground and this would have been a 10.  Good focus, color, subject interest.  Keep up the good work, w/o the obscuring stuff.Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 9 total 9', '2002-05-29 12:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65081, 1867, 885, '<td valign="top">I do wish that the soda bottle and soda cup weren''t there.</td>', 'I do wish that the soda bottle and soda cup weren''t there.', '2002-05-29 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65082, 1867, 1, '<td valign="top">Interesting, the reds are nice, I dont'' like the green grass in the back or the bottle in the front blocking the dragon''s mouth.</td>', 'Interesting, the reds are nice, I dont'' like the green grass in the back or the bottle in the front blocking the dragon''s mouth.', '2002-06-02 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65083, 1867, 368, '<td valign="top">Hey everyone ... i just shot this pic like the day before it was due ... didnt really think about it and wanted to see what the site is all about - so it''s all good :o) .. My friend was working on that puzzle and i figured it went well with the challenge of not being able to control the final outcome of the image - since she was moving around and completing the puzzle ....<br/>I love all the comments and can''t wait to see more as I submit images in the future :o)</td>', 'Hey everyone ... i just shot this pic like the day before it was due ... didnt really think about it and wanted to see what the site is all about - so it''s all good :o) .. My friend was working on that puzzle and i figured it went well with the challenge of not being able to control the final outcome of the image - since she was moving around and completing the puzzle ....I love all the comments and can''t wait to see more as I submit images in the future :o)', '2002-06-08 12:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
