(65094, 1869, 327, '<td valign="top">O my gosh....this is so good. Your don''t know how that is my nightmare- mine and millions of others too. What a good job. The b&amp;w is perfect for this shot. Well done.<br/>Spooky _people_.</td>', 'O my gosh....this is so good. Your don''t know how that is my nightmare- mine and millions of others too. What a good job. The b&w is perfect for this shot. Well done.Spooky _people_.', '2002-05-27 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65095, 1869, 671, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, and not enough going on visually.  Also, the "people" aspect of this shot is minimal.  The emphasis is on the knife, ot the person.</td>', 'A little grainy, and not enough going on visually.  Also, the "people" aspect of this shot is minimal.  The emphasis is on the knife, ot the person.', '2002-05-27 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65096, 1869, 741, '<td valign="top">I love the brooding menace in this shot.  Diagonal shower curtain sets it off and the highlight on the knife is great.</td>', 'I love the brooding menace in this shot.  Diagonal shower curtain sets it off and the highlight on the knife is great.', '2002-05-28 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65097, 1869, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat photo!  I think the knife really stands out well and offers the same sense of impending doom as the movie did :)  Good job!</td>', 'This is a neat photo!  I think the knife really stands out well and offers the same sense of impending doom as the movie did :)  Good job!', '2002-05-28 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65098, 1869, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot.  I see the "person", but barely.  The knife shows up O.K., but I would think A more shiny knife or more light on the knife would have worked better.  If you had an opening in the shower curtain or a more transparent curtain, this might have worked better.  The victim is too understated.<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 9 People 5 total 6 (sorry, but as people was the challenge, I had to weight it more heavily.)</td>', 'This is an interesting shot.  I see the "person", but barely.  The knife shows up O.K., but I would think A more shiny knife or more light on the knife would have worked better.  If you had an opening in the shower curtain or a more transparent curtain, this might have worked better.  The victim is too understated.Photo 8 Creativity 9 People 5 total 6 (sorry, but as people was the challenge, I had to weight it more heavily.)', '2002-05-28 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65099, 1869, 255, '<td valign="top">what, no blood? ;) almost didn''t see the poor sucker in the shower. great idea, if a little grainy--but that kinda works for this picture.</td>', 'what, no blood? ;) almost didn''t see the poor sucker in the shower. great idea, if a little grainy--but that kinda works for this picture.', '2002-05-28 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65100, 1869, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love this!  excellet composition!</td>', 'i love this!  excellet composition!', '2002-05-28 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65101, 1869, 1, '<td valign="top">Odd angle, great idea.  The inclusion of the pants was a good idea, but not well pulled off.  Maybe less pants, or more aperture to include the pants in the focus?</td>', 'Odd angle, great idea.  The inclusion of the pants was a good idea, but not well pulled off.  Maybe less pants, or more aperture to include the pants in the focus?', '2002-05-28 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
