(65103, 1869, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, not quite what I expected for this challenge (cute babies, and smiling old folks)!  I almost missed the person behind the shower curtain, would there have been a way to increase the contrast?  Also, the whole picture is somewhat grainy and more shades of gray than b&amp;w.  Still, interesting take on things and nice composition.</td>', 'Hehehe, not quite what I expected for this challenge (cute babies, and smiling old folks)!  I almost missed the person behind the shower curtain, would there have been a way to increase the contrast?  Also, the whole picture is somewhat grainy and more shades of gray than b&w.  Still, interesting take on things and nice composition.', '2002-05-28 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65104, 1869, 332, '<td valign="top">The idea is great :)</td>', 'The idea is great :)', '2002-05-28 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65105, 1869, 1042, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this more if you could see the image of the woman a little clearer through the curtain...not crystal clear but just slightly more.  I like the angle and the grainy effect and I''ve had to come back and up my vote for this a little after studying it...nice job</td>', 'I think I would have liked this more if you could see the image of the woman a little clearer through the curtain...not crystal clear but just slightly more.  I like the angle and the grainy effect and I''ve had to come back and up my vote for this a little after studying it...nice job', '2002-05-29 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
