(65108, 1869, 312, '<td valign="top">i like this shot. i think it would be better if you could see more of the sillhouette of the person in the shower, though. as it is i didn''t even realize someone was in there until i looked at this shot a few times. i think it would break up the negative space that is the shower curtain and add more suspense to the shot. great concept, though, and the b&amp;w is a good touch.</td>', 'i like this shot. i think it would be better if you could see more of the sillhouette of the person in the shower, though. as it is i didn''t even realize someone was in there until i looked at this shot a few times. i think it would break up the negative space that is the shower curtain and add more suspense to the shot. great concept, though, and the b&w is a good touch.', '2002-05-30 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65109, 1869, 737, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I would have liked just a little more body behind the curtain. Some folks may miss it.</td>', 'Good shot. I would have liked just a little more body behind the curtain. Some folks may miss it.', '2002-05-30 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65110, 1869, 1031, '<td valign="top">This is one of those one''s I don''t really "like" but is well done -- very creepy. Maybe the only thing I''d try to do is avoid the bright hightlights on the curtain, leaving the blade as the only element with a pure white.</td>', 'This is one of those one''s I don''t really "like" but is well done -- very creepy. Maybe the only thing I''d try to do is avoid the bright hightlights on the curtain, leaving the blade as the only element with a pure white.', '2002-05-30 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
