(65112, 1869, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, very dramatic. I didn''t even notice this one as a thumbnail, it just surprised me :). Looks like you used some heavy despeckle to get rid of the graininess... I don''t mind that look though. It''s neat how the longer I look at it, the more I notice the outlines of the person behind the shower curtain. Perhaps a bit of backlighting in there would have helped make it a bit less subtle though. Or more contrast?</td>', 'Wow, very dramatic. I didn''t even notice this one as a thumbnail, it just surprised me :). Looks like you used some heavy despeckle to get rid of the graininess... I don''t mind that look though. It''s neat how the longer I look at it, the more I notice the outlines of the person behind the shower curtain. Perhaps a bit of backlighting in there would have helped make it a bit less subtle though. Or more contrast?', '2002-05-31 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65113, 1869, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and subject, however for the people challenge not so nice.  This shot would of ruled in the BW challenge.  You dont get a clear view of a person in this shot.</td>', 'Nice shot and subject, however for the people challenge not so nice.  This shot would of ruled in the BW challenge.  You dont get a clear view of a person in this shot.', '2002-05-31 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
