(65158, 1874, 811, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of great pictures in this one.  A zoom of just the little girls in the stroller, or a close up of the little boy would have also made an interesting picture.  I think this shot may have been good in black and white, but I really like the bright colors as well.</td>', 'There are a lot of great pictures in this one.  A zoom of just the little girls in the stroller, or a close up of the little boy would have also made an interesting picture.  I think this shot may have been good in black and white, but I really like the bright colors as well.', '2002-05-28 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65159, 1874, 1379, '<td valign="top">Dads on parade!  The way the two little girls are looking at each other is priceless!  It looks like such fun... sitting beside a friend, being strolled around town with the breeze on your face....</td>', 'Dads on parade!  The way the two little girls are looking at each other is priceless!  It looks like such fun... sitting beside a friend, being strolled around town with the breeze on your face....', '2002-05-28 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65160, 1874, 1357, '<td valign="top">A good photo. Maybe your title should`ve been fancy a race ?</td>', 'A good photo. Maybe your title should`ve been fancy a race ?', '2002-05-29 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65161, 1874, 301, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty interesting photo.  I like the idea of fathers taking the kids for a walk.  Shame about the blue and white pole in the background.  Focus doesn''t seem to be exactly right to me.</td>', 'This is a pretty interesting photo.  I like the idea of fathers taking the kids for a walk.  Shame about the blue and white pole in the background.  Focus doesn''t seem to be exactly right to me.', '2002-05-29 04:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65162, 1874, 1005, '<td valign="top">Almost sharp, can''t tell where exactly the focus is, but not quite on the subjects, especially near man''s face.  Did he move too much?  Try faster exposure, if possible, or zoom in on the little girls, your main subject.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8</td>', 'Almost sharp, can''t tell where exactly the focus is, but not quite on the subjects, especially near man''s face.  Did he move too much?  Try faster exposure, if possible, or zoom in on the little girls, your main subject.Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-29 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65163, 1874, 1599, '<td valign="top">really</td>', 'really', '2002-05-29 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65164, 1874, 1907, '<td valign="top">hahahaha!</td>', 'hahahaha!', '2002-05-30 02:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65165, 1874, 1, '<td valign="top">Panning or a faster shutter speed could fix the very noticable blur.</td>', 'Panning or a faster shutter speed could fix the very noticable blur.', '2002-05-30 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65166, 1874, 1031, '<td valign="top">Wish they lived in my neighborhood! Has a really nice "feel" to it.</td>', 'Wish they lived in my neighborhood! Has a really nice "feel" to it.', '2002-06-01 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65167, 1874, 637, '<td valign="top">I see it as a snapshot, not a photograph... Where''s the creativity?<br/></td>', 'I see it as a snapshot, not a photograph... Where''s the creativity?', '2002-06-02 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65168, 1874, 441, '<td valign="top">good happy image</td>', 'good happy image', '2002-06-02 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65169, 1876, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice focus, I like the background fading.</td>', 'Nice focus, I like the background fading.', '2002-05-27 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65170, 1876, 327, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the young girl, the woman behind her is a distraction. Still I love the color of the toy, the shirt, her skin---and the hair movement is super!! Well done.<br/></td>', 'Good shot of the young girl, the woman behind her is a distraction. Still I love the color of the toy, the shirt, her skin---and the hair movement is super!! Well done.', '2002-05-27 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65171, 1876, 772, '<td valign="top">Interestin shot.. I wish I could tell what she is holding in her hand :)</td>', 'Interestin shot.. I wish I could tell what she is holding in her hand :)', '2002-05-27 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65172, 1876, 1750, '<td valign="top">Having the beautiful child in the foreground is a good contrast to the lighter background. Unfortunately the background is also too busy to be suitable for a portrait. Her face needs fill flash.</td>', 'Having the beautiful child in the foreground is a good contrast to the lighter background. Unfortunately the background is also too busy to be suitable for a portrait. Her face needs fill flash.', '2002-05-28 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65173, 1876, 1520, '<td valign="top">Argh, too bad about that person in the chair is there!</td>', 'Argh, too bad about that person in the chair is there!', '2002-05-28 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65174, 1876, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the girl, but a VERY busy background.  I wish I could offer helpful suggestions, but the photo itself is very good.  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8</td>', 'Good capture of the girl, but a VERY busy background.  I wish I could offer helpful suggestions, but the photo itself is very good.  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8', '2002-05-28 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65175, 1876, 1717, '<td valign="top">nice color and composition.</td>', 'nice color and composition.', '2002-05-28 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65176, 1876, 1379, '<td valign="top">What an interesting-looking kid!  I like her slim brown arm compared to that thick white leg behind her.  She looks surprised that you snapped her.  Great expression!</td>', 'What an interesting-looking kid!  I like her slim brown arm compared to that thick white leg behind her.  She looks surprised that you snapped her.  Great expression!', '2002-05-28 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65177, 1876, 205, '<td valign="top">your title is way wrong</td>', 'your title is way wrong', '2002-05-28 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65178, 1876, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of that girl, but the other girl being behind her kind of makes it look like she has 2 tone hair and another arm coming out of her back.  Not an ideal background.</td>', 'Nice capture of that girl, but the other girl being behind her kind of makes it look like she has 2 tone hair and another arm coming out of her back.  Not an ideal background.', '2002-05-29 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65179, 1876, 255, '<td valign="top">nice catch-- i really like the framing, the DOP and the focus on the little girl. good shot.</td>', 'nice catch-- i really like the framing, the DOP and the focus on the little girl. good shot.', '2002-05-29 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65180, 1876, 301, '<td valign="top">I think this may have worked better in portrait rather than landscape.  Would have been nicer without the woman seated in the background too.</td>', 'I think this may have worked better in portrait rather than landscape.  Would have been nicer without the woman seated in the background too.', '2002-05-29 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65181, 1876, 573, '<td valign="top">This is only a snapshot, I feel that there was not much thought that went into this image.</td>', 'This is only a snapshot, I feel that there was not much thought that went into this image.', '2002-05-30 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65182, 1876, 1679, '<td valign="top">Nice, although the woman (and especially her legs) just behind the girl destructs from the girl and its expression.</td>', 'Nice, although the woman (and especially her legs) just behind the girl destructs from the girl and its expression.', '2002-05-30 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65183, 1876, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like the way you caught  this girl in motion.</td>', 'I really like the way you caught  this girl in motion.', '2002-05-31 04:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65184, 1876, 878, '<td valign="top">This is a little busy and its a little distracting with someone directly behind the one person.  If there was nobody behind her I would of liked this shot much more. <br/><br/></td>', 'This is a little busy and its a little distracting with someone directly behind the one person.  If there was nobody behind her I would of liked this shot much more. ', '2002-05-31 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65185, 1876, 811, '<td valign="top">Two more steps and the people wouldn''t be lined up like they are.  Interesting expression, and I like how the background is blurry, it forces focus to the front of the picture.</td>', 'Two more steps and the people wouldn''t be lined up like they are.  Interesting expression, and I like how the background is blurry, it forces focus to the front of the picture.', '2002-05-31 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65186, 1876, 1617, '<td valign="top">I have to give this ten because it is me.</td>', 'I have to give this ten because it is me.', '2002-06-01 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65187, 1877, 1211, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, otherwise great shot.</td>', 'A little grainy, otherwise great shot.', '2002-05-27 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65188, 1877, 1175, '<td valign="top">Nothing in this photo seems to go with the title.  How do I know he''s a band manager?  What''s wrong with him? Is he upset or is he looking at something in his hands?  Other than these questions I don''t get anything out of the picture.</td>', 'Nothing in this photo seems to go with the title.  How do I know he''s a band manager?  What''s wrong with him? Is he upset or is he looking at something in his hands?  Other than these questions I don''t get anything out of the picture.', '2002-05-27 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65189, 1877, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like this one - the colours, the lighting, the great wrinkles and expressiveness of the man''s face, the angle of the hat, his stance. The composition is maybe a little bit awkward, but otherwise it''s great.</td>', 'I really like this one - the colours, the lighting, the great wrinkles and expressiveness of the man''s face, the angle of the hat, his stance. The composition is maybe a little bit awkward, but otherwise it''s great.', '2002-05-27 03:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65190, 1877, 1379, '<td valign="top">The hat with the fleecy jacket is too funny!  This guy seems to take himself very seriously.</td>', 'The hat with the fleecy jacket is too funny!  This guy seems to take himself very seriously.', '2002-05-27 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65191, 1877, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting, clean, clear shot. Good work here.</td>', 'Interesting, clean, clear shot. Good work here.', '2002-05-27 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65192, 1877, 1061, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2002-05-27 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65193, 1877, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait!  This is very well composed and framed... I particularly like the washed out white background... good work!</td>', 'Nice portrait!  This is very well composed and framed... I particularly like the washed out white background... good work!', '2002-05-28 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65194, 1877, 773, '<td valign="top">I really like the dark hat and coat against the white background.  Nice shot!</td>', 'I really like the dark hat and coat against the white background.  Nice shot!', '2002-05-28 15:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65195, 1877, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I''d like to see a version of this in B&amp;W or sepia.</td>', 'Very nice... I''d like to see a version of this in B&W or sepia.', '2002-05-28 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65196, 1877, 1759, '<td valign="top">Something about this shot really conveys mood. Nice pose and decent lighting.</td>', 'Something about this shot really conveys mood. Nice pose and decent lighting.', '2002-05-28 21:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65197, 1877, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot.  The white bricks are a bit distracting, partial visibility and all.  Is he looking down because he works for a bad band or lost a gig?  Why is he sad?<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8</td>', 'Pretty good shot.  The white bricks are a bit distracting, partial visibility and all.  Is he looking down because he works for a bad band or lost a gig?  Why is he sad?Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-29 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65198, 1877, 255, '<td valign="top">this would have made a great B&amp;W. as is, it is nice, if a little too light? . i like the composition and mood, though.</td>', 'this would have made a great B&W. as is, it is nice, if a little too light? . i like the composition and mood, though.', '2002-05-29 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65199, 1877, 674, '<td valign="top">I found this technically quite good but rather cold</td>', 'I found this technically quite good but rather cold', '2002-05-29 00:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65200, 1877, 301, '<td valign="top">A good portrait photo.  Nicely composed and lit.  For some reason I keep thinking there is something missing ... perhaps a story behind it ... something to justify the drooped shoulders, head down, altogether defensive and depressed look.  Maybe that''s just the way he is :)</td>', 'A good portrait photo.  Nicely composed and lit.  For some reason I keep thinking there is something missing ... perhaps a story behind it ... something to justify the drooped shoulders, head down, altogether defensive and depressed look.  Maybe that''s just the way he is :)', '2002-05-29 05:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65201, 1877, 1325, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness of the background compared to his clothing and face.  Excellent.</td>', 'I like the starkness of the background compared to his clothing and face.  Excellent.', '2002-05-29 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65202, 1877, 1679, '<td valign="top">I think the flesh tones have seen better days.</td>', 'I think the flesh tones have seen better days.', '2002-05-29 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65203, 1877, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the white background.  The expression is pretty interesting, too.</td>', 'I like the white background.  The expression is pretty interesting, too.', '2002-05-30 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65204, 1877, 1750, '<td valign="top">Yes! Your subject''s mood comes across very well.</td>', 'Yes! Your subject''s mood comes across very well.', '2002-06-02 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65205, 1879, 772, '<td valign="top">This type of photo is not allowed.... OK.. I thought this photo would be disqualified... let me re-comment... I definitely don''t understand how it was done and I''m puzzled by the lack of clarity and sharpness.  It''s possibly from a lower end camera maybe?  I would score higher if I really liked the impressoin given by the image but I''m not quite sure that I like the overall impact.  Whatever you did here is definitely creative!</td>', 'This type of photo is not allowed.... OK.. I thought this photo would be disqualified... let me re-comment... I definitely don''t understand how it was done and I''m puzzled by the lack of clarity and sharpness.  It''s possibly from a lower end camera maybe?  I would score higher if I really liked the impressoin given by the image but I''m not quite sure that I like the overall impact.  Whatever you did here is definitely creative!', '2002-05-27 01:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65206, 1879, 1581, '<td valign="top">altered a tad?</td>', 'altered a tad?', '2002-05-27 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65207, 1879, 1360, '<td valign="top">How is this not photoshopped?<br/><br/>If it''s not, i wanna know how it was done!</td>', 'How is this not photoshopped?If it''s not, i wanna know how it was done!', '2002-05-27 02:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65208, 1879, 1831, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Took me a while to figure it out. Great idea.</td>', 'Very clever. Took me a while to figure it out. Great idea.', '2002-05-27 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65209, 1879, 1211, '<td valign="top">Ok, how''d you do it? :)</td>', 'Ok, how''d you do it? :)', '2002-05-27 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65210, 1879, 142, '<td valign="top">Since this isn''t photoshoped,  great effect.  You have to share with us your method in creating this photo.  Good job.</td>', 'Since this isn''t photoshoped,  great effect.  You have to share with us your method in creating this photo.  Good job.', '2002-05-27 06:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65211, 1879, 509, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m impressed.  I think this would fit even better with the challenge if the faces conveyed different emotions.  I don''t know if that would be possible, but without the administrator note, I don''t know how the picture as it is is possible!</td>', 'Wow, I''m impressed.  I think this would fit even better with the challenge if the faces conveyed different emotions.  I don''t know if that would be possible, but without the administrator note, I don''t know how the picture as it is is possible!', '2002-05-27 17:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65212, 1879, 1454, '<td valign="top">Hi! how did you do it??</td>', 'Hi! how did you do it??', '2002-05-27 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65213, 1879, 686, '<td valign="top">How''d you get this shot?</td>', 'How''d you get this shot?', '2002-05-27 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65214, 1879, 47, '<td valign="top">Administrator Note: This effect was not acheived in post-processing. Please cast your vote accordingly.<br/><br/>yeah ? it still sucks.</td>', 'Administrator Note: This effect was not acheived in post-processing. Please cast your vote accordingly.yeah ? it still sucks.', '2002-05-27 19:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65215, 1879, 327, '<td valign="top">Poster? Different and affective. Creative work.</td>', 'Poster? Different and affective. Creative work.', '2002-05-27 20:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65216, 1879, 806, '<td valign="top">I''d really like to know what camera you have, and how you did this....</td>', 'I''d really like to know what camera you have, and how you did this....', '2002-05-27 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65217, 1879, 430, '<td valign="top">how u do that?<br/>please advice<br/>thank you!</td>', 'how u do that?please advicethank you!', '2002-05-27 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65218, 1879, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, it''s great that this photo was reinstated. I''d love to find out how it was done. It seems out of focus or low resolution, but since my photos are all like that too, I''m aware it could just be a low end camera. It has too much artistic merit to penalise it for that.</td>', 'Wow, it''s great that this photo was reinstated. I''d love to find out how it was done. It seems out of focus or low resolution, but since my photos are all like that too, I''m aware it could just be a low end camera. It has too much artistic merit to penalise it for that.', '2002-05-28 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65219, 1879, 741, '<td valign="top">Look forward to reading your "How do they do that" article :)  I like the effect on what I''m taking to be the real face (I assume the others are pictures) but I think the lighting might be a bit _too_ contrasty./  Less highlight and less shadow may have improved it (or may have ruined the shot - I can''t decide)</td>', 'Look forward to reading your "How do they do that" article :)  I like the effect on what I''m taking to be the real face (I assume the others are pictures) but I think the lighting might be a bit _too_ contrasty./  Less highlight and less shadow may have improved it (or may have ruined the shot - I can''t decide)', '2002-05-28 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65220, 1879, 1750, '<td valign="top">For someone to produce this result without digital manipulation shows real talent or real luck. In either case it''s still a quality image.</td>', 'For someone to produce this result without digital manipulation shows real talent or real luck. In either case it''s still a quality image.', '2002-05-28 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65221, 1879, 1569, '<td valign="top">Really neat photo. The center eye is over exposed.Try putting a dryer sheet over the flash.Experiment with howmany folds it takes to get the right look.</td>', 'Really neat photo. The center eye is over exposed.Try putting a dryer sheet over the flash.Experiment with howmany folds it takes to get the right look.', '2002-05-28 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65222, 1879, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m very curious how you did that - it''s way cool.  Start writing your contribution to the "How''d they do that???" section.  Would there have been a way to improve the focus a little?  Everything seems just a little blurred.</td>', 'I''m very curious how you did that - it''s way cool.  Start writing your contribution to the "How''d they do that???" section.  Would there have been a way to improve the focus a little?  Everything seems just a little blurred.', '2002-05-28 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65223, 1879, 656, '<td valign="top">Very effective overlays - you''ll have to show us how you did this later!<br/><br/>I like the almost bruise-like colours of the copies</td>', 'Very effective overlays - you''ll have to show us how you did this later!I like the almost bruise-like colours of the copies', '2002-05-28 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65224, 1879, 301, '<td valign="top">no idea how you''ve achieved this ... definitely one for the ''How''d They Do That'' section.  Very arty and very Big Brother.  Seems to me like the main image isn''t quite focused properly.</td>', 'no idea how you''ve achieved this ... definitely one for the ''How''d They Do That'' section.  Very arty and very Big Brother.  Seems to me like the main image isn''t quite focused properly.', '2002-05-28 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65225, 1879, 907, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2002-05-28 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65226, 1879, 1520, '<td valign="top">Yikes....this one looks like a lot of work!!!<br/></td>', 'Yikes....this one looks like a lot of work!!!', '2002-05-28 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65227, 1879, 1680, '<td valign="top">nice concept.  i love photos of eyes.  how did you do that.</td>', 'nice concept.  i love photos of eyes.  how did you do that.', '2002-05-28 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65228, 1879, 156, '<td valign="top">this is wild, i can''t wait to find out how you did it...altho i wish you''d looked directly at the camera instead of up at it, the white showing below the iris makes you look eeeeevil!</td>', 'this is wild, i can''t wait to find out how you did it...altho i wish you''d looked directly at the camera instead of up at it, the white showing below the iris makes you look eeeeevil!', '2002-05-28 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65229, 1879, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and interesting effect. How did you do this? (Inquiring minds what to know)</td>', 'Very artistic and interesting effect. How did you do this? (Inquiring minds what to know)', '2002-05-28 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65230, 1879, 773, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes, but I would have liked to see a whole face.  Creative, but not my idea of "people".</td>', 'Nice eyes, but I would have liked to see a whole face.  Creative, but not my idea of "people".', '2002-05-28 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65231, 1879, 1175, '<td valign="top">Now that the message was posted I can see how this was done not using post-processing, at least I think.  You took a picture of a picture except for one area in the middle to the right.  While I think this is very creative and I really do like the picture, I feel it is inappropriate for a site that focuses on raw photography.</td>', 'Now that the message was posted I can see how this was done not using post-processing, at least I think.  You took a picture of a picture except for one area in the middle to the right.  While I think this is very creative and I really do like the picture, I feel it is inappropriate for a site that focuses on raw photography.', '2002-05-28 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65232, 1879, 737, '<td valign="top">High score for creativity. In my top 5.</td>', 'High score for creativity. In my top 5.', '2002-05-28 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65233, 1879, 1379, '<td valign="top">Interesting, with the administrator''s note and everything....  So is this a collage that you made in the real (non-digital) world?<br/><br/>All the eyes are nice and brooding, the way I like them.  Do they belong to a vampire or something?<br/>:-)</td>', 'Interesting, with the administrator''s note and everything....  So is this a collage that you made in the real (non-digital) world?All the eyes are nice and brooding, the way I like them.  Do they belong to a vampire or something?:-)', '2002-05-28 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(65234, 1879, 205, '<td valign="top">It wasn''t?!?!?</td>', 'It wasn''t?!?!?', '2002-05-28 22:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65235, 1879, 757, '<td valign="top">very interesting effect for it not to be digitally enhanced.</td>', 'very interesting effect for it not to be digitally enhanced.', '2002-05-28 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65236, 1879, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very interesting, admin note was helpful, but I was pretty certain this shot was taken as seen.  I think I would have liked the lighting move even (but not the same), but a little less harsh on the left and just a little brighter on the right.  <br/>Next is a nit against several somewhat similar shots:  the challenge was people, eyes are a small part of people, so you get a small part of people score.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 10 ++++ (lots of extra credit here)  People 2 (you lost the extra credit here)  total 7  (most partials got under 5 from me)</td>', 'Very interesting, admin note was helpful, but I was pretty certain this shot was taken as seen.  I think I would have liked the lighting move even (but not the same), but a little less harsh on the left and just a little brighter on the right.  Next is a nit against several somewhat similar shots:  the challenge was people, eyes are a small part of people, so you get a small part of people score.Photo 9 Creativity 10 ++++ (lots of extra credit here)  People 2 (you lost the extra credit here)  total 7  (most partials got under 5 from me)', '2002-05-29 14:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65237, 1879, 1446, '<td valign="top">wow, I feel like I am being watched.  Interesting colors and textures achieved here. Obviously you put a lot of time and effort into this project.  The harsh lighting on the "real" face seems pretty harsh to me.</td>', 'wow, I feel like I am being watched.  Interesting colors and textures achieved here. Obviously you put a lot of time and effort into this project.  The harsh lighting on the "real" face seems pretty harsh to me.', '2002-05-29 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65238, 1879, 1681, '<td valign="top">Anxious to hear how this was done in-camera.  Might have scored it a little higher if central image was more in focus.</td>', 'Anxious to hear how this was done in-camera.  Might have scored it a little higher if central image was more in focus.', '2002-05-29 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65239, 1879, 587, '<td valign="top">Can''t wait to find out how you achieved this, but the photo itself doesn''t do "it" for me, the way I interpreted this challenge was ''people'' not peoples parts, sorry.</td>', 'Can''t wait to find out how you achieved this, but the photo itself doesn''t do "it" for me, the way I interpreted this challenge was ''people'' not peoples parts, sorry.', '2002-05-29 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65240, 1879, 885, '<td valign="top">I will be waiting to see how you did this.  I''m sure if sounds pretty snooty...but it really looks so much like a digitally manipulated photo montage type of thing, that even if it isn''t, I''m not sure how much I like it as a photograph.  Maybe I''m just sore that I couldn''t do this though.</td>', 'I will be waiting to see how you did this.  I''m sure if sounds pretty snooty...but it really looks so much like a digitally manipulated photo montage type of thing, that even if it isn''t, I''m not sure how much I like it as a photograph.  Maybe I''m just sore that I couldn''t do this though.', '2002-05-29 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65241, 1879, 1009, '<td valign="top">Incredible...!</td>', 'Incredible...!', '2002-05-29 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65242, 1879, 1679, '<td valign="top">Nice one. Now, if only the eyes were in better focus.....<br/>The eyes and the eyebrws seem are blurred. Also, there are washed out highlights over one of the eyes, while the other is too dark.<br/>That''s a nice effect you have achieved though. Did you use some kind of filter?</td>', 'Nice one. Now, if only the eyes were in better focus.....The eyes and the eyebrws seem are blurred. Also, there are washed out highlights over one of the eyes, while the other is too dark.That''s a nice effect you have achieved though. Did you use some kind of filter?', '2002-05-29 19:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65243, 1879, 1024, '<td valign="top">This makes a strong visual statement.  Intriguing photograph.</td>', 'This makes a strong visual statement.  Intriguing photograph.', '2002-05-30 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65244, 1879, 1078, '<td valign="top">It''s funny to me that people assume this has been edited.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s a very clever idea.  Bu all I need to see is that glare on the cardstock or whatever you used that''s above the right eye to know the basics of how this was done.  (Either that or you''re good enough to think of that and then fake it.)<br/><br/>Personally, I want a little more light on the left eye and a little less on the eyebrow above the right.  I also want that focus to be really sharp -- especially on the right, central eye.</td>', 'It''s funny to me that people assume this has been edited.  Don''t get me wrong, it''s a very clever idea.  Bu all I need to see is that glare on the cardstock or whatever you used that''s above the right eye to know the basics of how this was done.  (Either that or you''re good enough to think of that and then fake it.)Personally, I want a little more light on the left eye and a little less on the eyebrow above the right.  I also want that focus to be really sharp -- especially on the right, central eye.', '2002-05-30 11:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65245, 1879, 573, '<td valign="top">The Eyes have it.  I like your use of abstraction/realism and lighting to draw the viewers attention to the center of the photograph.</td>', 'The Eyes have it.  I like your use of abstraction/realism and lighting to draw the viewers attention to the center of the photograph.', '2002-05-30 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65246, 1879, 878, '<td valign="top">Wild effect, the main shot is a little blurred but that may be caused by how you shot this interesting photo.</td>', 'Wild effect, the main shot is a little blurred but that may be caused by how you shot this interesting photo.', '2002-05-30 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65247, 1879, 718, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it, since when is there administrative notes, and how did the administrator know that this was not achieved post-process? Isn''t this supposed to be non biased.  I don''t like the way you are steering people to vote this picture high. It just doesn''t seem rignt.  Pictures should be voted on face-value!</td>', 'I don''t get it, since when is there administrative notes, and how did the administrator know that this was not achieved post-process? Isn''t this supposed to be non biased.  I don''t like the way you are steering people to vote this picture high. It just doesn''t seem rignt.  Pictures should be voted on face-value!', '2002-05-30 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65248, 1879, 1031, '<td valign="top">"Eye" give up! Hope you''ll post a tutorial later...</td>', '"Eye" give up! Hope you''ll post a tutorial later...', '2002-06-01 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65249, 1879, 811, '<td valign="top">I can''t wait to see how you did this.  Very effective -- has a "big brother is watching you" feeling to it.</td>', 'I can''t wait to see how you did this.  Very effective -- has a "big brother is watching you" feeling to it.', '2002-06-01 22:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65250, 1879, 1, '<td valign="top">Coloration is pretty bad on this, as is the lighting.  Why is there so much light on the left of his real eyes and not the right?</td>', 'Coloration is pretty bad on this, as is the lighting.  Why is there so much light on the left of his real eyes and not the right?', '2002-06-02 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65251, 1879, 1066, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments folks....<br/><br/>I agree with people who mentioned the sharpness of the image.  I put this photo through another round of sharpening at 200% and .5 pixels and gained quite a bit of clarity without screwing the egdes up too bad.<br/><br/>This was an experimentation and the lighting effect coming from behind the photo was a nice surprise.  Probably why I got caught offgaurd on the clarity..I was so struck by what the lighting did and liked it so much I didn''t want to screw with the photo too much:-)<br/><br/>I wrote a "how did they do that" article for drew and langdon and there is some interesting stuff in there as well regarding architectural inspired art.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments folks....I agree with people who mentioned the sharpness of the image.  I put this photo through another round of sharpening at 200% and .5 pixels and gained quite a bit of clarity without screwing the egdes up too bad.This was an experimentation and the lighting effect coming from behind the photo was a nice surprise.  Probably why I got caught offgaurd on the clarity..I was so struck by what the lighting did and liked it so much I didn''t want to screw with the photo too much:-)I wrote a "how did they do that" article for drew and langdon and there is some interesting stuff in there as well regarding architectural inspired art.', '2002-06-03 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65252, 1881, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of action and audience!</td>', 'Nice mix of action and audience!', '2002-05-27 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65253, 1881, 47, '<td valign="top">ahahah, nice</td>', 'ahahah, nice', '2002-05-27 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65254, 1881, 327, '<td valign="top">Hey looks like fun. Great color, bit OOF but a fun shot.</td>', 'Hey looks like fun. Great color, bit OOF but a fun shot.', '2002-05-27 20:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65255, 1881, 741, '<td valign="top">I know that you were always going to get blur on the guy in the air - I like it and it would have spoiled the shot to freeze him.  However it would improve the picture a lot if the people on the ground were sharp.  Trying to judge the exposure by looking at the guy who is moving I''m guessing trhat this is caused by camera shake rather than the people moving.</td>', 'I know that you were always going to get blur on the guy in the air - I like it and it would have spoiled the shot to freeze him.  However it would improve the picture a lot if the people on the ground were sharp.  Trying to judge the exposure by looking at the guy who is moving I''m guessing trhat this is caused by camera shake rather than the people moving.', '2002-05-28 02:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65256, 1881, 772, '<td valign="top">nice shot!  The focus is a little soft but the impact of this photo is very nice!  Good job!</td>', 'nice shot!  The focus is a little soft but the impact of this photo is very nice!  Good job!', '2002-05-28 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65257, 1881, 1446, '<td valign="top">great timing on this shot.</td>', 'great timing on this shot.', '2002-05-28 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65258, 1881, 281, '<td valign="top">try a faster shutter speed</td>', 'try a faster shutter speed', '2002-05-28 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65259, 1881, 1005, '<td valign="top">VERY nicely done.  Stopped enough motion to show subject clearly, but left enough to WOW!  Helpers didn''t fair as well, but got not suggestions to improve that, so WELL DONE.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 9 People 10 total 10</td>', 'VERY nicely done.  Stopped enough motion to show subject clearly, but left enough to WOW!  Helpers didn''t fair as well, but got not suggestions to improve that, so WELL DONE.Photo 9 Creativity 9 People 10 total 10', '2002-05-29 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65260, 1881, 1009, '<td valign="top">Whoa... call the medics.</td>', 'Whoa... call the medics.', '2002-05-29 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65261, 1881, 1024, '<td valign="top">The background is rather busy, but I do not see how you could have avoided that</td>', 'The background is rather busy, but I do not see how you could have avoided that', '2002-05-30 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65262, 1881, 689, '<td valign="top">Not focused on the group and seems to have a little movement to it too</td>', 'Not focused on the group and seems to have a little movement to it too', '2002-05-31 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65263, 1881, 811, '<td valign="top">The "intent" of this picture is awesome.  Great capture of action.  The fuzzy feeling, though, leaves a little to be desired.  Faster shutter, if possible?  <br/>Hope he made it.</td>', 'The "intent" of this picture is awesome.  Great capture of action.  The fuzzy feeling, though, leaves a little to be desired.  Faster shutter, if possible?  Hope he made it.', '2002-06-01 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65264, 1881, 1031, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t "upside-down" last week? Nice action shot.</td>', 'Wasn''t "upside-down" last week? Nice action shot.', '2002-06-01 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65265, 1881, 1750, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. The colors add plenty of interest without overwhelming the jumper.</td>', 'Great action shot. The colors add plenty of interest without overwhelming the jumper.', '2002-06-02 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65266, 1882, 661, '<td valign="top">Hope you either ran fast after taking this picture or asked very politely before you took the picture.  He looks like he could have a nasty temper.</td>', 'Hope you either ran fast after taking this picture or asked very politely before you took the picture.  He looks like he could have a nasty temper.', '2002-05-27 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65267, 1882, 301, '<td valign="top">Kinda funny fishing with no water :)  Something about your subject having his back to the sign which doesn''t sit right with me.  Having him face the other way would make it feel more like the sign was incorporated as part of the photo, and probably shed a bit more light on his face at the same time.</td>', 'Kinda funny fishing with no water :)  Something about your subject having his back to the sign which doesn''t sit right with me.  Having him face the other way would make it feel more like the sign was incorporated as part of the photo, and probably shed a bit more light on his face at the same time.', '2002-05-27 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65268, 1882, 1211, '<td valign="top">Reallly like the colors in this shot.</td>', 'Reallly like the colors in this shot.', '2002-05-27 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65269, 1882, 1061, '<td valign="top">The sign detracts from this image, and draws attention away from the main subject.  Just the man in front of the fence or the gate would have been far better, IMO</td>', 'The sign detracts from this image, and draws attention away from the main subject.  Just the man in front of the fence or the gate would have been far better, IMO', '2002-05-27 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65270, 1882, 772, '<td valign="top">I love this view... good shot!</td>', 'I love this view... good shot!', '2002-05-27 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65271, 1882, 2, '<td valign="top">Great job on this photo -- you''ve really put us in the atmosphere without beating us over the head with it.  I also really like that he''s walking out of the frame.</td>', 'Great job on this photo -- you''ve really put us in the atmosphere without beating us over the head with it.  I also really like that he''s walking out of the frame.', '2002-05-28 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65272, 1882, 1175, '<td valign="top">The message I get from this is that this person is against what is on that board.  If so I''d need more information as to why.  I think if your model was to turn around or at least go on the other side of the board and continue to look left I would have felt better about this photo.  Also the lack of water in the photo with a guy wearing a fishing vest is upsetting.</td>', 'The message I get from this is that this person is against what is on that board.  If so I''d need more information as to why.  I think if your model was to turn around or at least go on the other side of the board and continue to look left I would have felt better about this photo.  Also the lack of water in the photo with a guy wearing a fishing vest is upsetting.', '2002-05-28 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65273, 1882, 1005, '<td valign="top">Mostly great!  I think I would have preferred the man facing the sign, but that is a nit.  An interesting face, might have been nice to see more of it.  Sparce background, no downgrade, just a comment.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8</td>', 'Mostly great!  I think I would have preferred the man facing the sign, but that is a nit.  An interesting face, might have been nice to see more of it.  Sparce background, no downgrade, just a comment.Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-28 17:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65274, 1882, 689, '<td valign="top">Need to see a little more of the fisherman and less of the terrain.</td>', 'Need to see a little more of the fisherman and less of the terrain.', '2002-05-28 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65275, 1882, 1379, '<td valign="top">Incredible scenery.  Love the toothpick in his mouth and the look he''s giving you...</td>', 'Incredible scenery.  Love the toothpick in his mouth and the look he''s giving you...', '2002-05-28 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65276, 1882, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2002-05-29 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65277, 1882, 1679, '<td valign="top">D''d ya say somthin'' kiddo?</td>', 'D''d ya say somthin'' kiddo?', '2002-05-29 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65278, 1882, 811, '<td valign="top">The focus and lighting on this picture is great!  What would have made it better for me, and I understand that you may have had not control over this, is to have the man facing the other way.  The way he is going looks like he is walking out of the picture, and has no where to go.</td>', 'The focus and lighting on this picture is great!  What would have made it better for me, and I understand that you may have had not control over this, is to have the man facing the other way.  The way he is going looks like he is walking out of the picture, and has no where to go.', '2002-05-30 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65279, 1882, 1031, '<td valign="top">I might even get rid of the hook myself. I decided I like casting a lot more than Iike fishing.</td>', 'I might even get rid of the hook myself. I decided I like casting a lot more than Iike fishing.', '2002-06-01 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65280, 1882, 1, '<td valign="top">I assume you''re talking about fishing by the title...the inclusion of water could''ve helped a lot.</td>', 'I assume you''re talking about fishing by the title...the inclusion of water could''ve helped a lot.', '2002-06-02 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65281, 1883, 661, '<td valign="top">I like the lone image motif.  Too bad the focus wasn''t just a little clearer.</td>', 'I like the lone image motif.  Too bad the focus wasn''t just a little clearer.', '2002-05-27 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65282, 1883, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  It looks like the jpeg compression was a bit much though.  This picture needs to be sharper which I think was lost in compression.  Really like the composition.</td>', 'Great shot!  It looks like the jpeg compression was a bit much though.  This picture needs to be sharper which I think was lost in compression.  Really like the composition.', '2002-05-27 02:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65283, 1883, 1037, '<td valign="top">If the resolution was higher, and you could play with the contrast and levels in photoshop (or equivalent) a bit, this would be lovely.</td>', 'If the resolution was higher, and you could play with the contrast and levels in photoshop (or equivalent) a bit, this would be lovely.', '2002-05-27 03:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65284, 1883, 1024, '<td valign="top">Such a feeling of isolation.  I love this photograph.  Great job.</td>', 'Such a feeling of isolation.  I love this photograph.  Great job.', '2002-05-27 07:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65285, 1883, 509, '<td valign="top">This could be a nice shot, but compression artifacts are very visible here - the girls shoulders and hat are all blocky.  I can understand that effect in the ocean, but the subject should be a little sharper.  This may be overly compressed</td>', 'This could be a nice shot, but compression artifacts are very visible here - the girls shoulders and hat are all blocky.  I can understand that effect in the ocean, but the subject should be a little sharper.  This may be overly compressed', '2002-05-27 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65286, 1883, 1569, '<td valign="top">What makes the beach Australian?</td>', 'What makes the beach Australian?', '2002-05-27 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65287, 1883, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a contemplative pose.... I love the hat, and the way your model is positioned right on the line between really wet and damp sand.</td>', 'What a contemplative pose.... I love the hat, and the way your model is positioned right on the line between really wet and damp sand.', '2002-05-27 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65288, 1883, 327, '<td valign="top">Totally love this shot. The shadow, her stance......all of it is wonderful. My only little nit is that the shot looks over compressed and a hair OOF. Nice work.</td>', 'Totally love this shot. The shadow, her stance......all of it is wonderful. My only little nit is that the shot looks over compressed and a hair OOF. Nice work.', '2002-05-27 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65289, 1883, 1061, '<td valign="top">Could have been great, concept and composition are excellent, even works good in B&amp;W.  Problem: too highly pixellated!  What kind of camera are you using?  Did you do any post enhancements?</td>', 'Could have been great, concept and composition are excellent, even works good in B&W.  Problem: too highly pixellated!  What kind of camera are you using?  Did you do any post enhancements?', '2002-05-27 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65290, 1883, 1878, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white film!!! You got a well deserved 9.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white film!!! You got a well deserved 9.', '2002-05-27 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65291, 1883, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I don''t normally like photos of people from behind but this one makes me wonder what she is looking at and what she is thinking... :)</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I don''t normally like photos of people from behind but this one makes me wonder what she is looking at and what she is thinking... :)', '2002-05-27 22:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65292, 1883, 1750, '<td valign="top">Wow! This simple scene has it all. Zone, story, balance. I see some pixellation there; however I''m going to assume scanning problems or the like.</td>', 'Wow! This simple scene has it all. Zone, story, balance. I see some pixellation there; however I''m going to assume scanning problems or the like.', '2002-05-28 02:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65293, 1883, 1296, '<td valign="top">compression is horrible</td>', 'compression is horrible', '2002-05-28 06:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65294, 1883, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I like that the woman isn''t smack in the middle of the shot.  In fact, I think she could be even further to the left to follow the rule of thirds.  Now some things that you could try and change for the next time: level your horizon, also, don''t compress your file quite as much.  It''s pixilated and your file is only a third of the allowable size.  Also, what made you use b&amp;w?  I think sand and sea work generally better in color, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I like that the woman isn''t smack in the middle of the shot.  In fact, I think she could be even further to the left to follow the rule of thirds.  Now some things that you could try and change for the next time: level your horizon, also, don''t compress your file quite as much.  It''s pixilated and your file is only a third of the allowable size.  Also, what made you use b&w?  I think sand and sea work generally better in color, but that''s just my opinion.', '2002-05-28 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65295, 1883, 1520, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  That island on the horizon is distracting though.  I bet you could''ve hidden it if you had shot it so the girl''s head was in front of it.<br/><br/>She sees to be a little "jaggy".  Was this cropped and resampled?<br/></td>', 'Nice photo.  That island on the horizon is distracting though.  I bet you could''ve hidden it if you had shot it so the girl''s head was in front of it.She sees to be a little "jaggy".  Was this cropped and resampled?', '2002-05-28 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65296, 1883, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice use of b&amp;w.  IMO the horizon should be straight.</td>', 'Nice use of b&w.  IMO the horizon should be straight.', '2002-05-28 14:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65297, 1883, 773, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I wonder what she is waiting for... Nice peaceful mood.</td>', 'Great shot!  I wonder what she is waiting for... Nice peaceful mood.', '2002-05-28 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65298, 1883, 656, '<td valign="top">really would be helped with a flat horizon line - I feel like I''m leaning over</td>', 'really would be helped with a flat horizon line - I feel like I''m leaning over', '2002-05-28 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65299, 1883, 1674, '<td valign="top">very good</td>', 'very good', '2002-05-28 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65300, 1883, 280, '<td valign="top">I find the blob on the horizon very distracting and I think a little more contrast could have helped this image. good shot none the less.</td>', 'I find the blob on the horizon very distracting and I think a little more contrast could have helped this image. good shot none the less.', '2002-05-28 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65301, 1883, 1175, '<td valign="top">Wow it looks like you had a great photo here but saved it with too much compression.  The rules state you can have up to 150kb and your file is less than 50 kb.</td>', 'Wow it looks like you had a great photo here but saved it with too much compression.  The rules state you can have up to 150kb and your file is less than 50 kb.', '2002-05-28 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65302, 1883, 332, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. But the quality isn''t very good :(</td>', 'Nice idea. But the quality isn''t very good :(', '2002-05-28 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65303, 1883, 1005, '<td valign="top">Picked up some jaggies, possibly started with too low of resolution or blew up the shot too much.  The best example is her shadow, but it shows up throughout this photo.  Try starting with the highest resolution your camera will support and crop down as little as possible.<br/>Photo 7 (sorry, the jaggies are that bad, would have been a 9 otherwise) Creativity 7 People 7 total 7 <br/>Just for arguement''s sake:  Why black and white?  This would have been a good choice for color, but I did NOT score you down for this.  This is my problem issue, not yours.  Keep on shootin''!</td>', 'Picked up some jaggies, possibly started with too low of resolution or blew up the shot too much.  The best example is her shadow, but it shows up throughout this photo.  Try starting with the highest resolution your camera will support and crop down as little as possible.Photo 7 (sorry, the jaggies are that bad, would have been a 9 otherwise) Creativity 7 People 7 total 7 Just for arguement''s sake:  Why black and white?  This would have been a good choice for color, but I did NOT score you down for this.  This is my problem issue, not yours.  Keep on shootin''!', '2002-05-29 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65304, 1883, 255, '<td valign="top">i think i would have zoomed in at a different angle to crop most of the emptiness away--or at least to have the emptiness following an angle in front of her, not surrounding her. also, this seems overly compressed. still, a great concept for the people challenge!</td>', 'i think i would have zoomed in at a different angle to crop most of the emptiness away--or at least to have the emptiness following an angle in front of her, not surrounding her. also, this seems overly compressed. still, a great concept for the people challenge!', '2002-05-29 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65305, 1883, 674, '<td valign="top">Not really a suitable black and white subject. The colours of the sea sky and sand make this type of photo.</td>', 'Not really a suitable black and white subject. The colours of the sea sky and sand make this type of photo.', '2002-05-29 00:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65306, 1883, 301, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion, but I think a view like that deserves to be in colour.  There isn''t really enough contrast for me to like it in B&amp;W</td>', 'Just my opinion, but I think a view like that deserves to be in colour.  There isn''t really enough contrast for me to like it in B&W', '2002-05-29 09:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65307, 1883, 1585, '<td valign="top">I like this. Wish that it was a bit more crisp.</td>', 'I like this. Wish that it was a bit more crisp.', '2002-05-29 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65308, 1883, 1679, '<td valign="top">It could have done with a little rotating to level the horizon. Otherwise, nice.</td>', 'It could have done with a little rotating to level the horizon. Otherwise, nice.', '2002-05-29 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65309, 1883, 862, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but the subject is too dark.  The natural lighting is all on her left side.  Moving the camera to the left would help take advantage of the natural light.<br/>An alternative might be to use fill flash, but this might cause problems with the shadow.</td>', 'I like this photo, but the subject is too dark.  The natural lighting is all on her left side.  Moving the camera to the left would help take advantage of the natural light.An alternative might be to use fill flash, but this might cause problems with the shadow.', '2002-05-30 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65310, 1883, 640, '<td valign="top">What a shame the color''s gone! Otherwise, nice shot.</td>', 'What a shame the color''s gone! Otherwise, nice shot.', '2002-05-30 08:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65311, 1883, 885, '<td valign="top">Very painterly.  The girl''s shadow is awesome, as are the footprints in the sand that lead up to her.  The fact that she''s wearing that hat make it seem very old-timey...sort of has a 1920''s feel to it.</td>', 'Very painterly.  The girl''s shadow is awesome, as are the footprints in the sand that lead up to her.  The fact that she''s wearing that hat make it seem very old-timey...sort of has a 1920''s feel to it.', '2002-05-30 08:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65312, 1883, 878, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, I see some artifacts from the software resize.  Check out the forums for some suggestions on how to clean that stuff up.  Still like the shot though.</td>', 'Interesting photo, I see some artifacts from the software resize.  Check out the forums for some suggestions on how to clean that stuff up.  Still like the shot though.', '2002-05-30 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65313, 1883, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hmm..in this case I''d probably have called it Australian Beachcomber...</td>', 'Hmm..in this case I''d probably have called it Australian Beachcomber...', '2002-05-30 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65314, 1883, 1078, '<td valign="top">The horizon line is a little crooked and the compression in this picture is very apparent.  Your file size is about 1/3 what it could be -- perhaps that''s the best your camera can do?  If not, try taking "larger" pictures and resizing them and saving them without so much compression.</td>', 'The horizon line is a little crooked and the compression in this picture is very apparent.  Your file size is about 1/3 what it could be -- perhaps that''s the best your camera can do?  If not, try taking "larger" pictures and resizing them and saving them without so much compression.', '2002-05-31 12:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65315, 1883, 1135, '<td valign="top">The horizon is tilted a bit and you have a lot of compressing artifacts. This picture cries out to be in color.</td>', 'The horizon is tilted a bit and you have a lot of compressing artifacts. This picture cries out to be in color.', '2002-06-02 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65316, 1883, 441, '<td valign="top">your picture is breaking up because its only 47Kb - you are allowed up to 150Kb so your image is degraded by 60%.</td>', 'your picture is breaking up because its only 47Kb - you are allowed up to 150Kb so your image is degraded by 60%.', '2002-06-02 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65317, 1883, 1829, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments on my photo.  I have learnt alot by what you all said.  This is my first entry for the challenge and I have certainly gained some knowledge about taking a ''better'' ''clearer'' shot.  Just for your interest, if you would like to see the little girls face in that photo, you can view her in the B&amp;W challenge.  The photo is called ''Dazed''. <br/>Thanks again!!</td>', 'Thank you for all your comments on my photo.  I have learnt alot by what you all said.  This is my first entry for the challenge and I have certainly gained some knowledge about taking a ''better'' ''clearer'' shot.  Just for your interest, if you would like to see the little girls face in that photo, you can view her in the B&W challenge.  The photo is called ''Dazed''. Thanks again!!', '2002-06-03 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65318, 1884, 1831, '<td valign="top">Good idea.</td>', 'Good idea.', '2002-05-27 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
