(65327, 1884, 1325, '<td valign="top">Now this is what I call creative including Dad''s arm, hand &amp; the keys reflected in the window.  There isn''t a kid in the world who hasn''t pulled this little shennigan &amp; the lighting on her face just picks up the hint of mischief.</td>', 'Now this is what I call creative including Dad''s arm, hand & the keys reflected in the window.  There isn''t a kid in the world who hasn''t pulled this little shennigan & the lighting on her face just picks up the hint of mischief.', '2002-05-28 05:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65328, 1884, 907, '<td valign="top">lol - great capture!!</td>', 'lol - great capture!!', '2002-05-28 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65329, 1884, 573, '<td valign="top">Good story telling and composition.  I feel you could tell the same story with greater impact if you cropped tighter.</td>', 'Good story telling and composition.  I feel you could tell the same story with greater impact if you cropped tighter.', '2002-05-28 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65330, 1884, 2, '<td valign="top">The kid in the car is very difficult to see -- maybe shoot at another time of day?  Or use a polarizing filter?  Or adjust the levels even.  My other suggestion is a tighter crop to show their faces more, and deemphasize that rear-view mirror.</td>', 'The kid in the car is very difficult to see -- maybe shoot at another time of day?  Or use a polarizing filter?  Or adjust the levels even.  My other suggestion is a tighter crop to show their faces more, and deemphasize that rear-view mirror.', '2002-05-28 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65331, 1884, 1759, '<td valign="top">This is cute, I really like the subject and title :-)</td>', 'This is cute, I really like the subject and title :-)', '2002-05-28 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65332, 1884, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting superimposition of faces, and I like how I can see the keys inside the car.  Not so crazy about the little tiny fingertips on the right side though.</td>', 'Interesting superimposition of faces, and I like how I can see the keys inside the car.  Not so crazy about the little tiny fingertips on the right side though.', '2002-05-29 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65333, 1884, 1005, '<td valign="top">Brat!  (Just kidding)  Maybe too much tint on the windows, or too much reflection.  Kid inside barely visible.  Good concept.  Did she get the keys?<br/>Photo 6 Creativity 9 People 7 total 7</td>', 'Brat!  (Just kidding)  Maybe too much tint on the windows, or too much reflection.  Kid inside barely visible.  Good concept.  Did she get the keys?Photo 6 Creativity 9 People 7 total 7', '2002-05-29 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65334, 1884, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very clever and an awesome illusion!  I had looked at this for a while before I realized it was the OTHER face inside the car... Very skillfully done!</td>', 'Very clever and an awesome illusion!  I had looked at this for a while before I realized it was the OTHER face inside the car... Very skillfully done!', '2002-05-29 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65335, 1884, 1009, '<td valign="top">Great!</td>', 'Great!', '2002-05-29 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65336, 1884, 1679, '<td valign="top">It made me smile. I like photos that make me react in some way. Well done.</td>', 'It made me smile. I like photos that make me react in some way. Well done.', '2002-05-30 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65337, 1884, 1078, '<td valign="top">Good use of her reflection to "polarize" the window and let his face come through.  I wish his face was just a little bit further to the right in the picture so we could see a little more of her face in the reflection.  I was wondering about a much tighter crop, maybe to focus on his face, her face, her hand, and the door handle -- but I''m not sure if that would be enough to identify that they were in the car.  Letting her drop her right hand would get rid of those fingertips on the far right edge.</td>', 'Good use of her reflection to "polarize" the window and let his face come through.  I wish his face was just a little bit further to the right in the picture so we could see a little more of her face in the reflection.  I was wondering about a much tighter crop, maybe to focus on his face, her face, her hand, and the door handle -- but I''m not sure if that would be enough to identify that they were in the car.  Letting her drop her right hand would get rid of those fingertips on the far right edge.', '2002-05-31 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65338, 1884, 811, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, but the overlap of the shadowed face and the actual face in the car make it difficult to discern what is happening. The kid with the keys looks like quite a character!</td>', 'Neat idea, but the overlap of the shadowed face and the actual face in the car make it difficult to discern what is happening. The kid with the keys looks like quite a character!', '2002-05-31 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65339, 1884, 1031, '<td valign="top">Uh oh! Very nice blending of the images.</td>', 'Uh oh! Very nice blending of the images.', '2002-06-01 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65340, 1884, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very nice job at depicting this common tease. I like how you can only ''see'' one child at a time. The inside child is a bit too dark however.</td>', 'Very nice job at depicting this common tease. I like how you can only ''see'' one child at a time. The inside child is a bit too dark however.', '2002-06-02 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65341, 1886, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the "hero". Too bad about the guy in the uniform with his head cut off.</td>', 'Nice shot of the "hero". Too bad about the guy in the uniform with his head cut off.', '2002-05-27 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65342, 1886, 509, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  Good action shot, I especially like the haze from the gun smoke</td>', 'I like this one.  Good action shot, I especially like the haze from the gun smoke', '2002-05-27 01:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65343, 1886, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective on the shooter, but the fellow behind his head and the one behind the gun are bit distracting here. I understand you shot what and when ya can. Still a nice shot and the colors, action, are very nice.</td>', 'Nice perspective on the shooter, but the fellow behind his head and the one behind the gun are bit distracting here. I understand you shot what and when ya can. Still a nice shot and the colors, action, are very nice.', '2002-05-27 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65344, 1886, 1772, '<td valign="top">This is a photo Robert Capa would have taken had he covered the Civil War and had a digital camera.  Great photo</td>', 'This is a photo Robert Capa would have taken had he covered the Civil War and had a digital camera.  Great photo', '2002-05-27 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65345, 1886, 1820, '<td valign="top">very nice, maybe a little too bright.</td>', 'very nice, maybe a little too bright.', '2002-05-27 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65346, 1886, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot - looks a little washed out</td>', 'Nice action shot - looks a little washed out', '2002-05-28 01:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65347, 1886, 772, '<td valign="top">Good shot!  Is the ''haze'' in this photograph from smoke?</td>', 'Good shot!  Is the ''haze'' in this photograph from smoke?', '2002-05-28 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65348, 1886, 975, '<td valign="top">I love this!  He is so nice and clear in the foreground while the background is separated by the lingering smoke.  Very nice!</td>', 'I love this!  He is so nice and clear in the foreground while the background is separated by the lingering smoke.  Very nice!', '2002-05-28 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65349, 1886, 156, '<td valign="top">not enough contrast and i''m not crazy about the headless officer...as an aside, it looks like the guy lying in the shade has the better job!</td>', 'not enough contrast and i''m not crazy about the headless officer...as an aside, it looks like the guy lying in the shade has the better job!', '2002-05-28 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65350, 1886, 1446, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  A lot going on here. Seems a little light on my monitor overall.  Would have liked to see just a little more contrast.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  A lot going on here. Seems a little light on my monitor overall.  Would have liked to see just a little more contrast.', '2002-05-28 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65351, 1886, 737, '<td valign="top">Subject stands out from background - nice job</td>', 'Subject stands out from background - nice job', '2002-05-28 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65352, 1886, 1005, '<td valign="top">Thanks for doing this in color.  Sepia is a cool trick for this "vintage" photography, but I really like color.  Good photo, sharp, shows action, do I detect a bit of gunsmoke haze?  I''d suggest a haze filter, but I like the effect in this case.  Could you have stepped two steps to the left for a little more face and still show him reaching for reload?<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 9 People 10 total 10  (we don''t get battle recreations out here, nobody much likes reviewing hangings)</td>', 'Thanks for doing this in color.  Sepia is a cool trick for this "vintage" photography, but I really like color.  Good photo, sharp, shows action, do I detect a bit of gunsmoke haze?  I''d suggest a haze filter, but I like the effect in this case.  Could you have stepped two steps to the left for a little more face and still show him reaching for reload?Photo 10 Creativity 9 People 10 total 10  (we don''t get battle recreations out here, nobody much likes reviewing hangings)', '2002-05-29 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65353, 1886, 1175, '<td valign="top">Except for the adult and the young boy in the background (why would they be standing upright if this was a battle) I love this picture.  I don''t think you have any control over them though so I won''t take that away from you.  Great pose by the model, good timing by the photographer to get him while his hand is reaching for more bullets.</td>', 'Except for the adult and the young boy in the background (why would they be standing upright if this was a battle) I love this picture.  I don''t think you have any control over them though so I won''t take that away from you.  Great pose by the model, good timing by the photographer to get him while his hand is reaching for more bullets.', '2002-05-30 07:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65354, 1886, 811, '<td valign="top">The smokiness/haziness gives the picture a dream-like/surreal feeling to it. (I''m sure the actual soldiers thought it was surreal).  My only suggestion would be to frame it so the main subject is further right.  This gives him further to "look," and it might prevent that one guy from having his arm cut off.</td>', 'The smokiness/haziness gives the picture a dream-like/surreal feeling to it. (I''m sure the actual soldiers thought it was surreal).  My only suggestion would be to frame it so the main subject is further right.  This gives him further to "look," and it might prevent that one guy from having his arm cut off.', '2002-05-31 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65355, 1886, 1750, '<td valign="top">No headless guys in the background.</td>', 'No headless guys in the background.', '2002-06-02 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65356, 1886, 117, '<td valign="top">thanks to everyone</td>', 'thanks to everyone', '2002-06-03 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65357, 1888, 1750, '<td valign="top">Clean angle, body position matches net-pole. Extended arm gets good lead spacing.</td>', 'Clean angle, body position matches net-pole. Extended arm gets good lead spacing.', '2002-05-27 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
