(65365, 1888, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo.. I like the tilted angle on this one... I can''t suggest any improvements.. good work! = 9</td>', 'Excellent photo.. I like the tilted angle on this one... I can''t suggest any improvements.. good work! = 9', '2002-05-28 15:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65366, 1888, 1446, '<td valign="top">I  like this shot.  The dark colors on the neutral color sand background is very nice.  Nice job stopping the motion.  Good DOF. Good focus.</td>', 'I  like this shot.  The dark colors on the neutral color sand background is very nice.  Nice job stopping the motion.  Good DOF. Good focus.', '2002-05-28 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
