(65387, 1890, 1599, '<td valign="top">n/a</td>', 'n/a', '2002-05-29 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65388, 1890, 1066, '<td valign="top">Well..this started off as a 5 on monday..by monday eveining it was a 6..by tuesday a 7...wednesday an 8..now it is one of my 10 best this week.<br/><br/>I usually don''t go for shutter tricks.  I can appreciate them for sure but it just isn''t one of my favorite things which is why you started out low.  <br/><br/>But you see..you can''t keep a good photo down.  And this is a good photo.  The subject, the lighting and the cigarette that stayed in pretty good focus sold me.  The final straw that put you in one of my favorites?  The shadow in the background stayed nice and crisp.<br/><br/>Truly a nice work of art here...</td>', 'Well..this started off as a 5 on monday..by monday eveining it was a 6..by tuesday a 7...wednesday an 8..now it is one of my 10 best this week.I usually don''t go for shutter tricks.  I can appreciate them for sure but it just isn''t one of my favorite things which is why you started out low.  But you see..you can''t keep a good photo down.  And this is a good photo.  The subject, the lighting and the cigarette that stayed in pretty good focus sold me.  The final straw that put you in one of my favorites?  The shadow in the background stayed nice and crisp.Truly a nice work of art here...', '2002-05-30 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65389, 1890, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interestng effect. The low resolution doesn''t bother me :)</td>', 'Very interestng effect. The low resolution doesn''t bother me :)', '2002-05-30 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
