(65393, 1891, 1024, '<td valign="top">That red umbrella makes this photograph.  I gave this my highest rating!</td>', 'That red umbrella makes this photograph.  I gave this my highest rating!', '2002-05-27 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65394, 1891, 1808, '<td valign="top">Almost black and white except for that umbrella. Might make a good ad for Traveler''s Insurance.</td>', 'Almost black and white except for that umbrella. Might make a good ad for Traveler''s Insurance.', '2002-05-27 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65395, 1891, 117, '<td valign="top">you got take what the weather gives you</td>', 'you got take what the weather gives you', '2002-05-27 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65396, 1891, 472, '<td valign="top">the red umbrella and the perfect composition are the touches that make this photo come alive.  and you lucky dog, you got to go to yosemite!</td>', 'the red umbrella and the perfect composition are the touches that make this photo come alive.  and you lucky dog, you got to go to yosemite!', '2002-05-27 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65397, 1891, 449, '<td valign="top">I like the red in the umbrella. nice comp.</td>', 'I like the red in the umbrella. nice comp.', '2002-05-27 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65398, 1891, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but too much of the road in the foreground</td>', 'Nice composition but too much of the road in the foreground', '2002-05-27 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65399, 1891, 327, '<td valign="top">Love it! Just a good shot. Fine composition. Only little nit I have is the bottom should be cropped more. Over all a good good shot. Nice job!!</td>', 'Love it! Just a good shot. Fine composition. Only little nit I have is the bottom should be cropped more. Over all a good good shot. Nice job!!', '2002-05-27 17:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65400, 1891, 1877, '<td valign="top">i like the lone red umbrella..</td>', 'i like the lone red umbrella..', '2002-05-27 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65401, 1891, 1772, '<td valign="top">Good landscape.  The people really show the grandeur of the view.</td>', 'Good landscape.  The people really show the grandeur of the view.', '2002-05-27 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65402, 1891, 1061, '<td valign="top">This is great</td>', 'This is great', '2002-05-27 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65403, 1891, 1520, '<td valign="top">I like the red umbrella, kinda makes it look like the rest of the picture has been desaturated.  I might''ve cropped to the bottom of the curb to cut out the "parking" word and to put a little more focus on the vastness of that mountain in the back.<br/><br/>The tree on the left seems to help frame the mountains nicely while the right side is left open for the eye to leave the frame.<br/><br/><br/></td>', 'I like the red umbrella, kinda makes it look like the rest of the picture has been desaturated.  I might''ve cropped to the bottom of the curb to cut out the "parking" word and to put a little more focus on the vastness of that mountain in the back.The tree on the left seems to help frame the mountains nicely while the right side is left open for the eye to leave the frame.', '2002-05-28 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65404, 1891, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo is awe-inspiring... The size of those mountains really is overwhelming.  I have no critique for you on this one... The red umbrella offers a wonderful bit of contrast to go along with the weather mood in this photo... great shot! = 10</td>', 'This photo is awe-inspiring... The size of those mountains really is overwhelming.  I have no critique for you on this one... The red umbrella offers a wonderful bit of contrast to go along with the weather mood in this photo... great shot! = 10', '2002-05-28 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65405, 1891, 773, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I like the dark of the photographers against the light mountain.</td>', 'Awesome.  I like the dark of the photographers against the light mountain.', '2002-05-28 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65406, 1891, 1738, '<td valign="top">too much parking lot<br/></td>', 'too much parking lot', '2002-05-28 22:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65407, 1891, 205, '<td valign="top">I hope you took some landscapes too....</td>', 'I hope you took some landscapes too....', '2002-05-28 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65408, 1891, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the red umbrella.  I wonder how it would have looked with the blue even more desaturated, to make those blue pants a little greyer, and pull the emphasis more towards the umbrella.  Alternatively, I wonder if you could crop out the parking lot, and the girl on the left and most of that tree, leaving the umbrella on the left side of the picture.</td>', 'I like the red umbrella.  I wonder how it would have looked with the blue even more desaturated, to make those blue pants a little greyer, and pull the emphasis more towards the umbrella.  Alternatively, I wonder if you could crop out the parking lot, and the girl on the left and most of that tree, leaving the umbrella on the left side of the picture.', '2002-05-29 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65409, 1891, 674, '<td valign="top">I like the splash of red against the starkness of the background Did you use fill in flash as I feel the figures in the foreground could have done with a bit of fill in flash.</td>', 'I like the splash of red against the starkness of the background Did you use fill in flash as I feel the figures in the foreground could have done with a bit of fill in flash.', '2002-05-29 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65410, 1891, 1681, '<td valign="top">I really like the low-key effect of this photo.  Good composition.  Did you supply the red umbrella?  One of only two 10s this week.</td>', 'I really like the low-key effect of this photo.  Good composition.  Did you supply the red umbrella?  One of only two 10s this week.', '2002-05-29 07:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65411, 1891, 1042, '<td valign="top">This is a little dark, of course...it''s raining and I understand that. The scenery through the mist is beautiful though. I would have liked to have seen it cropped a little closer at the bottom so there isn''t so much pavement showing...but I like this.</td>', 'This is a little dark, of course...it''s raining and I understand that. The scenery through the mist is beautiful though. I would have liked to have seen it cropped a little closer at the bottom so there isn''t so much pavement showing...but I like this.', '2002-05-29 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65412, 1891, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of Yosemite, but your people came out much like shadows.  A very difficult concept to pull off, people observing something in the distance and still do both the people justice.   Yosemite appears to be your subject and the people got in the way.  I like this concept best when you can get some face (profile) with the background, instead.<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 8 People 7 total 8</td>', 'Nice shot of Yosemite, but your people came out much like shadows.  A very difficult concept to pull off, people observing something in the distance and still do both the people justice.   Yosemite appears to be your subject and the people got in the way.  I like this concept best when you can get some face (profile) with the background, instead.Photo 8 Creativity 8 People 7 total 8', '2002-05-29 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65413, 1891, 1585, '<td valign="top">Great capture. You got the feel of the weather, wet and cold. Time of day is there. And the perspective is very nice. I feel so small.</td>', 'Great capture. You got the feel of the weather, wet and cold. Time of day is there. And the perspective is very nice. I feel so small.', '2002-05-29 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65414, 1891, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture...</td>', 'Very nice picture...', '2002-05-29 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65415, 1891, 737, '<td valign="top">I really like the overall shot - the red umbrella makes it.</td>', 'I really like the overall shot - the red umbrella makes it.', '2002-05-30 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65416, 1891, 573, '<td valign="top">Good human interest and technical.  I like the composition and framing, nice.</td>', 'Good human interest and technical.  I like the composition and framing, nice.', '2002-05-30 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65417, 1891, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the way the umbrella jumps out of the picture.  hope you got some nice shots of the landscape as well.</td>', 'I love the way the umbrella jumps out of the picture.  hope you got some nice shots of the landscape as well.', '2002-05-30 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65418, 1891, 543, '<td valign="top">That red umbrella was a stroke of luck, eh?  Not to mention catching Obi Wan on vacation.  I always wonder when shooting other photogs; is it incest or cannibalism?  Congrats on a beautiful image.</td>', 'That red umbrella was a stroke of luck, eh?  Not to mention catching Obi Wan on vacation.  I always wonder when shooting other photogs; is it incest or cannibalism?  Congrats on a beautiful image.', '2002-05-31 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65419, 1891, 1202, '<td valign="top">Its hard to take a bad picture of El Capitan.   Yours excells with the wonderful composition and great subject matter.   The RED umbrella tells the weather story.   I would have liked to see the umbrella even brighter .</td>', 'Its hard to take a bad picture of El Capitan.   Yours excells with the wonderful composition and great subject matter.   The RED umbrella tells the weather story.   I would have liked to see the umbrella even brighter .', '2002-06-01 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65420, 1891, 1908, '<td valign="top">Love the red</td>', 'Love the red', '2002-06-02 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65421, 1891, 1750, '<td valign="top">No question. This is my number one pick. You absolutely nailed the ''flavor'' of the place.</td>', 'No question. This is my number one pick. You absolutely nailed the ''flavor'' of the place.', '2002-06-02 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65422, 1891, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I just wish the people on the left and right side were gone.  The umbrella stands out nicely.</td>', 'Cool shot, I just wish the people on the left and right side were gone.  The umbrella stands out nicely.', '2002-06-02 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65423, 1891, 491, '<td valign="top">This was just one of those lucky shots.  The person in the jeans is another DP Challenger, but the couple with the red umbrella just happen to be there.  Thanks for the comments.  I agree with all of you who said I should have gotten rid of the parking lot.  Cropping is still something I am learning.</td>', 'This was just one of those lucky shots.  The person in the jeans is another DP Challenger, but the couple with the red umbrella just happen to be there.  Thanks for the comments.  I agree with all of you who said I should have gotten rid of the parking lot.  Cropping is still something I am learning.', '2002-06-03 01:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65424, 1892, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmm, if it was framed with the little boy a bit further from the edge, this would be really nice. I love the graceful curve of the fishing rod, and the way the chlidren are standing. The surroundings are beautifully oriental and exotic at least to an Australian like me :).</td>', 'Hmm, if it was framed with the little boy a bit further from the edge, this would be really nice. I love the graceful curve of the fishing rod, and the way the chlidren are standing. The surroundings are beautifully oriental and exotic at least to an Australian like me :).', '2002-05-27 03:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65425, 1892, 1808, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t get more face in the picture...</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t get more face in the picture...', '2002-05-27 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65426, 1892, 327, '<td valign="top">Little people! Very cute.</td>', 'Little people! Very cute.', '2002-05-27 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65427, 1892, 772, '<td valign="top">I have caught fish bigger than these kids!  Nice shot!</td>', 'I have caught fish bigger than these kids!  Nice shot!', '2002-05-27 21:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65428, 1892, 907, '<td valign="top">I wish photo was cropped more on left, less on right but - great capture!</td>', 'I wish photo was cropped more on left, less on right but - great capture!', '2002-05-28 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65429, 1892, 1446, '<td valign="top">What a great setting.  If this is your backyard I am very jealous.</td>', 'What a great setting.  If this is your backyard I am very jealous.', '2002-05-28 14:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65430, 1892, 811, '<td valign="top">I assume by the title that the point of the picture is the fish.  If that is so, a different angle that would draw more attention to the fish would be helpful.  As it is, my eyes are drawn up and over with the little girl''s pole, completely away from the fish.</td>', 'I assume by the title that the point of the picture is the fish.  If that is so, a different angle that would draw more attention to the fish would be helpful.  As it is, my eyes are drawn up and over with the little girl''s pole, completely away from the fish.', '2002-05-28 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65431, 1892, 1738, '<td valign="top">should have cropped the boy</td>', 'should have cropped the boy', '2002-05-28 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65432, 1892, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very sweet!  I especially like the small child awkwardly holding the pole.  So cute!</td>', 'Very sweet!  I especially like the small child awkwardly holding the pole.  So cute!', '2002-05-29 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65433, 1892, 301, '<td valign="top">I think I''d prefer to have focused on just one of the kids in the picture, and gotten closer.</td>', 'I think I''d prefer to have focused on just one of the kids in the picture, and gotten closer.', '2002-05-30 05:23:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(65434, 1892, 1031, '<td valign="top">But just wait until they find out about "cleaning" the fish...</td>', 'But just wait until they find out about "cleaning" the fish...', '2002-06-01 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65435, 1892, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though the other child to the right distracts from the subject and what''s happening.</td>', 'Nice shot, though the other child to the right distracts from the subject and what''s happening.', '2002-06-02 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65436, 1893, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Nice rich colors, I''d prefer to see it not so tightly cropped (not cutting off the hat, and baskets).</td>', 'Great shot.  Nice rich colors, I''d prefer to see it not so tightly cropped (not cutting off the hat, and baskets).', '2002-05-27 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65437, 1893, 1808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful "real" picture.</td>', 'Beautiful "real" picture.', '2002-05-27 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65438, 1893, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo.. i like the angle of the camera towards the subject quite a bit!  The only thing I don''t like is that his hat is clipped across the top... good job!</td>', 'This is a nice photo.. i like the angle of the camera towards the subject quite a bit!  The only thing I don''t like is that his hat is clipped across the top... good job!', '2002-05-27 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65439, 1893, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great shot, paper in the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Great shot, paper in the background is a bit distracting.', '2002-05-27 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65440, 1893, 661, '<td valign="top">The picture tells a story.  That''s good!!</td>', 'The picture tells a story.  That''s good!!', '2002-05-27 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65441, 1893, 327, '<td valign="top">Is he selling bird houses? Interesting photo, clean clear with good colors. Sorry you cropped the top of his head off. Good work.</td>', 'Is he selling bird houses? Interesting photo, clean clear with good colors. Sorry you cropped the top of his head off. Good work.', '2002-05-27 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65442, 1893, 773, '<td valign="top">Great job!  I really like this shot.  There is obvious pride in this person.</td>', 'Great job!  I really like this shot.  There is obvious pride in this person.', '2002-05-27 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65443, 1893, 714, '<td valign="top">I would love to have one....how much?  Very nice.</td>', 'I would love to have one....how much?  Very nice.', '2002-05-28 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65444, 1893, 573, '<td valign="top">The subject shows pride in the probuct.  Nice story telling.</td>', 'The subject shows pride in the probuct.  Nice story telling.', '2002-05-28 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65445, 1893, 1005, '<td valign="top">Missed a little bit of his hat, must have hurt.  Back up one step, please and get the whole shot.  Solid photo otherwise, good color, focus, etc.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8</td>', 'Missed a little bit of his hat, must have hurt.  Back up one step, please and get the whole shot.  Solid photo otherwise, good color, focus, etc.Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8', '2002-05-28 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65446, 1893, 806, '<td valign="top">Wonderful documentary of life. Nice work.</td>', 'Wonderful documentary of life. Nice work.', '2002-05-28 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65447, 1893, 1759, '<td valign="top">I loved this guys face. The photo is well metered, sharp, and symetrical.</td>', 'I loved this guys face. The photo is well metered, sharp, and symetrical.', '2002-05-28 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65448, 1893, 1024, '<td valign="top">These real life photos are my favorites.  Great focus, great color and I love the expression on this mans face.</td>', 'These real life photos are my favorites.  Great focus, great color and I love the expression on this mans face.', '2002-05-29 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65449, 1893, 1325, '<td valign="top">The background colors and the bird houses really set off this picture but the wonderful expressive face of the man is what instantly caught my attention but I am quickly pulled on to the image that is portrayed by his hands.  Great!</td>', 'The background colors and the bird houses really set off this picture but the wonderful expressive face of the man is what instantly caught my attention but I am quickly pulled on to the image that is portrayed by his hands.  Great!', '2002-05-29 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65450, 1893, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love this photo... especially the way the title leads me to look at his hands, and at that forearm.</td>', 'I love this photo... especially the way the title leads me to look at his hands, and at that forearm.', '2002-05-29 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65451, 1893, 1599, '<td valign="top">Oh Nice</td>', 'Oh Nice', '2002-05-29 16:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65452, 1893, 1847, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing photo.  Unique subject.</td>', 'Very intriguing photo.  Unique subject.', '2002-05-29 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65453, 1893, 1175, '<td valign="top">This is a great image.  It speaks volumes.  Your title works very well with the picture.  10</td>', 'This is a great image.  It speaks volumes.  Your title works very well with the picture.  10', '2002-05-30 07:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65454, 1893, 301, '<td valign="top">an interesting person and photograph.  Better if you hadn''t cut off the top of his head, and gotten rid of the piece of paper behind him</td>', 'an interesting person and photograph.  Better if you hadn''t cut off the top of his head, and gotten rid of the piece of paper behind him', '2002-05-30 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65455, 1893, 1031, '<td valign="top">Are those birdhouses? Nice portrait.</td>', 'Are those birdhouses? Nice portrait.', '2002-06-01 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65456, 1893, 2, '<td valign="top">The framing of this shot doesn''t seem intentional.  His baskets are cut off on both sides, and so is his head.  I think the shot would have been better if you could have gotten rid of one or two of those cut-offs ... or used your angle better to prove that you meant to do it.</td>', 'The framing of this shot doesn''t seem intentional.  His baskets are cut off on both sides, and so is his head.  I think the shot would have been better if you could have gotten rid of one or two of those cut-offs ... or used your angle better to prove that you meant to do it.', '2002-06-02 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65457, 1893, 1750, '<td valign="top">Good separation of subject and background. The photo gets more dimentional due to the baskets of wares. Good balance of warm and cool colors.</td>', 'Good separation of subject and background. The photo gets more dimentional due to the baskets of wares. Good balance of warm and cool colors.', '2002-06-02 21:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65458, 1894, 1867, '<td valign="top">great expressions!</td>', 'great expressions!', '2002-05-27 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65459, 1894, 1808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. These guys could be in a sitcom.</td>', 'Beautiful. These guys could be in a sitcom.', '2002-05-27 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65460, 1894, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great expressions, hard to see what he''s catching though.</td>', 'Great expressions, hard to see what he''s catching though.', '2002-05-27 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65461, 1894, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice shot---needed the fish in it.</td>', 'Nice shot---needed the fish in it.', '2002-05-27 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65462, 1894, 1872, '<td valign="top">another hot guy!</td>', 'another hot guy!', '2002-05-27 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65463, 1894, 741, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if the guys were looking towards the camera</td>', 'Would have been better if the guys were looking towards the camera', '2002-05-27 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65464, 1894, 327, '<td valign="top">Great photo, you really caught the action there. I live in Portland and have been there many times. Well done fun action shot.</td>', 'Great photo, you really caught the action there. I live in Portland and have been there many times. Well done fun action shot.', '2002-05-27 20:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65465, 1894, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the action and the emotion in this photo.. good job!</td>', 'I like the action and the emotion in this photo.. good job!', '2002-05-27 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65466, 1894, 491, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Really gives the feel of the place.  I haven''t been there in 3 years and these were there vack then.  My only comment is I wish you could have gotten the fish clearer.</td>', 'Good shot.  Really gives the feel of the place.  I haven''t been there in 3 years and these were there vack then.  My only comment is I wish you could have gotten the fish clearer.', '2002-05-27 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65467, 1894, 1658, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression you caught with the guy on the right.  Very well done photo.  It really captures the moment and feel of these two.</td>', 'I really like the expression you caught with the guy on the right.  Very well done photo.  It really captures the moment and feel of these two.', '2002-05-28 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65468, 1894, 1680, '<td valign="top">whats being throw to the guy? his hands are too blurry<br/></td>', 'whats being throw to the guy? his hands are too blurry', '2002-05-28 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65469, 1894, 1042, '<td valign="top">I love the expressions on these guy''s faces...I really like this.</td>', 'I love the expressions on these guy''s faces...I really like this.', '2002-05-28 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65470, 1894, 656, '<td valign="top">good expressions.  Looks like lots of action but I can''t actually see the subject of the shot :)  What is he going to miss ?  We can''t see the fish...</td>', 'good expressions.  Looks like lots of action but I can''t actually see the subject of the shot :)  What is he going to miss ?  We can''t see the fish...', '2002-05-28 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65471, 1894, 1, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of the fish in the photograph couild''ve helped some.  Nicely caught expressions.</td>', 'The inclusion of the fish in the photograph couild''ve helped some.  Nicely caught expressions.', '2002-05-28 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65472, 1894, 737, '<td valign="top">LOL. "Good Catch"! Good timing on the expression. One of the best. In my top 3.</td>', 'LOL. "Good Catch"! Good timing on the expression. One of the best. In my top 3.', '2002-05-28 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65473, 1894, 1005, '<td valign="top">They don''t miss very often.  His hands in motion really work, but too bad the rest of him didn''t hold still.  Nearly perfect.  Photo 9 Creativity 9 People 9 total 9</td>', 'They don''t miss very often.  His hands in motion really work, but too bad the rest of him didn''t hold still.  Nearly perfect.  Photo 9 Creativity 9 People 9 total 9', '2002-05-28 17:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65474, 1894, 1379, '<td valign="top">Real live people!  This picture has so much life and motion!  I especially like the redhead''s expression, watching for the fish even though he''s not the one to catch it....<br/>Very cool!</td>', 'Real live people!  This picture has so much life and motion!  I especially like the redhead''s expression, watching for the fish even though he''s not the one to catch it....Very cool!', '2002-05-28 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65475, 1894, 203, '<td valign="top">Flying fish.  It''s been awhile since I have seen that.  How is the brass pig?</td>', 'Flying fish.  It''s been awhile since I have seen that.  How is the brass pig?', '2002-05-28 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65476, 1894, 811, '<td valign="top">I saw a documentary about this place one time -- these guys are hilarious.  Cropping the bottom of the picture to eliminate the signs might have made it less "cluttered."  At first I didn''t like the motion blur, but the more I look at it, the more I think it needs to be there to convey what was probably happening.</td>', 'I saw a documentary about this place one time -- these guys are hilarious.  Cropping the bottom of the picture to eliminate the signs might have made it less "cluttered."  At first I didn''t like the motion blur, but the more I look at it, the more I think it needs to be there to convey what was probably happening.', '2002-05-29 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65477, 1894, 1446, '<td valign="top">This is my 3rd look at this photograph.  A lot going on here, but it works. I like the feeling of motion.</td>', 'This is my 3rd look at this photograph.  A lot going on here, but it works. I like the feeling of motion.', '2002-05-29 14:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65478, 1894, 1547, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Excellent composition and cropping.  You''ve got enough of the surrounding area to definitly place the setting but still focus on the subjects.</td>', 'Great shot!  Excellent composition and cropping.  You''ve got enough of the surrounding area to definitly place the setting but still focus on the subjects.', '2002-05-29 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65479, 1894, 1175, '<td valign="top">I Like the action and the expression on the faces.  Is that the fish between his hands?  Would have been great if you could have frozen it in the air.  Good shot none the less. 8.</td>', 'I Like the action and the expression on the faces.  Is that the fish between his hands?  Would have been great if you could have frozen it in the air.  Good shot none the less. 8.', '2002-05-30 07:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
