(65489, 1895, 741, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a candid streetlife scene.  The area on the left is a little distracting because it''s so burnt out - I think the only way to avoid this though would have been to close in and/or move to the left.</td>', 'Nice idea for a candid streetlife scene.  The area on the left is a little distracting because it''s so burnt out - I think the only way to avoid this though would have been to close in and/or move to the left.', '2002-05-28 00:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65490, 1895, 570, '<td valign="top">bad quality of pic. maybe less compression would help.</td>', 'bad quality of pic. maybe less compression would help.', '2002-05-28 12:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65491, 1895, 1446, '<td valign="top">Seems out of focus on my monitor.</td>', 'Seems out of focus on my monitor.', '2002-05-28 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65492, 1895, 1759, '<td valign="top">Cute subject!</td>', 'Cute subject!', '2002-05-28 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65493, 1895, 737, '<td valign="top">Background over exposed</td>', 'Background over exposed', '2002-05-28 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65494, 1895, 1005, '<td valign="top">Not so good.  Your subject''s movement doesn''t help this shot, so appears blurred.  The upper left portion of the picture is over-exposed, too bright.  The coat behind the girl''s head is soooo dark, her head disappears into it.  Other characters in the background look bad, and the dress in the foreground might have been a pretty distraction, if viewable.<br/>Sorry,  Photo 3 Creativity 4 People 5 total 4</td>', 'Not so good.  Your subject''s movement doesn''t help this shot, so appears blurred.  The upper left portion of the picture is over-exposed, too bright.  The coat behind the girl''s head is soooo dark, her head disappears into it.  Other characters in the background look bad, and the dress in the foreground might have been a pretty distraction, if viewable.Sorry,  Photo 3 Creativity 4 People 5 total 4', '2002-05-29 12:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65495, 1895, 1024, '<td valign="top">The little girls in the foreground is very interesting, but the background is washed out.  Maybe cropping it a bit tighter would have helped.</td>', 'The little girls in the foreground is very interesting, but the background is washed out.  Maybe cropping it a bit tighter would have helped.', '2002-05-29 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65496, 1895, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like that you got down to the little girl''s level to take this photo.  I would prefer to be looking at her (instead of her walking away from me).  The photo also seems very pixelated, and based on your file size I don''t think it''s JPEG compression.  Did you use a high ISO setting?</td>', 'I like that you got down to the little girl''s level to take this photo.  I would prefer to be looking at her (instead of her walking away from me).  The photo also seems very pixelated, and based on your file size I don''t think it''s JPEG compression.  Did you use a high ISO setting?', '2002-05-29 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65497, 1895, 509, '<td valign="top">The overexposure and background elements detract from the focus here.  Also, the colors seem very washed out.  I like the subject, but the lighting kills this for me</td>', 'The overexposure and background elements detract from the focus here.  Also, the colors seem very washed out.  I like the subject, but the lighting kills this for me', '2002-05-29 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65498, 1895, 573, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, please try again.  With practice I know you can do better.</td>', 'I''m sorry, please try again.  With practice I know you can do better.', '2002-05-30 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65499, 1895, 1031, '<td valign="top">On my monitor the upper left looks more overexposed than what I''d like. I like the variety of people and actions within a small space. If there were enough resolution, I might have tried cropping this as a vertical image, using the bottom-right as the anchor point.</td>', 'On my monitor the upper left looks more overexposed than what I''d like. I like the variety of people and actions within a small space. If there were enough resolution, I might have tried cropping this as a vertical image, using the bottom-right as the anchor point.', '2002-05-30 22:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65500, 1895, 2, '<td valign="top">The picture is very grainy, but I like the washed-out effect of the image.  The girl is still very obviously the center of attention.</td>', 'The picture is very grainy, but I like the washed-out effect of the image.  The girl is still very obviously the center of attention.', '2002-06-02 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65501, 1895, 1750, '<td valign="top">Not even the cute child in the forground saves this one. Looks like it came off a store surveillence camera.</td>', 'Not even the cute child in the forground saves this one. Looks like it came off a store surveillence camera.', '2002-06-02 21:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65502, 1895, 1, '<td valign="top">Colors are very saturated/over exposed.  Close the aperture some or uqicken the shutter.</td>', 'Colors are very saturated/over exposed.  Close the aperture some or uqicken the shutter.', '2002-06-02 21:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65503, 1895, 1037, '<td valign="top">Well, this photo came in the bottom 10, partly because it was overambitious use of a low resolution, point and shoot camera (judging by all the comments about blurriness, shutterspeed, and other things I couldn''t actually have controlled), and partly because I post-processed it in a bold way, turning the colours up, burning out the background by playing with the levels, etc. I liked it that way, and I still think this is one of the most satisfying photos I''ve ever taken, but my taste is not shared by many people.</td>', 'Well, this photo came in the bottom 10, partly because it was overambitious use of a low resolution, point and shoot camera (judging by all the comments about blurriness, shutterspeed, and other things I couldn''t actually have controlled), and partly because I post-processed it in a bold way, turning the colours up, burning out the background by playing with the levels, etc. I liked it that way, and I still think this is one of the most satisfying photos I''ve ever taken, but my taste is not shared by many people.', '2002-06-03 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65504, 1896, 1175, '<td valign="top">Is this just a shot of a TV?  Its a wonderful picture but I would have prefered if you would have set it up rather than some director.</td>', 'Is this just a shot of a TV?  Its a wonderful picture but I would have prefered if you would have set it up rather than some director.', '2002-05-27 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
