(65525, 1896, 587, '<td valign="top">I''m going with the texture is supposed to be in this.  That and the text just don''t do "it" for me. The tear placement combined with the texture makes it appear that it''s more of a growth or something and less tear like. I like the coloring and the lighting, but it''s that damn texture I think that makes it look so ''hard'', sorry.</td>', 'I''m going with the texture is supposed to be in this.  That and the text just don''t do "it" for me. The tear placement combined with the texture makes it appear that it''s more of a growth or something and less tear like. I like the coloring and the lighting, but it''s that damn texture I think that makes it look so ''hard'', sorry.', '2002-05-29 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
