(65532, 1898, 92, '<td valign="top">Emotion captured. Something that is very hard to do. Perfect detail and lighting. It doesn''t get much better than this.</td>', 'Emotion captured. Something that is very hard to do. Perfect detail and lighting. It doesn''t get much better than this.', '2002-05-27 03:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
