(65536, 1898, 686, '<td valign="top">Just a little bit too dark. Good concept, though.</td>', 'Just a little bit too dark. Good concept, though.', '2002-05-27 18:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65537, 1898, 327, '<td valign="top">lol I''ve seen that look before.</td>', 'lol I''ve seen that look before.', '2002-05-27 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65538, 1898, 773, '<td valign="top">Poor baby... I feel the same way when I have to have my picture taken.  This is an excellent photo.  I really like the shadows and the lighting on the eyes, forehead, and lips.  It captures the emotion that seems to be pouring from the child.</td>', 'Poor baby... I feel the same way when I have to have my picture taken.  This is an excellent photo.  I really like the shadows and the lighting on the eyes, forehead, and lips.  It captures the emotion that seems to be pouring from the child.', '2002-05-27 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65539, 1898, 1820, '<td valign="top">a little more light would be better.  but  very nice anyway!</td>', 'a little more light would be better.  but  very nice anyway!', '2002-05-27 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65540, 1898, 1750, '<td valign="top">Good shot in the Stieglitz style. The lighting is a bit awkward to my eye, but it also adds interest.</td>', 'Good shot in the Stieglitz style. The lighting is a bit awkward to my eye, but it also adds interest.', '2002-05-28 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65541, 1898, 1446, '<td valign="top">Excellent job with capturing emotion in this shot.  It seems just a tad dark, but I suspect you planned it that way.  One of my top 10 shots for the week.</td>', 'Excellent job with capturing emotion in this shot.  It seems just a tad dark, but I suspect you planned it that way.  One of my top 10 shots for the week.', '2002-05-28 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65542, 1898, 301, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here.  Having the face along the diagonal of the photo works well.  The forehead seems to have copped a lot of the light, which tends to emphasize it a little too much for my liking</td>', 'I like the idea here.  Having the face along the diagonal of the photo works well.  The forehead seems to have copped a lot of the light, which tends to emphasize it a little too much for my liking', '2002-05-28 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65543, 1898, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the way you framed this shot, and the b&amp;w.  Catching the light in the eye is great, too.  I would''ve preferred the photo to be a little lighter and sharper though.</td>', 'I like the way you framed this shot, and the b&w.  Catching the light in the eye is great, too.  I would''ve preferred the photo to be a little lighter and sharper though.', '2002-05-28 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65544, 1898, 1005, '<td valign="top">High impact photo, but I think it''s tooo dark.  Focus seems soft, was that on purpose?  More light and more face might have been nice.<br/>Photo 6 Creativity 7 People 8 total 7</td>', 'High impact photo, but I think it''s tooo dark.  Focus seems soft, was that on purpose?  More light and more face might have been nice.Photo 6 Creativity 7 People 8 total 7', '2002-05-28 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65545, 1898, 1759, '<td valign="top">Great look and nice effect! Perhaps a bit too soft though?</td>', 'Great look and nice effect! Perhaps a bit too soft though?', '2002-05-28 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65546, 1898, 737, '<td valign="top">Very creative, well above average</td>', 'Very creative, well above average', '2002-05-28 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65547, 1898, 1528, '<td valign="top">neat, but a tad too dark</td>', 'neat, but a tad too dark', '2002-05-28 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65548, 1898, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice...</td>', 'Nice...', '2002-05-28 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65549, 1898, 1024, '<td valign="top">You may have done it intentionally, but the focus is too soft for my taste.</td>', 'You may have done it intentionally, but the focus is too soft for my taste.', '2002-05-29 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65550, 1898, 1037, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of character, in a very dramatic photo. I like it a lot.</td>', 'This has a lot of character, in a very dramatic photo. I like it a lot.', '2002-05-29 03:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65551, 1898, 1903, '<td valign="top">Great creative shot...conveys simply, but powerfully, a lot of emotion.   I like the gracefull lines the child''s features create against the background.   Nice pic!</td>', 'Great creative shot...conveys simply, but powerfully, a lot of emotion.   I like the gracefull lines the child''s features create against the background.   Nice pic!', '2002-05-29 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65552, 1898, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but seems a little out of focus on the bottom half of the subject.</td>', 'Nice composition, but seems a little out of focus on the bottom half of the subject.', '2002-05-29 19:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65553, 1898, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space.  I think maybe I could have been happier with a little more detail, a little less dark.  The darkness definitely gives it a mood, but I think as it is it strikes me as more menacing than pouting.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space.  I think maybe I could have been happier with a little more detail, a little less dark.  The darkness definitely gives it a mood, but I think as it is it strikes me as more menacing than pouting.', '2002-05-30 19:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65554, 1898, 811, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too dark for me.  Great idea, though</td>', 'It''s a little too dark for me.  Great idea, though', '2002-05-30 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65555, 1898, 1042, '<td valign="top">I love the crop on this photo, the way the highlight of the face makes a diagonal line through the photo. It''s a perfect expression of the title as well. As a mother, I''ve seen this look a lot!!!  Great job.</td>', 'I love the crop on this photo, the way the highlight of the face makes a diagonal line through the photo. It''s a perfect expression of the title as well. As a mother, I''ve seen this look a lot!!!  Great job.', '2002-05-31 07:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65556, 1898, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think the highlight in the eye might be a little too big and too bright in relation to the rest of the picture.  I''m also not certain I like the direction that the eye is looking -- perhaps that has something to do with the highlight.  I like the lighting otherwise, but wish the skin tones, where visible, were a little bit brighter and closer to "18% gray."  (If they are already there, and they just seem darker, then maybe closer to 18% perceptually -- if that makes sense.)</td>', 'I think the highlight in the eye might be a little too big and too bright in relation to the rest of the picture.  I''m also not certain I like the direction that the eye is looking -- perhaps that has something to do with the highlight.  I like the lighting otherwise, but wish the skin tones, where visible, were a little bit brighter and closer to "18% gray."  (If they are already there, and they just seem darker, then maybe closer to 18% perceptually -- if that makes sense.)', '2002-05-31 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65557, 1898, 1031, '<td valign="top">I see the expression more as fearful than pouty, but I don''t think that has any effect on the quality!</td>', 'I see the expression more as fearful than pouty, but I don''t think that has any effect on the quality!', '2002-06-01 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65558, 1898, 772, '<td valign="top">The darkness in this photo was completely intentional.  I must admit that the soft focus is a little too soft.  I learned from this shot and thanks for the comments :)</td>', 'The darkness in this photo was completely intentional.  I must admit that the soft focus is a little too soft.  I learned from this shot and thanks for the comments :)', '2002-06-03 17:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65559, 1900, 301, '<td valign="top">lighting wasn''t great for this photo, and greater DOF would have helped blur a busy background</td>', 'lighting wasn''t great for this photo, and greater DOF would have helped blur a busy background', '2002-05-27 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
