(65563, 1900, 1061, '<td valign="top">This is cool</td>', 'This is cool', '2002-05-27 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65564, 1900, 1750, '<td valign="top">Like the colors, composition, and story.</td>', 'Like the colors, composition, and story.', '2002-05-28 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65565, 1900, 1041, '<td valign="top">Did we meet there? I was also at the race taking pictures for the challenge, but then decided I didn''t like any of them well enough to enter.  You seem to have got a little closer than me - good.  For this challenge, I would''ve liked it better if my eyes were drawn more to the drummers, instead they keep on wandering to the dragon.  I do like having the other boat in the background.</td>', 'Did we meet there? I was also at the race taking pictures for the challenge, but then decided I didn''t like any of them well enough to enter.  You seem to have got a little closer than me - good.  For this challenge, I would''ve liked it better if my eyes were drawn more to the drummers, instead they keep on wandering to the dragon.  I do like having the other boat in the background.', '2002-05-28 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65566, 1900, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in this photo :)  Good job!</td>', 'Nice colors in this photo :)  Good job!', '2002-05-28 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65567, 1900, 1759, '<td valign="top">Colorful, but also a bit busy. Maybe drop depth of field to reduce the distractive background.</td>', 'Colorful, but also a bit busy. Maybe drop depth of field to reduce the distractive background.', '2002-05-28 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65568, 1900, 2, '<td valign="top">I think an angle just a little closer down to the water would have made this shot much more exciting and made the off-centeredness seem very intentional.  The current angle almost puts you in a documentary-style mood.</td>', 'I think an angle just a little closer down to the water would have made this shot much more exciting and made the off-centeredness seem very intentional.  The current angle almost puts you in a documentary-style mood.', '2002-05-28 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65569, 1900, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  Life vests are a bit over bright.  One whole boat might have been nice to see, or the race in progress, no downgrade, just commenting.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 8 total 8</td>', 'Cool shot!  Life vests are a bit over bright.  One whole boat might have been nice to see, or the race in progress, no downgrade, just commenting.Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-28 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65570, 1900, 1446, '<td valign="top">Very nice color.  Crisp focus.  Well composed shot.</td>', 'Very nice color.  Crisp focus.  Well composed shot.', '2002-05-28 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65571, 1900, 1379, '<td valign="top">Hey!!   I think I recognize this.........      Is this D.C.?  <br/>You caught some great colors here.  I like how the blue in the dragon''s head is matched by the parasols of the eatery on shore.</td>', 'Hey!!   I think I recognize this.........      Is this D.C.?  You caught some great colors here.  I like how the blue in the dragon''s head is matched by the parasols of the eatery on shore.', '2002-05-28 18:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65572, 1900, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this picture, especially the blue umbrellas against the gray building.  If there had been some way to not have the police boat and other boat in there, that would''ve been nice, but that is obviously not in your control</td>', 'I love the colors in this picture, especially the blue umbrellas against the gray building.  If there had been some way to not have the police boat and other boat in there, that would''ve been nice, but that is obviously not in your control', '2002-05-29 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65573, 1900, 1599, '<td valign="top">n/a</td>', 'n/a', '2002-05-29 16:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65574, 1900, 1585, '<td valign="top">Nice and clear. Great color.</td>', 'Nice and clear. Great color.', '2002-05-29 18:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65575, 1900, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hey, if that''s at Stanley, Hong Kong, I have a team Tshirt from the 1997 event which a friend gave me -- now I have an image to go with it!</td>', 'Hey, if that''s at Stanley, Hong Kong, I have a team Tshirt from the 1997 event which a friend gave me -- now I have an image to go with it!', '2002-05-30 22:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65576, 1900, 1175, '<td valign="top">This photo is a contradiction intself to the rule of framing.  You put the person on the left third because he''s moving to the right which was good, but he''s backwards so it looks bad.  The positioning of it just makes it seem like the dragon head is more your subject than the people.  A broader shot of the boat with the people rowing probably would have been better.</td>', 'This photo is a contradiction intself to the rule of framing.  You put the person on the left third because he''s moving to the right which was good, but he''s backwards so it looks bad.  The positioning of it just makes it seem like the dragon head is more your subject than the people.  A broader shot of the boat with the people rowing probably would have been better.', '2002-05-31 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65577, 1900, 543, '<td valign="top">Isn''t Dragon Boat Festival next month?  I guess this is practice.  Interesting, but doesn''t really grab the eye - too many distractions.</td>', 'Isn''t Dragon Boat Festival next month?  I guess this is practice.  Interesting, but doesn''t really grab the eye - too many distractions.', '2002-05-31 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65578, 1900, 1377, '<td valign="top">Nice colors!</td>', 'Nice colors!', '2002-06-02 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65579, 1901, 139, '<td valign="top">I think I''d have preferred the horizontal composition, leaving some room for the horse and rider to "jump into".</td>', 'I think I''d have preferred the horizontal composition, leaving some room for the horse and rider to "jump into".', '2002-05-27 01:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65580, 1901, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice showjumping photo. Dappled grey horses always photograph well :). The rider''s expression is definitely one of ''focus''. The colours just seem a little bit dim though.</td>', 'Very nice showjumping photo. Dappled grey horses always photograph well :). The rider''s expression is definitely one of ''focus''. The colours just seem a little bit dim though.', '2002-05-27 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65581, 1901, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice action. Too bad the kid''s face wasn''t a little clearer.</td>', 'Nice action. Too bad the kid''s face wasn''t a little clearer.', '2002-05-27 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65582, 1901, 47, '<td valign="top">girls make that face when they ride me, too</td>', 'girls make that face when they ride me, too', '2002-05-27 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65583, 1901, 117, '<td valign="top">nice motion shot</td>', 'nice motion shot', '2002-05-27 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65584, 1901, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great action!  The expression on the rider''s face is great, but unfortunately my eye is drawn to the horse''s face and mane.  I hope she did well in this show!  Her form looks good!</td>', 'Great action!  The expression on the rider''s face is great, but unfortunately my eye is drawn to the horse''s face and mane.  I hope she did well in this show!  Her form looks good!', '2002-05-27 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65585, 1901, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice Action shot.  Good focus.  I would have like''d a little more head room for the horse.</td>', 'Nice Action shot.  Good focus.  I would have like''d a little more head room for the horse.', '2002-05-27 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65586, 1901, 327, '<td valign="top">Good color, good action. Nice job.</td>', 'Good color, good action. Nice job.', '2002-05-27 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65587, 1901, 1750, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse. You can see the tension on both their faces.  Considering the horse can''t see where it''s going and the young rider is anxious about the outcome it''s a good story and "rule of thirds" shot. It is a bit too dark though.</td>', 'Beautiful horse. You can see the tension on both their faces.  Considering the horse can''t see where it''s going and the young rider is anxious about the outcome it''s a good story and "rule of thirds" shot. It is a bit too dark though.', '2002-05-28 01:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65588, 1901, 1446, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph. The expression you captured on the riders face is wonderful.  I would not change a thing.</td>', 'Excellent photograph. The expression you captured on the riders face is wonderful.  I would not change a thing.', '2002-05-28 03:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65589, 1901, 656, '<td valign="top">good shot - colours could benefit from a bit of work in photoshop to stretch the contrast/ add some saturation, maybe ?  Well framed action shot.</td>', 'good shot - colours could benefit from a bit of work in photoshop to stretch the contrast/ add some saturation, maybe ?  Well framed action shot.', '2002-05-28 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65590, 1901, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Great action photo!</td>', 'Nice job!  Great action photo!', '2002-05-28 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65591, 1901, 1680, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. I like the DOF, the angle and the fact that you can see the motion of the horse''s front legs.</td>', 'Great action shot. I like the DOF, the angle and the fact that you can see the motion of the horse''s front legs.', '2002-05-28 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65592, 1901, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Good composition though I think the tight cropping gives somewhat of a static look.</td>', 'Very nice! Good composition though I think the tight cropping gives somewhat of a static look.', '2002-05-28 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65593, 1901, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow, great shot.  Stopped the action well, but subject''s face is too dark.  I can''t think of any way to better the shot, so no downgrading. <br/>Photo 10 Creativity 10 People 9 total 10</td>', 'Wow, great shot.  Stopped the action well, but subject''s face is too dark.  I can''t think of any way to better the shot, so no downgrading. Photo 10 Creativity 10 People 9 total 10', '2002-05-28 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65594, 1901, 203, '<td valign="top">Focus as in -out of?</td>', 'Focus as in -out of?', '2002-05-28 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65595, 1901, 1357, '<td valign="top">my wife spends an absolute fortune on her horse then I have to sort out her credit card bill. I HATE HORSES !!!!!!! Photo ain`t bad though.</td>', 'my wife spends an absolute fortune on her horse then I have to sort out her credit card bill. I HATE HORSES !!!!!!! Photo ain`t bad though.', '2002-05-29 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65596, 1901, 1041, '<td valign="top">Good catch, I love the concentration on her face, and the photo is nicely framed by the hurdles.  This would''ve also done well in the stop-motion challenge.</td>', 'Good catch, I love the concentration on her face, and the photo is nicely framed by the hurdles.  This would''ve also done well in the stop-motion challenge.', '2002-05-29 10:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65597, 1901, 878, '<td valign="top">Much better action shot than a person shot.  Technically clean shot, could be a slight bit lighter in the face.</td>', 'Much better action shot than a person shot.  Technically clean shot, could be a slight bit lighter in the face.', '2002-05-30 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65598, 1901, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of synonyms for your title...</td>', 'I like your choice of synonyms for your title...', '2002-05-30 22:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65599, 1901, 1175, '<td valign="top">Great subject.  Not happy with composition though. Probably should have moved the camera over about 1/3 a frame.  Cut off the horses tail and ass, there is nothing really going on there, and the tail is more of a distraction.  Put empty space in the direction your subject is moving.  In  your picture the horse and rider is going to fall out of the frame.  The image could also be a little sharper.</td>', 'Great subject.  Not happy with composition though. Probably should have moved the camera over about 1/3 a frame.  Cut off the horses tail and ass, there is nothing really going on there, and the tail is more of a distraction.  Put empty space in the direction your subject is moving.  In  your picture the horse and rider is going to fall out of the frame.  The image could also be a little sharper.', '2002-05-31 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65600, 1901, 142, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo.  It would have also scored high with me in the stopped motion competition.</td>', 'This is a great photo.  It would have also scored high with me in the stopped motion competition.', '2002-06-01 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65601, 1902, 661, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d given the horse more head room (less vacant space on the left - more on the right).  But I don''t know what you cut out.  I like the way both of their heads are facing the same direction as if they are both preparing.</td>', 'I wish you''d given the horse more head room (less vacant space on the left - more on the right).  But I don''t know what you cut out.  I like the way both of their heads are facing the same direction as if they are both preparing.', '2002-05-27 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65602, 1902, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I may have cropped in on the subject closer since you don''t need the background to tell the story here, but it''s still a pleasing shot.</td>', 'Nice photo. I may have cropped in on the subject closer since you don''t need the background to tell the story here, but it''s still a pleasing shot.', '2002-05-27 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65603, 1902, 1808, '<td valign="top">Maybe brighten it up a bit to pick up the faces.</td>', 'Maybe brighten it up a bit to pick up the faces.', '2002-05-27 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65604, 1902, 327, '<td valign="top">This shot is well done. Good composition, good shot. Maybe a tad too dark on the horse and a bit hot on the shirt. Still this is very good work. Congrats.</td>', 'This shot is well done. Good composition, good shot. Maybe a tad too dark on the horse and a bit hot on the shirt. Still this is very good work. Congrats.', '2002-05-27 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65605, 1902, 1820, '<td valign="top">it probably would be better to take the photo in straigt to see the entire horse  because the background seem distracting.</td>', 'it probably would be better to take the photo in straigt to see the entire horse  because the background seem distracting.', '2002-05-27 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65606, 1902, 1750, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse. Face needs fill flash.</td>', 'Beautiful horse. Face needs fill flash.', '2002-05-28 01:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65607, 1902, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  I think the light on the rider''s shirt is a little harsh.. I don''t know if you have the capability or not, but a polarizing filter helps in this situation... Also using a smaller aperture setting can help out as well... good job!</td>', 'Nice shot!  I think the light on the rider''s shirt is a little harsh.. I don''t know if you have the capability or not, but a polarizing filter helps in this situation... Also using a smaller aperture setting can help out as well... good job!', '2002-05-28 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65608, 1902, 156, '<td valign="top">very nice, but i can''t help wondering what the rider looking at...is she preparing for a conformation class or a jumping class? guess there''s not much you could do to show prep for a conformation class except to show her watching an ongoing one perhaps....if it''s a jumping class, showing the hurdles or another horse/rider (in the background of course) taking them would help me, the viewer, get a better feel for what she is mentally preparing for</td>', 'very nice, but i can''t help wondering what the rider looking at...is she preparing for a conformation class or a jumping class? guess there''s not much you could do to show prep for a conformation class except to show her watching an ongoing one perhaps....if it''s a jumping class, showing the hurdles or another horse/rider (in the background of course) taking them would help me, the viewer, get a better feel for what she is mentally preparing for', '2002-05-28 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65609, 1902, 1897, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting.  Get closer to your subject.  The facial expression is lost.   Use that zoom!</td>', 'Poor lighting.  Get closer to your subject.  The facial expression is lost.   Use that zoom!', '2002-05-28 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65610, 1902, 332, '<td valign="top">Place the subject on the left side of the frame. It would look much better.</td>', 'Place the subject on the left side of the frame. It would look much better.', '2002-05-28 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65611, 1902, 1005, '<td valign="top">Too bad she wasn''t turned toward the sun, her face is obsured by shadow.   Otherwise, good composition, color, focus, almost great!<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 9 total 9</td>', 'Too bad she wasn''t turned toward the sun, her face is obsured by shadow.   Otherwise, good composition, color, focus, almost great!Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 9 total 9', '2002-05-29 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65612, 1902, 811, '<td valign="top">Since the rider and the horse are both looking to the right, it might have been good to have them further left in the frame.  That would have also prevented the background horse from being cropped in half.</td>', 'Since the rider and the horse are both looking to the right, it might have been good to have them further left in the frame.  That would have also prevented the background horse from being cropped in half.', '2002-05-29 13:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65613, 1902, 1446, '<td valign="top">A lot going on for what at first appears to be a simple photograph.  I would have liked to see a little better focus on the riders face.</td>', 'A lot going on for what at first appears to be a simple photograph.  I would have liked to see a little better focus on the riders face.', '2002-05-29 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65614, 1902, 1599, '<td valign="top">oh</td>', 'oh', '2002-05-29 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65615, 1902, 255, '<td valign="top">I grew up on horses, so I have a definite connection with this picture--I wonder if the mood could have been enhanced even more with a broader side angle to keep (wo) man and beast from being so straigh on and centered in the frame? Plus a little DOP to really bring the main subjects out.</td>', 'I grew up on horses, so I have a definite connection with this picture--I wonder if the mood could have been enhanced even more with a broader side angle to keep (wo) man and beast from being so straigh on and centered in the frame? Plus a little DOP to really bring the main subjects out.', '2002-05-29 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65616, 1902, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like how both horse and rider seem to be counting-off the steps to the next fence.</td>', 'I like how both horse and rider seem to be counting-off the steps to the next fence.', '2002-05-30 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65617, 1902, 1175, '<td valign="top">Centered is bad.  Look up rule of thirds.  Also noon sun is bad.  To much shadow on her face.  Nice attempt, good luck next time.</td>', 'Centered is bad.  Look up rule of thirds.  Also noon sun is bad.  To much shadow on her face.  Nice attempt, good luck next time.', '2002-05-30 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65618, 1903, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow.... flashback.  I remember watching my Papa do this with my little brother, and I was ***so*** jealous.  I love the concentration on little dude''s face.  You get a 10!</td>', 'Wow.... flashback.  I remember watching my Papa do this with my little brother, and I was ***so*** jealous.  I love the concentration on little dude''s face.  You get a 10!', '2002-05-27 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65619, 1903, 92, '<td valign="top">One of my favs this week !</td>', 'One of my favs this week !', '2002-05-27 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65620, 1903, 1831, '<td valign="top">Really sharp, great colour.</td>', 'Really sharp, great colour.', '2002-05-27 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65621, 1903, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love the look of concentration on the boys face.  Good composition, good crisp details.  The only (very small) objection I would fine with this photograph is the fence in the background behind their heads.  Not sure what you could have done about that though, unless you used a larger aperature and thus a limited depth of field.</td>', 'I love the look of concentration on the boys face.  Good composition, good crisp details.  The only (very small) objection I would fine with this photograph is the fence in the background behind their heads.  Not sure what you could have done about that though, unless you used a larger aperature and thus a limited depth of field.', '2002-05-27 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65622, 1903, 801, '<td valign="top">A instant of highest concentration... a dangerous machine on the hands of a kid. Very good!!</td>', 'A instant of highest concentration... a dangerous machine on the hands of a kid. Very good!!', '2002-05-27 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65623, 1903, 1867, '<td valign="top">is he taking it seriously!</td>', 'is he taking it seriously!', '2002-05-27 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65624, 1903, 806, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.</td>', 'I like this very much.', '2002-05-27 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65625, 1903, 117, '<td valign="top">so serious</td>', 'so serious', '2002-05-27 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65626, 1903, 327, '<td valign="top">Super shot and could be an add for Kaubota! Well done, good composition, color.<br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Super shot and could be an add for Kaubota! Well done, good composition, color.Nice work.', '2002-05-27 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65627, 1903, 661, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  Excellent composition.  Great look of concentration on the kid''s face.  I like the lighting on this too.</td>', 'Very nice picture.  Excellent composition.  Great look of concentration on the kid''s face.  I like the lighting on this too.', '2002-05-27 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65628, 1903, 671, '<td valign="top">Good use of "thirds" to frame the shot.</td>', 'Good use of "thirds" to frame the shot.', '2002-05-27 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65629, 1903, 741, '<td valign="top">Lighting and DOF are great here.  Concentration on their faces sets it off.</td>', 'Lighting and DOF are great here.  Concentration on their faces sets it off.', '2002-05-28 00:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65630, 1903, 1750, '<td valign="top">Beautiful story, good separation from background. Skintones a bit blue. I would have used fill. Still the focus and composition works for me.</td>', 'Beautiful story, good separation from background. Skintones a bit blue. I would have used fill. Still the focus and composition works for me.', '2002-05-28 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65631, 1903, 1446, '<td valign="top">I love the way the lines lead into the subjects in this shot.  The look of concetration on the little boy is wonderful.  Very nice job with natural lighting.</td>', 'I love the way the lines lead into the subjects in this shot.  The look of concetration on the little boy is wonderful.  Very nice job with natural lighting.', '2002-05-28 03:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65632, 1903, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  Great concentration on  both their faces.  Nicely framed too.</td>', 'I like this one.  Great concentration on  both their faces.  Nicely framed too.', '2002-05-28 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65633, 1903, 772, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Photos like this are great... Memories like this are nice to have saved away :)</td>', 'Well done!  Photos like this are great... Memories like this are nice to have saved away :)', '2002-05-28 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(65634, 1903, 1520, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, good composition.  I find the word "KUBOTA" a little distracting because of it''s size and colour.  Not much you could do about that I guess.  Great people-shot!<br/></td>', 'Good lighting, good composition.  I find the word "KUBOTA" a little distracting because of it''s size and colour.  Not much you could do about that I guess.  Great people-shot!', '2002-05-28 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65635, 1903, 907, '<td valign="top">I love how they both have the same expression! great capture</td>', 'I love how they both have the same expression! great capture', '2002-05-28 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65636, 1903, 281, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Try a faster shutter speed to prevent the ''action'' blur in the tree.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Try a faster shutter speed to prevent the ''action'' blur in the tree.', '2002-05-28 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65637, 1903, 1175, '<td valign="top">Great color, clarity.  Love the expression on the faces.  Very good.</td>', 'Great color, clarity.  Love the expression on the faces.  Very good.', '2002-05-28 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65638, 1903, 718, '<td valign="top">What a cool moment!</td>', 'What a cool moment!', '2002-05-28 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65639, 1903, 1738, '<td valign="top">too much tree<br/></td>', 'too much tree', '2002-05-28 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65640, 1903, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good  photo, there''s interest (what are they doing?) Good color and focus.  Going through my list of objects, but none match.  Good job, keep up the good work!<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 9 People 10 total 10</td>', 'Good  photo, there''s interest (what are they doing?) Good color and focus.  Going through my list of objects, but none match.  Good job, keep up the good work!Photo 10 Creativity 9 People 10 total 10', '2002-05-29 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65641, 1903, 1681, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  Makes you want to be there.  Good use of back-lighting. One of two 10''s this week.</td>', 'Great photo.  Makes you want to be there.  Good use of back-lighting. One of two 10''s this week.', '2002-05-29 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65642, 1903, 587, '<td valign="top">Undoubtedly one of my favorites - the expressions! If I had to choose something to ''change'' I would wish their faces were lit up more - but this is definately a "Kodak Moment" Great job.</td>', 'Undoubtedly one of my favorites - the expressions! If I had to choose something to ''change'' I would wish their faces were lit up more - but this is definately a "Kodak Moment" Great job.', '2002-05-29 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65643, 1903, 1679, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours and DOF. I like the concentration on the boy''s face.<br/>The difference between the older and the younger generation is alsodepicted by the difference in dressing. But still, the expression on the boy''s (and to the father''s at a lesser degree) face gives this photo this extra needed boost! Great!</td>', 'Very nice colours and DOF. I like the concentration on the boy''s face.The difference between the older and the younger generation is alsodepicted by the difference in dressing. But still, the expression on the boy''s (and to the father''s at a lesser degree) face gives this photo this extra needed boost! Great!', '2002-05-29 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65644, 1903, 674, '<td valign="top">lovely expressions on their faces!</td>', 'lovely expressions on their faces!', '2002-05-30 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65645, 1903, 301, '<td valign="top">love the frustration on son and concern in father''s eyes (for the tractor that is) :).  IMO a tighter crop getting rid of the ''ugly'' bits of the tractor may have worked better.  Good DOF - shame they weren''t a little bit further from the fence so that it could be more blurred too</td>', 'love the frustration on son and concern in father''s eyes (for the tractor that is) :).  IMO a tighter crop getting rid of the ''ugly'' bits of the tractor may have worked better.  Good DOF - shame they weren''t a little bit further from the fence so that it could be more blurred too', '2002-05-30 07:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65646, 1903, 878, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, good lighting.</td>', 'Interesting shot, good lighting.', '2002-05-30 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65647, 1903, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this, the way it catches their outlines and hair.</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this, the way it catches their outlines and hair.', '2002-05-31 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65648, 1903, 1031, '<td valign="top">My son will like this one. I think I was 5 when my dad let me steer his flatbed truck...</td>', 'My son will like this one. I think I was 5 when my dad let me steer his flatbed truck...', '2002-06-01 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65649, 1903, 2, '<td valign="top">Hey Lianne -- great job catching the essence of "people".  I agree that the non-set up shots are the best photos.</td>', 'Hey Lianne -- great job catching the essence of "people".  I agree that the non-set up shots are the best photos.', '2002-06-03 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65650, 1904, 661, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait but the background doesn''t add to the picture too blah (the background, certainly not the lovely lady).</td>', 'Very nice portrait but the background doesn''t add to the picture too blah (the background, certainly not the lovely lady).', '2002-05-27 12:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65651, 1904, 1750, '<td valign="top">Pretty subject, nice warm tones. Good separation of subject from background. Good separation of gold from yellow.The bright spot above her left shoulder is a bit distracting. Would like to lighten her eye area a bit. Would also like seeing this subject in silhouette as well.</td>', 'Pretty subject, nice warm tones. Good separation of subject from background. Good separation of gold from yellow.The bright spot above her left shoulder is a bit distracting. Would like to lighten her eye area a bit. Would also like seeing this subject in silhouette as well.', '2002-05-27 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65652, 1904, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait!</td>', 'Nice portrait!', '2002-05-27 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65653, 1904, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice. Maybe a little more light on the face...</td>', 'Nice. Maybe a little more light on the face...', '2002-05-27 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65654, 1904, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a striking, regal woman.  Her sari is lovely, too.</td>', 'What a striking, regal woman.  Her sari is lovely, too.', '2002-05-27 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65655, 1904, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty lady. Love the color and the light is pretty good. Maybe a little more on her face. Still this is good work. Congrats.</td>', 'Pretty lady. Love the color and the light is pretty good. Maybe a little more on her face. Still this is good work. Congrats.', '2002-05-27 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65656, 1904, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait!  I can''t come up with much critique on it, but I would probably have tried to offer a light in the background that created a little more contrast between the background and her clothing... good job!</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait!  I can''t come up with much critique on it, but I would probably have tried to offer a light in the background that created a little more contrast between the background and her clothing... good job!', '2002-05-27 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65657, 1904, 1834, '<td valign="top">shouldn''t work but does</td>', 'shouldn''t work but does', '2002-05-28 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65658, 1904, 1520, '<td valign="top">The teeth are in better focus than the eyes....portraits should always have the eyes in razor-sharp focus.<br/><br/>Lighting and background is nice and the background colour complements the clothing colour. <br/><br/>The spot light on the background seems to be a little too bright on the right side of the head.<br/><br/>Might''ve lit the face a little more with a light reflector.<br/></td>', 'The teeth are in better focus than the eyes....portraits should always have the eyes in razor-sharp focus.Lighting and background is nice and the background colour complements the clothing colour. The spot light on the background seems to be a little too bright on the right side of the head.Might''ve lit the face a little more with a light reflector.', '2002-05-28 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65659, 1904, 1759, '<td valign="top">A nice pose, but I think the angle should have been a bit higher. Also the lighting doesn''t do justice to the color and texture. My preference would be to have the backlight slightly higher and add major and minor front light sources to the left and right. This would bring out more texture in that lovely face.</td>', 'A nice pose, but I think the angle should have been a bit higher. Also the lighting doesn''t do justice to the color and texture. My preference would be to have the backlight slightly higher and add major and minor front light sources to the left and right. This would bring out more texture in that lovely face.', '2002-05-28 14:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65660, 1904, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful subject!</td>', 'beautiful subject!', '2002-05-28 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65661, 1904, 1, '<td valign="top">I think a different background could''ve suited her skin and dress color better than the one chosen.</td>', 'I think a different background could''ve suited her skin and dress color better than the one chosen.', '2002-05-28 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65662, 1904, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  A different background color, if at all possible, might have made the picture have a little more *pop* to it.  The yellow garment and yellowish wall sort of blend together.  I like the lighting you have used.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  A different background color, if at all possible, might have made the picture have a little more *pop* to it.  The yellow garment and yellowish wall sort of blend together.  I like the lighting you have used.', '2002-05-29 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65663, 1904, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful portrait. The clothes and jewelry are gorgeous, set off really well by the background and lighting.</td>', 'Very beautiful portrait. The clothes and jewelry are gorgeous, set off really well by the background and lighting.', '2002-05-29 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65664, 1904, 1005, '<td valign="top">A really nice photo.  Just a nit, but are you looking up at her just a bit?  A little more straight on, or back just a bit to get more of her costume might have been nice.  Also a nit, maybe a touch dark, but really not that far off, could be my monitor even.<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 8 People 9 total 9</td>', 'A really nice photo.  Just a nit, but are you looking up at her just a bit?  A little more straight on, or back just a bit to get more of her costume might have been nice.  Also a nit, maybe a touch dark, but really not that far off, could be my monitor even.Photo 10 Creativity 8 People 9 total 9', '2002-05-29 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65665, 1904, 885, '<td valign="top">I think a more contrasting background would have made this picture stand out a bit more.  Her dress and her skin tones are in the yellow range, so a blue or red background I think would have made them pop out some more.</td>', 'I think a more contrasting background would have made this picture stand out a bit more.  Her dress and her skin tones are in the yellow range, so a blue or red background I think would have made them pop out some more.', '2002-05-29 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
