(65669, 1905, 1037, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the way the focus is on the hand here. I feel like I want to see the face and the ear more clearly. Especially the ear.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the way the focus is on the hand here. I feel like I want to see the face and the ear more clearly. Especially the ear.', '2002-05-27 03:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
