(65673, 1905, 472, '<td valign="top">the crop and frame filling you chose is good.  as is the use of bw.  i wish there was more dof. or the focus was on the face.  a bit blown on the white. which works here.</td>', 'the crop and frame filling you chose is good.  as is the use of bw.  i wish there was more dof. or the focus was on the face.  a bit blown on the white. which works here.', '2002-05-27 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
