(65684, 1905, 1379, '<td valign="top">I like how you focused on the hand instead of on the face.  Those little fingers look impossibly small and so sweet!  Nice photo!</td>', 'I like how you focused on the hand instead of on the face.  Those little fingers look impossibly small and so sweet!  Nice photo!', '2002-05-28 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
