(65686, 1905, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the white blanket is a bit overly white.  I like the focus on the hand, very special.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 8 total 8</td>', 'Nice, but the white blanket is a bit overly white.  I like the focus on the hand, very special.  Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-29 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65687, 1905, 885, '<td valign="top">By your unusual choice of focus, it seems like the viewer''s attention is supposed to be drawn to that hand.  While it''s an original idea, I''m not sure it''s successful, since I''m still drawn much more to the face.  I think it might be because the blanket is obscuring some of the baby''s hand...it would have worked better with a more visible hand, I think.</td>', 'By your unusual choice of focus, it seems like the viewer''s attention is supposed to be drawn to that hand.  While it''s an original idea, I''m not sure it''s successful, since I''m still drawn much more to the face.  I think it might be because the blanket is obscuring some of the baby''s hand...it would have worked better with a more visible hand, I think.', '2002-05-29 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65688, 1905, 301, '<td valign="top">Like the choice of focusing on the hand rather than the face.  Very different to the normal baby shots :)  The bright blanket is distracting to me, and hurts an otherwise powerful image.  I would have tried the same shot shifted to the right a little - rule of thirds wise the back of the hand would be in the ''ideal'' position with the fingers leading the eye from the corner</td>', 'Like the choice of focusing on the hand rather than the face.  Very different to the normal baby shots :)  The bright blanket is distracting to me, and hurts an otherwise powerful image.  I would have tried the same shot shifted to the right a little - rule of thirds wise the back of the hand would be in the ''ideal'' position with the fingers leading the eye from the corner', '2002-05-30 07:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65689, 1905, 811, '<td valign="top">It is a little bright on the left side, and the angle you have shot from is interesting, but it makes the hand look huge.  It is a very "peaceful" picture.</td>', 'It is a little bright on the left side, and the angle you have shot from is interesting, but it makes the hand look huge.  It is a very "peaceful" picture.', '2002-05-30 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65690, 1905, 573, '<td valign="top">I realy wanted to give this picture a high score but I realy wanted to see the face sharply.  Congratulations are in order?</td>', 'I realy wanted to give this picture a high score but I realy wanted to see the face sharply.  Congratulations are in order?', '2002-05-30 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65691, 1905, 1078, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos that totally counteracts all the thumbnail voting arguments.  I hope people aren''t seeing the thumbnail, letting the first half of this come up, and then voting.  At first, I was thinking, "Wow, this is really out of focus."  Then it finally finished loading and I thought, "Ah, I see..."  The idea is very good -- I wish I could see more of the hand -- especially the fingernails.  I also think a simpler background would have been a big benefit.</td>', 'This is one of those photos that totally counteracts all the thumbnail voting arguments.  I hope people aren''t seeing the thumbnail, letting the first half of this come up, and then voting.  At first, I was thinking, "Wow, this is really out of focus."  Then it finally finished loading and I thought, "Ah, I see..."  The idea is very good -- I wish I could see more of the hand -- especially the fingernails.  I also think a simpler background would have been a big benefit.', '2002-05-31 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65692, 1905, 142, '<td valign="top">This is a special photo.  I love it.</td>', 'This is a special photo.  I love it.', '2002-06-01 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65693, 1905, 773, '<td valign="top">Sweet... but the hand looks really large, and i would have liked to see this little darling''s face better.</td>', 'Sweet... but the hand looks really large, and i would have liked to see this little darling''s face better.', '2002-06-02 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65694, 1905, 1847, '<td valign="top">Well, I think I understand the problem people had with this photo.  The hand being the focus of the photo instead of the face came about because of the situation.  We have the most wonderful, delicate photo of our older son''s hand, and were dying to get a similar photo of our younger son''s hand.<br/><br/>He was finally resting quietly with his hand uncovered, so I grabbed the camera and started shooting.  The first shots were solely of the hand, but I started to move around and get different angles.  This was about the 5th or 6th shot of the session.  The focus on the hand over the face was 100% intentional.<br/><br/>So while I "disagree" with the focus comments, I WILL take away from this challenge the need to examine the subject from a number of angles and viewpoints.  I wish I had shot a few photos of the face in focus, or with a much wider DOF and everything in focus.<br/><br/>Thanks for the input!</td>', 'Well, I think I understand the problem people had with this photo.  The hand being the focus of the photo instead of the face came about because of the situation.  We have the most wonderful, delicate photo of our older son''s hand, and were dying to get a similar photo of our younger son''s hand.He was finally resting quietly with his hand uncovered, so I grabbed the camera and started shooting.  The first shots were solely of the hand, but I started to move around and get different angles.  This was about the 5th or 6th shot of the session.  The focus on the hand over the face was 100% intentional.So while I "disagree" with the focus comments, I WILL take away from this challenge the need to examine the subject from a number of angles and viewpoints.  I wish I had shot a few photos of the face in focus, or with a much wider DOF and everything in focus.Thanks for the input!', '2002-06-03 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65695, 1905, 139, '<td valign="top">This was one of my 10s.  I absolutely loved the competition for my eye between the OOF face and the in-focus and.</td>', 'This was one of my 10s.  I absolutely loved the competition for my eye between the OOF face and the in-focus and.', '2002-06-08 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(65696, 1906, 1360, '<td valign="top">scariest thing about this face is that it''s out of focus, and a bit noisy :)</td>', 'scariest thing about this face is that it''s out of focus, and a bit noisy :)', '2002-05-27 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65697, 1906, 806, '<td valign="top">or maybe... "out of focus face". Sorry. (edit): humorous at the same time: I''m increasing my vote.</td>', 'or maybe... "out of focus face". Sorry. (edit): humorous at the same time: I''m increasing my vote.', '2002-05-27 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
