(65757, 1908, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute, clever, but ....I am not buying it.  These are not people or a person, rather a part of a person.  Are your fingers really that red? (or is it just my monitor?)<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 2 (I scored all "partial people" down similarly, don''t feel bad)  total 4</td>', 'Cute, clever, but ....I am not buying it.  These are not people or a person, rather a part of a person.  Are your fingers really that red? (or is it just my monitor?)Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 2 (I scored all "partial people" down similarly, don''t feel bad)  total 4', '2002-05-29 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65758, 1908, 255, '<td valign="top">very cute--but--i think to have made this stand out more i would have changed the lighting and put the little folks up against a dark background to make them seem almost suspended, thus adding a little drama to the shot! hey--is freddy sticking his tongue out at me?! ;)</td>', 'very cute--but--i think to have made this stand out more i would have changed the lighting and put the little folks up against a dark background to make them seem almost suspended, thus adding a little drama to the shot! hey--is freddy sticking his tongue out at me?! ;)', '2002-05-29 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
