(65791, 1910, 301, '<td valign="top">great capture - a possibility for the 21st :)  I think i''d rather see this in portrait and not crop the top of the head. Also a spot just over the shoulder that has reflected the flash.</td>', 'great capture - a possibility for the 21st :)  I think i''d rather see this in portrait and not crop the top of the head. Also a spot just over the shoulder that has reflected the flash.', '2002-05-30 05:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
