(65813, 1912, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great photo... but is this indoors? I don''t know why that should make me like it less, but the rain just seems too heavy to be real, and it would be much more interesting with some outdoor surroundings.</td>', 'Great photo... but is this indoors? I don''t know why that should make me like it less, but the rain just seems too heavy to be real, and it would be much more interesting with some outdoor surroundings.', '2002-05-27 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
