(65847, 1912, 312, '<td valign="top">in my very humble opinion, this is the best shot that i''ve seen on dpchallenge since its inception. perfect. you should be very proud of it. i''d love to see it in black and white just for kicks, but it''s just fine in color. great job.</td>', 'in my very humble opinion, this is the best shot that i''ve seen on dpchallenge since its inception. perfect. you should be very proud of it. i''d love to see it in black and white just for kicks, but it''s just fine in color. great job.', '2002-05-28 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65848, 1912, 1759, '<td valign="top">I like it! Simple, uncluttered, well lit, soft, and wet. What could improve it? That''s a tough one. Perhaps dressing the boy in a rain suit or something akin to "Singing in the Rain."  Very well done!</td>', 'I like it! Simple, uncluttered, well lit, soft, and wet. What could improve it? That''s a tough one. Perhaps dressing the boy in a rain suit or something akin to "Singing in the Rain."  Very well done!', '2002-05-28 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65849, 1912, 885, '<td valign="top">the lighting is really good, as it shows the water coming off the umbrella in back.</td>', 'the lighting is really good, as it shows the water coming off the umbrella in back.', '2002-05-28 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65850, 1912, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is my vote for best photo of the week.  I keep coming back and looking at this, its one of those photographs that stays with you long after you close the window.</td>', 'This is my vote for best photo of the week.  I keep coming back and looking at this, its one of those photographs that stays with you long after you close the window.', '2002-05-29 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
