(65900, 1914, 1603, '<td valign="top">Good shot...Could of darkened the background though.  Otherwise great portrait.<br/></td>', 'Good shot...Could of darkened the background though.  Otherwise great portrait.', '2002-05-29 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65901, 1914, 878, '<td valign="top">Great colors and lighting, the white undershirt is a slight distraction but nothing major.</td>', 'Great colors and lighting, the white undershirt is a slight distraction but nothing major.', '2002-05-30 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65902, 1914, 1175, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait of a weathered man.  You would have done better with some kind of a back drop rather than being able to see parts of your house.  Lighting might work well in some circles but I would have prefered a half lit face for more dramatic effect.  Oh yeah, the self-portrait challenge was a few weeks ago. ;)</td>', 'Nice portrait of a weathered man.  You would have done better with some kind of a back drop rather than being able to see parts of your house.  Lighting might work well in some circles but I would have prefered a half lit face for more dramatic effect.  Oh yeah, the self-portrait challenge was a few weeks ago. ;)', '2002-05-31 07:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65903, 1914, 1031, '<td valign="top">What''s often the most difficult subject, handled well.</td>', 'What''s often the most difficult subject, handled well.', '2002-06-01 22:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65904, 1914, 2, '<td valign="top">I liked this image a little better in the thumbnail because all of the blacks faded together.  Could you adjust the levels on this shot to get the darks just a little darker so that they did?  I think that effect would really make this image stand out.  As it is, I''m just a little distracted by the objects still slightly visible in the background.</td>', 'I liked this image a little better in the thumbnail because all of the blacks faded together.  Could you adjust the levels on this shot to get the darks just a little darker so that they did?  I think that effect would really make this image stand out.  As it is, I''m just a little distracted by the objects still slightly visible in the background.', '2002-06-02 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65905, 1915, 661, '<td valign="top">Nice Catch!!  He does look a little self satisfied, doesn''t he?</td>', 'Nice Catch!!  He does look a little self satisfied, doesn''t he?', '2002-05-27 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65906, 1915, 1211, '<td valign="top">This is shot a great shot.  I love it!  So spontaneous.  The expression on the gentleman getting his picture taken is priceless.  (Later) I''m still laughing</td>', 'This is shot a great shot.  I love it!  So spontaneous.  The expression on the gentleman getting his picture taken is priceless.  (Later) I''m still laughing', '2002-05-27 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65907, 1915, 301, '<td valign="top">interesting concept.  Don''t really like the composition here.  The photographer has nearly been chopped off, with hardly any space to his right, whilst there is plent of room beside the person standing.  Background is a little too busy too.</td>', 'interesting concept.  Don''t really like the composition here.  The photographer has nearly been chopped off, with hardly any space to his right, whilst there is plent of room beside the person standing.  Background is a little too busy too.', '2002-05-27 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65908, 1915, 327, '<td valign="top">I love the colors. Interesting shot, bit busy but I like it. Is this Hong Kong? Could work.</td>', 'I love the colors. Interesting shot, bit busy but I like it. Is this Hong Kong? Could work.', '2002-05-27 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65909, 1915, 1061, '<td valign="top">Funny!</td>', 'Funny!', '2002-05-27 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65910, 1915, 1750, '<td valign="top">Love this. What saves the subject from a busy background is  the strings of flags which form a visual frame.</td>', 'Love this. What saves the subject from a busy background is  the strings of flags which form a visual frame.', '2002-05-28 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65911, 1915, 772, '<td valign="top">Photographers photographing photographers :)  Good job!</td>', 'Photographers photographing photographers :)  Good job!', '2002-05-28 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65912, 1915, 1680, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Very unique. I was actually thinking of doing something like this for my photo.</td>', 'Great shot! Very unique. I was actually thinking of doing something like this for my photo.', '2002-05-28 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65913, 1915, 280, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective that the guy in the bottom right hand corner gives the shot.<br/></td>', 'I like the perspective that the guy in the bottom right hand corner gives the shot.', '2002-05-28 16:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65914, 1915, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love the photographer in the foreground more than the subject!  The trim suit and that conservative crouch... so cool!  And your admiral looks so expansive and proud... This made me laugh!</td>', 'I love the photographer in the foreground more than the subject!  The trim suit and that conservative crouch... so cool!  And your admiral looks so expansive and proud... This made me laugh!', '2002-05-28 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65915, 1915, 1005, '<td valign="top">Focus appears to be on the cameraman (not you silly).  I like the idea of taking a picture of someone taking a picture, mabye you should have titled this one Photographer of an Admiral for the Day.<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 7 People 7 total 7  (No suggestions for improvement, sorry, maybe it''s time to stop evaluating photos for the day.)</td>', 'Focus appears to be on the cameraman (not you silly).  I like the idea of taking a picture of someone taking a picture, mabye you should have titled this one Photographer of an Admiral for the Day.Photo 8 Creativity 7 People 7 total 7  (No suggestions for improvement, sorry, maybe it''s time to stop evaluating photos for the day.)', '2002-05-28 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65916, 1915, 1679, '<td valign="top">I do not know what, but there is something funny about it!</td>', 'I do not know what, but there is something funny about it!', '2002-05-29 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65917, 1915, 1024, '<td valign="top">I suppose you could not have helped the busy background so I am not marking you down for that.  Interesting concept of taking a photo of someone taking a photo.  I like irony.</td>', 'I suppose you could not have helped the busy background so I am not marking you down for that.  Interesting concept of taking a photo of someone taking a photo.  I like irony.', '2002-05-30 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65918, 1915, 573, '<td valign="top">I like the story, photographer taking a snapshot, too bad the background is so cluttered.</td>', 'I like the story, photographer taking a snapshot, too bad the background is so cluttered.', '2002-05-30 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65919, 1915, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for a shot, good detail, ownly downside is the clutter in the shot.  But what the heck the other guy didnt have a problem with it :)</td>', 'Nice idea for a shot, good detail, ownly downside is the clutter in the shot.  But what the heck the other guy didnt have a problem with it :)', '2002-06-02 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65920, 1915, 1, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have cropped so tightly the photographer''s right side.  Your focus seems more so on the photographer which I''m wondering why you did that.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have cropped so tightly the photographer''s right side.  Your focus seems more so on the photographer which I''m wondering why you did that.', '2002-06-02 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65921, 1916, 1379, '<td valign="top">Any dolphins in that wake?  I like how the hats mirror the deck, and the posture of the little sailor really implies the acceleration of the craft.  It looks like it was a fun journey!</td>', 'Any dolphins in that wake?  I like how the hats mirror the deck, and the posture of the little sailor really implies the acceleration of the craft.  It looks like it was a fun journey!', '2002-05-27 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65922, 1916, 1750, '<td valign="top">Like the feel and the story in this picture. Great placement of subjects.</td>', 'Like the feel and the story in this picture. Great placement of subjects.', '2002-05-27 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65923, 1916, 668, '<td valign="top">nice blues.  brighter?</td>', 'nice blues.  brighter?', '2002-05-27 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65924, 1916, 661, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly washed out???</td>', 'Looks slightly washed out???', '2002-05-27 16:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65925, 1916, 327, '<td valign="top">Hey fun shot of _people_. Love the blue it''s very nice. Good perspective and clean clear shot. Nice.</td>', 'Hey fun shot of _people_. Love the blue it''s very nice. Good perspective and clean clear shot. Nice.', '2002-05-27 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65926, 1916, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo.. Let me take a moment to comment on one of *my* own opinions... I try, at all costs, to avoid photographing people from the back.  When ''people'' or a ''person'' is the subject of my photo, I want to capture faces and possibly emotions as well.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo.. Let me take a moment to comment on one of *my* own opinions... I try, at all costs, to avoid photographing people from the back.  When ''people'' or a ''person'' is the subject of my photo, I want to capture faces and possibly emotions as well.', '2002-05-27 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65927, 1916, 570, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2002-05-28 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65928, 1916, 1005, '<td valign="top">Turn ''em around, let''s see their faces (or at least not their b*tts).  Right sailor overly bright compared to left sailor (in the same suit, I am assuming), try to balance more evenly.  Centering the subjects wouldn''t hurt, did the boat sway starboard?<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 6 People 9 total 8</td>', 'Turn ''em around, let''s see their faces (or at least not their b*tts).  Right sailor overly bright compared to left sailor (in the same suit, I am assuming), try to balance more evenly.  Centering the subjects wouldn''t hurt, did the boat sway starboard?Photo 9 Creativity 6 People 9 total 8', '2002-05-28 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65929, 1916, 509, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit too blue for me.  It''s interesting that the clothes of the people match the deck and water, but it leaves it without much color depth to me.</td>', 'The image is a bit too blue for me.  It''s interesting that the clothes of the people match the deck and water, but it leaves it without much color depth to me.', '2002-05-29 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65930, 1916, 1679, '<td valign="top">It could do better with higher contrast. It is a tad flat this way. Boosting up the colours would also help bring out those blues. Try it on your own time and see the difference it can make.</td>', 'It could do better with higher contrast. It is a tad flat this way. Boosting up the colours would also help bring out those blues. Try it on your own time and see the difference it can make.', '2002-05-29 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65931, 1916, 885, '<td valign="top">the matching blues are interesting - they almost look artificial.  I like how the one darker-clothed kid is in the center, while the outside two seem to be dressed identically, as it gives the picture an interesting symmentry.  I think maybe the blue is oversaturated though.</td>', 'the matching blues are interesting - they almost look artificial.  I like how the one darker-clothed kid is in the center, while the outside two seem to be dressed identically, as it gives the picture an interesting symmentry.  I think maybe the blue is oversaturated though.', '2002-05-30 19:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65932, 1916, 1078, '<td valign="top">Wow, I can''t say for sure, but based on my own work with water, the colors here look a little too saturated (blue -- but maybe they really are that blue) and the picture overall is definitely very light.  I''m sure you did it to bring out all the blue, and perhaps it''s a monitor calibration problem, but I think stepping it down a notch or two would have been fine.  If possible, getting the subjects out of the shadow of the funnel (?) might have helped as well.</td>', 'Wow, I can''t say for sure, but based on my own work with water, the colors here look a little too saturated (blue -- but maybe they really are that blue) and the picture overall is definitely very light.  I''m sure you did it to bring out all the blue, and perhaps it''s a monitor calibration problem, but I think stepping it down a notch or two would have been fine.  If possible, getting the subjects out of the shadow of the funnel (?) might have helped as well.', '2002-05-31 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65933, 1916, 543, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blues, and well composed.  I wonder how it would look if you''d shot from farther to the right so that the railing was straight, but this works too.</td>', 'Beautiful blues, and well composed.  I wonder how it would look if you''d shot from farther to the right so that the railing was straight, but this works too.', '2002-05-31 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65934, 1916, 1031, '<td valign="top">Who''s at the helm?</td>', 'Who''s at the helm?', '2002-06-01 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65935, 1917, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great candid subject!  I love that he is slightly flushed,  and he''s got that great anticipatory embrochure,  He looks so serious and intent.  The overcast quality of the day really adds to this.</td>', 'Great candid subject!  I love that he is slightly flushed,  and he''s got that great anticipatory embrochure,  He looks so serious and intent.  The overcast quality of the day really adds to this.', '2002-05-27 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65936, 1917, 327, '<td valign="top">This is very nice work. Sorry about the horn being cut off. Needed a little better composition or perspective. This is a clean clear shot with good color. Nice job.</td>', 'This is very nice work. Sorry about the horn being cut off. Needed a little better composition or perspective. This is a clean clear shot with good color. Nice job.', '2002-05-27 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65937, 1917, 1878, '<td valign="top">The title of the picture does not seem to correspond with the actual picture.  Try picking out names that are unique.</td>', 'The title of the picture does not seem to correspond with the actual picture.  Try picking out names that are unique.', '2002-05-27 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65938, 1917, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I think the framing on this photo could have been a little better... I would like it even more if the trupmet and hat were not clipped out of the frame :)</td>', 'Very nice!  I think the framing on this photo could have been a little better... I would like it even more if the trupmet and hat were not clipped out of the frame :)', '2002-05-28 05:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65939, 1917, 656, '<td valign="top">is that xylaphone really growing out of his back ?   <br/><br/>Being careful of things in the background makes a big difference for ''people'' pics</td>', 'is that xylaphone really growing out of his back ?   Being careful of things in the background makes a big difference for ''people'' pics', '2002-05-28 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65940, 1917, 1, '<td valign="top">There seems to be somewhat of a haze over the picture that is easily removed with an auto-level.  Otherwise, nice composure -- I wouldn''t have cropped out the tip of his horn though.</td>', 'There seems to be somewhat of a haze over the picture that is easily removed with an auto-level.  Otherwise, nice composure -- I wouldn''t have cropped out the tip of his horn though.', '2002-05-28 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65941, 1917, 1005, '<td valign="top">Title implies there was a problem, what was it?  Good photo, slight issues with cropping, i.e. part of the trumpet and music card lopped off, plus there is that xylophone hanging in mid-air.<br/>Good color, lighting, focus.  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8</td>', 'Title implies there was a problem, what was it?  Good photo, slight issues with cropping, i.e. part of the trumpet and music card lopped off, plus there is that xylophone hanging in mid-air.Good color, lighting, focus.  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8', '2002-05-28 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65942, 1917, 885, '<td valign="top">The umbrellas in the background really make a difference in this photo.  The trumpet and glockenspiel really give it a context.</td>', 'The umbrellas in the background really make a difference in this photo.  The trumpet and glockenspiel really give it a context.', '2002-05-29 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65943, 1917, 301, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused.  It''s a shame that the xylaphone in the background looks like it''s attached to your subject</td>', 'Nicely focused.  It''s a shame that the xylaphone in the background looks like it''s attached to your subject', '2002-05-30 05:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65944, 1917, 1750, '<td valign="top">I like these cold-toned pictures. The horn and the white belt and baldrick give just the right color counterpoint.</td>', 'I like these cold-toned pictures. The horn and the white belt and baldrick give just the right color counterpoint.', '2002-06-02 03:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
