(65948, 1918, 1175, '<td valign="top">Is this even possible without taking a few pictures.  The girl in the upper left has a pretty smile.  You should have focused on her.  There is just too much going on here.</td>', 'Is this even possible without taking a few pictures.  The girl in the upper left has a pretty smile.  You should have focused on her.  There is just too much going on here.', '2002-05-27 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
