(65960, 1918, 1005, '<td valign="top">Trippy shot!  Multiple exposure?  Is this "legal"?  Bright light on left middle VERY distracting.  Light squiggle on right middle center reminds me of a scratched slide photo.  Too much overlaying, many of the faces are obsured.<br/>I just can''t "get behind" this shot, sorry.  Photo 5 Creativity 9 People 5 total 5 (creatvitity alone can''t carry this one, the people come first!   Power to the people!)</td>', 'Trippy shot!  Multiple exposure?  Is this "legal"?  Bright light on left middle VERY distracting.  Light squiggle on right middle center reminds me of a scratched slide photo.  Too much overlaying, many of the faces are obsured.I just can''t "get behind" this shot, sorry.  Photo 5 Creativity 9 People 5 total 5 (creatvitity alone can''t carry this one, the people come first!   Power to the people!)', '2002-05-28 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65961, 1918, 1446, '<td valign="top">I like the mutted colors of this...But the whole movement thing leaves me dizzy.</td>', 'I like the mutted colors of this...But the whole movement thing leaves me dizzy.', '2002-05-28 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
