(65983, 1919, 1859, '<td valign="top">you''ve got to be kidding</td>', 'you''ve got to be kidding', '2002-05-27 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65984, 1919, 327, '<td valign="top">lol this shot struck me funny. It''s done well, clear, clean and good color. Maybe cropping the top fringe and bottom glasses out would of helped. Still it''s nice work.</td>', 'lol this shot struck me funny. It''s done well, clear, clean and good color. Maybe cropping the top fringe and bottom glasses out would of helped. Still it''s nice work.', '2002-05-27 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65985, 1919, 656, '<td valign="top">but are they bored, or bored of each other ?</td>', 'but are they bored, or bored of each other ?', '2002-05-28 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65986, 1919, 1882, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite understand why you submitted this photo.  There''s nothing noteworthy about it.  Although it did bore me, just like the couple posing.</td>', 'I don''t quite understand why you submitted this photo.  There''s nothing noteworthy about it.  Although it did bore me, just like the couple posing.', '2002-05-28 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65987, 1919, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems real snap shooty, like not too much thought went into this.  You need to work on your framing and composure: like the drinks don''t need to be there, and there''s a slight tilt to the photo that shouldnt be.</td>', 'Seems real snap shooty, like not too much thought went into this.  You need to work on your framing and composure: like the drinks don''t need to be there, and there''s a slight tilt to the photo that shouldnt be.', '2002-05-28 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65988, 1919, 1446, '<td valign="top">Yep.  They look bored. You have some red-eye going on here.</td>', 'Yep.  They look bored. You have some red-eye going on here.', '2002-05-28 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65989, 1919, 1175, '<td valign="top">The feeling of boredom is expressed well.  This is too much of a snapshot.  Flash is way to hars.  What''s with the strings at the top of the picture?</td>', 'The feeling of boredom is expressed well.  This is too much of a snapshot.  Flash is way to hars.  What''s with the strings at the top of the picture?', '2002-05-28 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65990, 1919, 737, '<td valign="top">Hard to fake boredom. Great shot. I keep wondering - will they go out together again ? In my top 3.</td>', 'Hard to fake boredom. Great shot. I keep wondering - will they go out together again ? In my top 3.', '2002-05-28 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65991, 1919, 1897, '<td valign="top">snapshot</td>', 'snapshot', '2002-05-28 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65992, 1919, 1005, '<td valign="top">You are right, they are bored, which leads to a boring photo.  Good color, good focus, O.K. background, for the situation.  Maybe a bit too much flash, move back a step and try again.  * Say something funny/silly/outrageous next time!!<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 7 total 7</td>', 'You are right, they are bored, which leads to a boring photo.  Good color, good focus, O.K. background, for the situation.  Maybe a bit too much flash, move back a step and try again.  * Say something funny/silly/outrageous next time!!Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 7 total 7', '2002-05-28 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65993, 1919, 1031, '<td valign="top">Quick, lend them your camera. They look like they need a hobby right away!</td>', 'Quick, lend them your camera. They look like they need a hobby right away!', '2002-06-01 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65994, 1920, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, well framed. I like the way the light glances off her hair, and the blue sets off the outlines of her body. The stuff at the top is a bit disappointing though.</td>', 'Very pretty, well framed. I like the way the light glances off her hair, and the blue sets off the outlines of her body. The stuff at the top is a bit disappointing though.', '2002-05-27 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65995, 1920, 1808, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2002-05-27 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65996, 1920, 772, '<td valign="top">Cute shot!  I fill flash would have really provided some more nice lighting on her face and skin... good job!</td>', 'Cute shot!  I fill flash would have really provided some more nice lighting on her face and skin... good job!', '2002-05-27 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65997, 1920, 449, '<td valign="top">My best friend has a daughter that looks just like this. She would shit a brick if she saw this pic. I must say, this will recieve a 10.</td>', 'My best friend has a daughter that looks just like this. She would shit a brick if she saw this pic. I must say, this will recieve a 10.', '2002-05-27 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65998, 1920, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful eyes, great look on her face. Darling. Lighting is little poor but this is really nice work, I like it a lot!! Congrats on a great shot.</td>', 'Wonderful eyes, great look on her face. Darling. Lighting is little poor but this is really nice work, I like it a lot!! Congrats on a great shot.', '2002-05-27 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(65999, 1920, 671, '<td valign="top">The luminous quality of this shot is beautiful.</td>', 'The luminous quality of this shot is beautiful.', '2002-05-27 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66000, 1920, 301, '<td valign="top">nice capture.  I love the way her hair has caught the sun.  Some fill-in flash would have helped to correct the exposure.  I know how hard it is to get a great photo of kids - not like you can get them to sit still, pose and look at the camera until you get the settings right, so well done anyway :)</td>', 'nice capture.  I love the way her hair has caught the sun.  Some fill-in flash would have helped to correct the exposure.  I know how hard it is to get a great photo of kids - not like you can get them to sit still, pose and look at the camera until you get the settings right, so well done anyway :)', '2002-05-28 08:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66001, 1920, 1520, '<td valign="top">Might''ve tried a reflector to bounce a little more light onto her face.  <br/><br/>Might''ve composed the shot so the background was all blue, that way her hair would have a really nice halo effect.  <br/><br/>Looks good when the shoulders are angled to the camera like that.<br/></td>', 'Might''ve tried a reflector to bounce a little more light onto her face.  Might''ve composed the shot so the background was all blue, that way her hair would have a really nice halo effect.  Looks good when the shoulders are angled to the camera like that.', '2002-05-28 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66002, 1920, 1005, '<td valign="top">A little more light on her face would have been nice.  VERY Cute!  What''s with the upper part of the background?  Roof shingles?<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 6 People 8 total 7</td>', 'A little more light on her face would have been nice.  VERY Cute!  What''s with the upper part of the background?  Roof shingles?Photo 9 Creativity 6 People 8 total 7', '2002-05-28 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66003, 1920, 1041, '<td valign="top">She''s not too happy, is she?  Great capture, shame Emma''s in the shade though.  Would it have been possible to position the camera a little lower (even though you''ve made a good attempt to get down to her level)?</td>', 'She''s not too happy, is she?  Great capture, shame Emma''s in the shade though.  Would it have been possible to position the camera a little lower (even though you''ve made a good attempt to get down to her level)?', '2002-05-28 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66004, 1920, 1759, '<td valign="top">Wonderful face! The blue background really works in this one, but the white on top is distractive and the hair highlights are overbearing. I believe it would be killer if you crop the top to eliminate the white and crop on the left just beyond her hair so she is no longer centered, but offset to the left a bit. Doing this you loose a little of her hair, but that''s okay because it leaves just the right amount of highlight in her hair. You might also adjust the levels to bring out her skin, but just a little.</td>', 'Wonderful face! The blue background really works in this one, but the white on top is distractive and the hair highlights are overbearing. I believe it would be killer if you crop the top to eliminate the white and crop on the left just beyond her hair so she is no longer centered, but offset to the left a bit. Doing this you loose a little of her hair, but that''s okay because it leaves just the right amount of highlight in her hair. You might also adjust the levels to bring out her skin, but just a little.', '2002-05-28 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66005, 1920, 811, '<td valign="top">At first it looked like she had maku-up on, but I think it is the blue reflecting.  It would have almost been worth cutting part of her head out of the picture  to have a totally blue background.  I like the expression on her face.</td>', 'At first it looked like she had maku-up on, but I think it is the blue reflecting.  It would have almost been worth cutting part of her head out of the picture  to have a totally blue background.  I like the expression on her face.', '2002-05-28 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66006, 1920, 885, '<td valign="top">Cute kid and great expression.  The contrast of the yellow sunlight on her hair to the blue background is lovely.  But the blue sort of gives a blue-ish tint to her skin too, that I''m not so sure about.</td>', 'Cute kid and great expression.  The contrast of the yellow sunlight on her hair to the blue background is lovely.  But the blue sort of gives a blue-ish tint to her skin too, that I''m not so sure about.', '2002-05-29 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66007, 1920, 1585, '<td valign="top">Why so sad? Good photo.</td>', 'Why so sad? Good photo.', '2002-05-29 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66008, 1920, 616, '<td valign="top">The blue back ground is a good addition to those beautiful blue eyes.</td>', 'The blue back ground is a good addition to those beautiful blue eyes.', '2002-05-29 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66009, 1920, 674, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen more light in the eyes and slightly less red in the skin tones. the blue is also to strong on the rightside shoulder and arm lovely facial expression</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen more light in the eyes and slightly less red in the skin tones. the blue is also to strong on the rightside shoulder and arm lovely facial expression', '2002-05-30 00:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66010, 1920, 436, '<td valign="top">what vibrant color! beautifully lit and what a devine face!</td>', 'what vibrant color! beautifully lit and what a devine face!', '2002-05-30 09:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66011, 1920, 1175, '<td valign="top">background is quite bland, the change in it at the top is distracting.  Noon sun lighting is bad.  Should have had some light from the front.</td>', 'background is quite bland, the change in it at the top is distracting.  Noon sun lighting is bad.  Should have had some light from the front.', '2002-05-31 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66012, 1920, 1945, '<td valign="top">very cute</td>', 'very cute', '2002-06-01 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66013, 1920, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great look. A little dark on my monitor...</td>', 'Great look. A little dark on my monitor...', '2002-06-01 22:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66014, 1920, 1, '<td valign="top">This shot isn''t the most appealing for this child, I think you could''ve done better.  Shooting people isn''t about gettin them at their worst.</td>', 'This shot isn''t the most appealing for this child, I think you could''ve done better.  Shooting people isn''t about gettin them at their worst.', '2002-06-02 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66015, 1921, 1175, '<td valign="top">Hmm... you got the people.  Now do something with it.  Its a bit dark.  I''m not really excited to be there if I''m just laying on the floor.</td>', 'Hmm... you got the people.  Now do something with it.  Its a bit dark.  I''m not really excited to be there if I''m just laying on the floor.', '2002-05-27 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66016, 1921, 801, '<td valign="top">beatifull contrast between different kind of lights. Great atmosphere (I like to be there!)</td>', 'beatifull contrast between different kind of lights. Great atmosphere (I like to be there!)', '2002-05-27 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66017, 1921, 1808, '<td valign="top">From the floor?</td>', 'From the floor?', '2002-05-27 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66018, 1921, 668, '<td valign="top">want more confusion</td>', 'want more confusion', '2002-05-27 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66019, 1921, 138, '<td valign="top">i DJ''d at a middle school that looked just like that</td>', 'i DJ''d at a middle school that looked just like that', '2002-05-27 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66020, 1921, 1569, '<td valign="top">Camera should have been above the toes in the foreground.</td>', 'Camera should have been above the toes in the foreground.', '2002-05-27 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66021, 1921, 661, '<td valign="top">The florescent light is distracting to me.</td>', 'The florescent light is distracting to me.', '2002-05-27 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66022, 1921, 327, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and good color. Interesting work. Nice job.</td>', 'Great perspective and good color. Interesting work. Nice job.', '2002-05-27 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66023, 1921, 1772, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!  The movement "ghosts" make me feel that I am actually at the party.</td>', 'Great perspective!  The movement "ghosts" make me feel that I am actually at the party.', '2002-05-27 19:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66024, 1921, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting perspective and angle but I see a lot of ''backs'' instead of faces... I know that the challenge is ''people'' with no specifics.  I, personally, would rather see faces when possible...</td>', 'This is an interesting perspective and angle but I see a lot of ''backs'' instead of faces... I know that the challenge is ''people'' with no specifics.  I, personally, would rather see faces when possible...', '2002-05-27 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66025, 1921, 1446, '<td valign="top">Lots of blurry movement here.  Sorry but not a fan of oof objects in the forground.</td>', 'Lots of blurry movement here.  Sorry but not a fan of oof objects in the forground.', '2002-05-29 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66026, 1921, 1005, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if you were going for the motion effect, or if lack of lighting required slower shutter, but the overall effect is a bit nausiating.  Low angle shot also adds interest, but nets a diminished view of your grouping.  All in all, try getting to a better lighting situation and try looking downwards at your crowd instead of up,  heads are more interesting to most than feet.  Finally, if you are going to attempt motion, try smaller groups that are moving a bit more uniformly.  You took a risk on this shot and I hate to score you down for it, but then some risks do that to you.<br/>Photo 5 Creativity 7 People 6 total 6        P.S. lights glaring from the ceiling also hurt your overall shot/score as well as the leg/post along the right side of the photo.</td>', 'Don''t know if you were going for the motion effect, or if lack of lighting required slower shutter, but the overall effect is a bit nausiating.  Low angle shot also adds interest, but nets a diminished view of your grouping.  All in all, try getting to a better lighting situation and try looking downwards at your crowd instead of up,  heads are more interesting to most than feet.  Finally, if you are going to attempt motion, try smaller groups that are moving a bit more uniformly.  You took a risk on this shot and I hate to score you down for it, but then some risks do that to you.Photo 5 Creativity 7 People 6 total 6        P.S. lights glaring from the ceiling also hurt your overall shot/score as well as the leg/post along the right side of the photo.', '2002-05-29 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66027, 1921, 616, '<td valign="top">Are those blue toe nails that I see?</td>', 'Are those blue toe nails that I see?', '2002-05-29 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66028, 1921, 689, '<td valign="top">I like the movement in this ... just wish it was higher or the foot wasnt in the right side ...</td>', 'I like the movement in this ... just wish it was higher or the foot wasnt in the right side ...', '2002-05-31 00:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66029, 1921, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. The camera angle is great, and the motion blur is a really cool effect. A bit like being at a party after a few drinks :). My eye keeps going back to the girl in the pale blue dress near the wall. I like the way she''s standing.</td>', 'I like this a lot. The camera angle is great, and the motion blur is a really cool effect. A bit like being at a party after a few drinks :). My eye keeps going back to the girl in the pale blue dress near the wall. I like the way she''s standing.', '2002-05-31 03:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66030, 1922, 1360, '<td valign="top">Very graceful picture, the nose bubble kinda bugs me tho.</td>', 'Very graceful picture, the nose bubble kinda bugs me tho.', '2002-05-27 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66031, 1922, 1024, '<td valign="top">The idea behnd this is great, but the bubble coming out of her nose is very distracting to me.  I love the bright colors and the texture of the water on her hair..... if not for that bubble I would have given you a 10.</td>', 'The idea behnd this is great, but the bubble coming out of her nose is very distracting to me.  I love the bright colors and the texture of the water on her hair..... if not for that bubble I would have given you a 10.', '2002-05-27 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66032, 1922, 1867, '<td valign="top">i miss the waves, but love the little bubbles!  nice crop, too!</td>', 'i miss the waves, but love the little bubbles!  nice crop, too!', '2002-05-27 08:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66033, 1922, 1808, '<td valign="top">Good action with the bubble and the water.</td>', 'Good action with the bubble and the water.', '2002-05-27 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(66034, 1922, 668, '<td valign="top">more bubbles please</td>', 'more bubbles please', '2002-05-27 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66035, 1922, 1569, '<td valign="top">Way too much distortion from the water.Is that a bubble or a nose ring?</td>', 'Way too much distortion from the water.Is that a bubble or a nose ring?', '2002-05-27 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66036, 1922, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent framing, color, composition.  gets an 8 from me.</td>', 'excellent framing, color, composition.  gets an 8 from me.', '2002-05-27 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66037, 1922, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, clear, clean shot. Not crazy for the cropping job, but it''s good work.</td>', 'Wonderful colors, clear, clean shot. Not crazy for the cropping job, but it''s good work.', '2002-05-27 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66038, 1922, 1877, '<td valign="top">think the photo should have been taken closer to the way the design of her suit is reacting with the water, see in the back? it looks really neato, but her face and the cleavage shot seem to take away from it. Abstract with a hand or something would have been pretty cool.</td>', 'think the photo should have been taken closer to the way the design of her suit is reacting with the water, see in the back? it looks really neato, but her face and the cleavage shot seem to take away from it. Abstract with a hand or something would have been pretty cool.', '2002-05-27 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66039, 1922, 1061, '<td valign="top">Good timing</td>', 'Good timing', '2002-05-27 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66040, 1922, 1446, '<td valign="top">I love the detail you captured on this photograph.  One of my 10''s for this week.</td>', 'I love the detail you captured on this photograph.  One of my 10''s for this week.', '2002-05-28 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66041, 1922, 772, '<td valign="top">It looks like she has a big ole snot bubble coming out of her nose.  I''m thinking that she should have wiped her nose before she got in the pool.  It looks like there is another snot bubble getting ready to go in her ear.  I''m thinkin all these snot bubbles are gross.  Are the snot bubbles the ''subject'' of this photo or is the subject her boobs?  I would have rather seen more boobs and less snot.</td>', 'It looks like she has a big ole snot bubble coming out of her nose.  I''m thinking that she should have wiped her nose before she got in the pool.  It looks like there is another snot bubble getting ready to go in her ear.  I''m thinkin all these snot bubbles are gross.  Are the snot bubbles the ''subject'' of this photo or is the subject her boobs?  I would have rather seen more boobs and less snot.', '2002-05-28 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66042, 1922, 1037, '<td valign="top">The refraction is an interesting effect, but I don''t actually like the way it distorts her body. It flattens the perspective and the blue glow makes her look like a corpse! More could have been made of that in an artistic sense, perhaps, if you had been able to experiment with different framing/cropping/post processing effects, but this photo doesn''t seem to take advantage of the things the water distortion could achieve.</td>', 'The refraction is an interesting effect, but I don''t actually like the way it distorts her body. It flattens the perspective and the blue glow makes her look like a corpse! More could have been made of that in an artistic sense, perhaps, if you had been able to experiment with different framing/cropping/post processing effects, but this photo doesn''t seem to take advantage of the things the water distortion could achieve.', '2002-05-28 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66043, 1922, 1680, '<td valign="top">i like the concept but the shot needs to be pulled out.  You either need to capture her head or her whole body.  I also dont like the fact that her head is patially cut off and the bubble that is coming out of her nose looks like a booger.</td>', 'i like the concept but the shot needs to be pulled out.  You either need to capture her head or her whole body.  I also dont like the fact that her head is patially cut off and the bubble that is coming out of her nose looks like a booger.', '2002-05-28 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66044, 1922, 156, '<td valign="top">great catch, just breaking the surface; love the air bubbles...would have liked to see the eyes open too but not much you can do about that if the person can''t or won''t do it, eh?</td>', 'great catch, just breaking the surface; love the air bubbles...would have liked to see the eyes open too but not much you can do about that if the person can''t or won''t do it, eh?', '2002-05-28 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66045, 1922, 2, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors, and great timing.  She really looks like she''s swimming in a pool full of gel.</td>', 'Awesome colors, and great timing.  She really looks like she''s swimming in a pool full of gel.', '2002-05-28 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66046, 1922, 773, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Nice shot! ( Not sure about the air bubble though)  Excellent timing on this one.</td>', 'Wow!  Nice shot! ( Not sure about the air bubble though)  Excellent timing on this one.', '2002-05-28 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66047, 1922, 1759, '<td valign="top">This would be awesome, nearly perfect if not for the bubble coming out of her nose. It''s a great shot with excellent composition, color, contrast, texture, and balance, but that darn bubble...</td>', 'This would be awesome, nearly perfect if not for the bubble coming out of her nose. It''s a great shot with excellent composition, color, contrast, texture, and balance, but that darn bubble...', '2002-05-28 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66048, 1922, 806, '<td valign="top">I tried getting a shot similar to this, so I appreciate the difficulty. Nice and clear! Perfectly caught just as she is emerging from the water!</td>', 'I tried getting a shot similar to this, so I appreciate the difficulty. Nice and clear! Perfectly caught just as she is emerging from the water!', '2002-05-28 17:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66049, 1922, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''m not certain the air bubble coming out of her nose is such a good idea, but the rest of this really works for me.  Did you mean to get the camera and yourself in the shot?  Water reflections can be tricky that way.  Some of the reflections make her forehead appear "mottled".<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 10 People 9 total 9</td>', 'I''m not certain the air bubble coming out of her nose is such a good idea, but the rest of this really works for me.  Did you mean to get the camera and yourself in the shot?  Water reflections can be tricky that way.  Some of the reflections make her forehead appear "mottled".Photo 9 Creativity 10 People 9 total 9', '2002-05-28 17:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66050, 1922, 1899, '<td valign="top">Unusual treatment of subject matter</td>', 'Unusual treatment of subject matter', '2002-05-28 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66051, 1922, 205, '<td valign="top">and bubbles it looks like</td>', 'and bubbles it looks like', '2002-05-28 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66052, 1922, 1357, '<td valign="top">The ripple on the water makes the face details stand out. Well done</td>', 'The ripple on the water makes the face details stand out. Well done', '2002-05-29 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66053, 1922, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  Nice cropping.  The air bubbles detract a bit from the shot, but I understand that that''s not exactly something you have control over . . .</td>', 'Great idea!  Nice cropping.  The air bubbles detract a bit from the shot, but I understand that that''s not exactly something you have control over . . .', '2002-05-29 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66054, 1922, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful....  but the sensuality of the scene (the water, the model) is evaporated with that dang nose bubble!</td>', 'Very beautiful....  but the sensuality of the scene (the water, the model) is evaporated with that dang nose bubble!', '2002-05-29 17:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66055, 1922, 1009, '<td valign="top">Awesome job...</td>', 'Awesome job...', '2002-05-29 18:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66056, 1922, 1585, '<td valign="top">Great color. NIce and clear. Too bad about that bubble. You know the one.</td>', 'Great color. NIce and clear. Too bad about that bubble. You know the one.', '2002-05-29 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66057, 1922, 301, '<td valign="top">nice one.  Other than the unsightly bubble coming out of her nose, this is a well composed and interesting photo</td>', 'nice one.  Other than the unsightly bubble coming out of her nose, this is a well composed and interesting photo', '2002-05-30 07:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66058, 1922, 811, '<td valign="top">The orange contrasts nicely with the blue of the pool.  The nose bubble is hilarious.</td>', 'The orange contrasts nicely with the blue of the pool.  The nose bubble is hilarious.', '2002-05-31 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66059, 1922, 142, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation.</td>', 'Nice interpretation.', '2002-06-01 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66060, 1922, 1, '<td valign="top">Does she know you submitted this?  It''s not very appealing for her, I feel that shooting people isn''t about getting them at anything but their best.</td>', 'Does she know you submitted this?  It''s not very appealing for her, I feel that shooting people isn''t about getting them at anything but their best.', '2002-06-02 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66061, 1922, 1336, '<td valign="top">i like it.  the blue and orange colors are complimentary.</td>', 'i like it.  the blue and orange colors are complimentary.', '2002-06-02 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66062, 1922, 1446, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorite shots.  I gave it a 10.  I think you got robbed.</td>', 'This was one of my favorite shots.  I gave it a 10.  I think you got robbed.', '2002-06-04 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66063, 1922, 1715, '<td valign="top">Wow. I''ve noticed that people really like to give bad comments...  I think this was a very nice picture despite what some people may say :-) Keep up the good work. Yes that''s right this picture was good!!!</td>', 'Wow. I''ve noticed that people really like to give bad comments...  I think this was a very nice picture despite what some people may say :-) Keep up the good work. Yes that''s right this picture was good!!!', '2002-06-05 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66064, 1922, 671, '<td valign="top">I liked everything about this photo.  The way the water curving over her head looks like jello, glistening jewel quality of her suit, the vulnerable beauty of her face and breasts, the bubble of air also with a jewel quality to it.  The stillness of her face, with the bubble testifying that this is an airbreathing person, not a mermaid.  I would have cropped it to include the rest of her bosom if possible, but otherwise thought it was a beautiful and witty portrait.  I didn;t comment during the voting because I expected you would get tons of great comments.  After reading a couple of negative comments, I thought I''d go ahead and add mine.  I gave it a 7 because I would have liked it cropped a little differently.  If you were able to capture it, I would have preferred to include her whole chest.  And no, this is not lust.  I''m a middle aged woman. :)</td>', 'I liked everything about this photo.  The way the water curving over her head looks like jello, glistening jewel quality of her suit, the vulnerable beauty of her face and breasts, the bubble of air also with a jewel quality to it.  The stillness of her face, with the bubble testifying that this is an airbreathing person, not a mermaid.  I would have cropped it to include the rest of her bosom if possible, but otherwise thought it was a beautiful and witty portrait.  I didn;t comment during the voting because I expected you would get tons of great comments.  After reading a couple of negative comments, I thought I''d go ahead and add mine.  I gave it a 7 because I would have liked it cropped a little differently.  If you were able to capture it, I would have preferred to include her whole chest.  And no, this is not lust.  I''m a middle aged woman. :)', '2002-06-07 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66065, 1923, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture:)</td>', 'Beautiful capture:)', '2002-05-27 03:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
