(66087, 1923, 811, '<td valign="top">I love sunset/sunrise pictures.<br/>I love silhouette pictures.<br/>I think I''ve just been sucker-punched.<br/>This picture is awesome.  I like the way the sun is reflected in the water, and the way the edge of the water curves.  There is a little loss of detail at the bottom, it might have been cropped there.</td>', 'I love sunset/sunrise pictures.I love silhouette pictures.I think I''ve just been sucker-punched.This picture is awesome.  I like the way the sun is reflected in the water, and the way the edge of the water curves.  There is a little loss of detail at the bottom, it might have been cropped there.', '2002-05-30 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66088, 1923, 1909, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset and setting, would have liked to see a clearer profile in silohette.</td>', 'Nice sunset and setting, would have liked to see a clearer profile in silohette.', '2002-05-31 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66089, 1923, 862, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset, but the silhouette is not very distinct.  Overall, the picture is just too dark.  Maybe use of exposure compensation would have helped.</td>', 'Nice sunset, but the silhouette is not very distinct.  Overall, the picture is just too dark.  Maybe use of exposure compensation would have helped.', '2002-05-31 08:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66090, 1923, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d like to be there right now! How did you control/limit the amount of flare from the sun?</td>', 'I''d like to be there right now! How did you control/limit the amount of flare from the sun?', '2002-06-01 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66091, 1923, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice shot... an interesting sunset shot for a change, the silhouette works great.</td>', 'Nice shot... an interesting sunset shot for a change, the silhouette works great.', '2002-06-02 21:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66092, 1923, 772, '<td valign="top">This was one of my 10s this week... sorry to see that it didn''t finish better... the person who commented about not seeing any people obviously didn''t look at the photo... actually, i see that several people complained about not being able to see the person... well, i guess some don''t appreciate the ''silhouette'' as much as we do :) good job and better luck next time :)</td>', 'This was one of my 10s this week... sorry to see that it didn''t finish better... the person who commented about not seeing any people obviously didn''t look at the photo... actually, i see that several people complained about not being able to see the person... well, i guess some don''t appreciate the ''silhouette'' as much as we do :) good job and better luck next time :)', '2002-06-03 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 0),
