(66094, 1924, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.. the motion blur does give me the sense that the subject is leaving the frame... I''m not sure that I really like his proximity to the extreme lower corner of the frame though....</td>', 'Interesting photo.. the motion blur does give me the sense that the subject is leaving the frame... I''m not sure that I really like his proximity to the extreme lower corner of the frame though....', '2002-05-27 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
