(66104, 1924, 449, '<td valign="top">this shot has the potential to be great. love the use(lack of use)  of space. Would be better if subjects head were facing into the photo instead of out.or, if the man was on the other side of the photo (bottom)  looking back. Also, looks a bit out of focus.</td>', 'this shot has the potential to be great. love the use(lack of use)  of space. Would be better if subjects head were facing into the photo instead of out.or, if the man was on the other side of the photo (bottom)  looking back. Also, looks a bit out of focus.', '2002-05-27 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66105, 1924, 1569, '<td valign="top">This ones really neat---but he''s not in focus. The position in the frame is great,you lost it on focus.</td>', 'This ones really neat---but he''s not in focus. The position in the frame is great,you lost it on focus.', '2002-05-27 13:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66106, 1924, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective. I like it. Little OOF is the only negitive. Nice work.</td>', 'Cool perspective. I like it. Little OOF is the only negitive. Nice work.', '2002-05-27 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66107, 1924, 671, '<td valign="top">The use of empty spaceis good, but the figure is not clear enough.</td>', 'The use of empty spaceis good, but the figure is not clear enough.', '2002-05-27 23:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66108, 1924, 741, '<td valign="top">Cool - so much negative space is brave but I think it really works here.  Reminds me of some very stylish poster adverts (Aquascutum, Boss etc)</td>', 'Cool - so much negative space is brave but I think it really works here.  Reminds me of some very stylish poster adverts (Aquascutum, Boss etc)', '2002-05-28 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66109, 1924, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wow, either this place isn''t very popular or you bribed everyone to stay out of the shot.  I like it a lot.  Great composition, title works well.  If only the guy had been focused - that would''ve been better IMO, but I understand you may have actually been going for the slightly out of focus effect.</td>', 'Wow, either this place isn''t very popular or you bribed everyone to stay out of the shot.  I like it a lot.  Great composition, title works well.  If only the guy had been focused - that would''ve been better IMO, but I understand you may have actually been going for the slightly out of focus effect.', '2002-05-28 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66110, 1924, 378, '<td valign="top">Could have had sharper focus, otherwise really like it.</td>', 'Could have had sharper focus, otherwise really like it.', '2002-05-28 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66111, 1924, 1680, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very original.  I wish that the guy was either more focused or showed more motion though.</td>', 'Great shot, very original.  I wish that the guy was either more focused or showed more motion though.', '2002-05-28 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66112, 1924, 1446, '<td valign="top">What a great idea.  Unfortunately your subject is out of focus.  This shot is unique enough I would have given it a 10 if in focus.  And because of that I gave it a 5, even without the crisp focus I would have liked to see.</td>', 'What a great idea.  Unfortunately your subject is out of focus.  This shot is unique enough I would have given it a 10 if in focus.  And because of that I gave it a 5, even without the crisp focus I would have liked to see.', '2002-05-28 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66113, 1924, 280, '<td valign="top">Good shot! I like this one alot. maybe the blur gives a feeling of movement but I just wish the guy was in sharper focus.</td>', 'Good shot! I like this one alot. maybe the blur gives a feeling of movement but I just wish the guy was in sharper focus.', '2002-05-28 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66114, 1924, 332, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot! This is one of the best pictures in this challenge. Black and White would have looked beautiful. Check it! <br/><br/>//arnit.hamstur.is/dpchallenge/leaving.jpg</td>', 'Nice Shot! This is one of the best pictures in this challenge. Black and White would have looked beautiful. Check it! //arnit.hamstur.is/dpchallenge/leaving.jpg', '2002-05-28 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66115, 1924, 757, '<td valign="top">bit out of focus. good placement of your subject. could use sharpening though. could stand to have about 1/2 of the sidewalk cropped out and still have the same effect.</td>', 'bit out of focus. good placement of your subject. could use sharpening though. could stand to have about 1/2 of the sidewalk cropped out and still have the same effect.', '2002-05-28 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66116, 1924, 1005, '<td valign="top">He moved!  I think motion in this case wouldn''t be needed, it makes this shot appear out of focus, instead.  At first glance, I thought you had missed the subject intirely, was he walking that fast?  As the floor doesn''t offer alot of "interest", I would have preferred him a little more centered.<br/>Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 7 total 7</td>', 'He moved!  I think motion in this case wouldn''t be needed, it makes this shot appear out of focus, instead.  At first glance, I thought you had missed the subject intirely, was he walking that fast?  As the floor doesn''t offer alot of "interest", I would have preferred him a little more centered.Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 7 total 7', '2002-05-29 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66117, 1924, 436, '<td valign="top">great composition and storytelling</td>', 'great composition and storytelling', '2002-05-29 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66118, 1924, 1903, '<td valign="top">Simplicity, nice color gradiation, yet life.   I like it!</td>', 'Simplicity, nice color gradiation, yet life.   I like it!', '2002-05-29 15:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66119, 1924, 1679, '<td valign="top">Empty.... but for some reason I seems it works. Well done. Maybe giving it a blue cast to provide some ''cool'' mood? Man''s head is also a little blurred.</td>', 'Empty.... but for some reason I seems it works. Well done. Maybe giving it a blue cast to provide some ''cool'' mood? Man''s head is also a little blurred.', '2002-05-29 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66120, 1924, 1009, '<td valign="top">Nice photo...</td>', 'Nice photo...', '2002-05-29 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66121, 1924, 1907, '<td valign="top">very minimal. i like.</td>', 'very minimal. i like.', '2002-05-30 02:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66122, 1924, 301, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I don''t mind the oof bloke, but I think it could be better without the lights from the doors/windows? at the top, thus leaving the man the only point of interest in the photo.</td>', 'Great idea.  I don''t mind the oof bloke, but I think it could be better without the lights from the doors/windows? at the top, thus leaving the man the only point of interest in the photo.', '2002-05-30 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66123, 1924, 312, '<td valign="top">i love this shot. the patterns of light and color on the floor are fantastic, and the framing i brilliant.i like the motion blur on the guy, but i''d really like to compare it with a shot that had him more in focus. i''m not sure which would look better, though. great job.</td>', 'i love this shot. the patterns of light and color on the floor are fantastic, and the framing i brilliant.i like the motion blur on the guy, but i''d really like to compare it with a shot that had him more in focus. i''m not sure which would look better, though. great job.', '2002-05-30 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66124, 1924, 1066, '<td valign="top">What can I say.  You take a big risk with a photo like this on a site like this.<br/><br/>Congratulations.  Near perfection.  I think if you could have gotten a stronger shadow effect from the subject you would have been one of my favorites.  As it is you and "Wave Watching" are fighting it out for my last top 10 spot.<br/><br/>Top 11 for sure.</td>', 'What can I say.  You take a big risk with a photo like this on a site like this.Congratulations.  Near perfection.  I think if you could have gotten a stronger shadow effect from the subject you would have been one of my favorites.  As it is you and "Wave Watching" are fighting it out for my last top 10 spot.Top 11 for sure.', '2002-05-30 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66125, 1924, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that the guy''s suit is so monochromatic, and that he''s looking off outside the frame.  a little bit of motion blur on his leg, arm, and head emphasize the movement.  hard to tell if the floor is grainy, or just mottled in color (or both).</td>', 'I like the fact that the guy''s suit is so monochromatic, and that he''s looking off outside the frame.  a little bit of motion blur on his leg, arm, and head emphasize the movement.  hard to tell if the floor is grainy, or just mottled in color (or both).', '2002-05-30 18:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66126, 1924, 689, '<td valign="top">Id like this if it was sharper or more blurred to show the movement. Seems too much in the middle ... almost like a mistake. I know you were not going for that, but that is the impression I get<br/></td>', 'Id like this if it was sharper or more blurred to show the movement. Seems too much in the middle ... almost like a mistake. I know you were not going for that, but that is the impression I get', '2002-05-31 00:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66127, 1924, 1175, '<td valign="top">I kinda like this image.  I like the dead space.  I think you had a good idea here.  The leaving person should have been in focus though.  Also, for this challenge I would prefer to see more people in the picture.</td>', 'I kinda like this image.  I like the dead space.  I think you had a good idea here.  The leaving person should have been in focus though.  Also, for this challenge I would prefer to see more people in the picture.', '2002-05-31 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66128, 1924, 1073, '<td valign="top">very interasting composition</td>', 'very interasting composition', '2002-05-31 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66129, 1924, 543, '<td valign="top">A strong image, but I think it would be stronger if the floor tiles were lined up in the frame.  The composition, while non-traditional, is good, but I think you could get the same effect with 1/3 less negative space.  A faster shutter to freeze the man would be my personal preference.</td>', 'A strong image, but I think it would be stronger if the floor tiles were lined up in the frame.  The composition, while non-traditional, is good, but I think you could get the same effect with 1/3 less negative space.  A faster shutter to freeze the man would be my personal preference.', '2002-05-31 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66130, 1924, 142, '<td valign="top">I like this.  You used the extra space well.</td>', 'I like this.  You used the extra space well.', '2002-06-01 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66131, 1924, 205, '<td valign="top">What is this the rule of corners? It works well here</td>', 'What is this the rule of corners? It works well here', '2002-06-01 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66132, 1924, 1750, '<td valign="top">Love it! Very unique composition.</td>', 'Love it! Very unique composition.', '2002-06-02 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66133, 1924, 472, '<td valign="top">i really like the use of negative space in this photo.  the only thing that keeps it from being worldclass is the sharpness or lack thereof</td>', 'i really like the use of negative space in this photo.  the only thing that keeps it from being worldclass is the sharpness or lack thereof', '2002-06-02 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66134, 1924, 509, '<td valign="top">I think this might be better if the man was more in focus.  It''s a nice shot, but as a result of the subject position, there isn''t that much to look at</td>', 'I think this might be better if the man was more in focus.  It''s a nice shot, but as a result of the subject position, there isn''t that much to look at', '2002-06-02 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66135, 1924, 1848, '<td valign="top">The sharp tile and blurred man indicatge this was taken at a slow shutter speed. That is the down fall, this would be a much more compelling image if the man were sharp. also, the light on the floor creates a visual pull away from the man.</td>', 'The sharp tile and blurred man indicatge this was taken at a slow shutter speed. That is the down fall, this would be a much more compelling image if the man were sharp. also, the light on the floor creates a visual pull away from the man.', '2002-06-03 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66136, 1924, 656, '<td valign="top">to the various people that have commented about movement, lack of sharpness etc.  You are correct, however there isn''t actually anything that could have been done to improve it, without bringing in extra lighting, switching on the sun etc.  As you can see from the settings, I''d already bumped the ISO level and had the f-stop as wide open as I could get but still could only get a 1/20s exposure.</td>', 'to the various people that have commented about movement, lack of sharpness etc.  You are correct, however there isn''t actually anything that could have been done to improve it, without bringing in extra lighting, switching on the sun etc.  As you can see from the settings, I''d already bumped the ISO level and had the f-stop as wide open as I could get but still could only get a 1/20s exposure.', '2002-06-03 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66137, 1924, 772, '<td valign="top">Gordon, I think the ''blur'' is an integral part of this photo.. It''s ashamed that it was not viewed as intended motion in this photo...</td>', 'Gordon, I think the ''blur'' is an integral part of this photo.. It''s ashamed that it was not viewed as intended motion in this photo...', '2002-06-03 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66138, 1924, 2, '<td valign="top">The vote span on this shot is really interesting -- usually, photos that place near the middle of the pack have a very normal curve, with little standard deviation around 5.  Between 5 and 7, your distribution is almost uniform (if you''ll bear with me :)  The shot is amazing, though, and I still think it shouldn''t have placed so low.</td>', 'The vote span on this shot is really interesting -- usually, photos that place near the middle of the pack have a very normal curve, with little standard deviation around 5.  Between 5 and 7, your distribution is almost uniform (if you''ll bear with me :)  The shot is amazing, though, and I still think it shouldn''t have placed so low.', '2002-06-28 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66139, 1925, 668, '<td valign="top">expression<br/>i like</td>', 'expressioni like', '2002-05-27 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66140, 1925, 1024, '<td valign="top">Your colors  are very bright and your focus is perfect.  I love this picture.</td>', 'Your colors  are very bright and your focus is perfect.  I love this picture.', '2002-05-27 07:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66141, 1925, 1808, '<td valign="top">I love YOU baby.</td>', 'I love YOU baby.', '2002-05-27 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
