(66144, 1925, 327, '<td valign="top">Two people-having fun. Great shot, nice color. Little dark but nice work.</td>', 'Two people-having fun. Great shot, nice color. Little dark but nice work.', '2002-05-27 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66145, 1925, 772, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot! :))</td>', 'Interesting shot! :))', '2002-05-28 06:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66146, 1925, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and color here.  Pretty busy in the background.</td>', 'Nice focus and color here.  Pretty busy in the background.', '2002-05-28 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66147, 1925, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great photo, good focus, color, composition.  I got nothing to suggest to improve.  Good candid work!  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 9 total 9</td>', 'Great photo, good focus, color, composition.  I got nothing to suggest to improve.  Good candid work!  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 9 total 9', '2002-05-29 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66148, 1925, 1175, '<td valign="top">You did a good job at getting your subject in focus.  Next time try to get a little closer, and maybe turn your camera sideways so they can fill the frame.  Also try to think of the viewer and how he would feel about looking at this picture.  Why would I enjoy looking at these two guys?  Think about some of these tips next time and you''ll have a winner. :)</td>', 'You did a good job at getting your subject in focus.  Next time try to get a little closer, and maybe turn your camera sideways so they can fill the frame.  Also try to think of the viewer and how he would feel about looking at this picture.  Why would I enjoy looking at these two guys?  Think about some of these tips next time and you''ll have a winner. :)', '2002-05-31 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66149, 1925, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems very snap shotty, like not much thought went into this.</td>', 'Seems very snap shotty, like not much thought went into this.', '2002-06-02 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66150, 1926, 1581, '<td valign="top">makes you wonder what happened to this guy - excellent</td>', 'makes you wonder what happened to this guy - excellent', '2002-05-27 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66151, 1926, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would have been really nice if it were framed up a little better... there is too much ''white'' space in the top half of the frame.</td>', 'I think this photo would have been really nice if it were framed up a little better... there is too much ''white'' space in the top half of the frame.', '2002-05-27 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66152, 1926, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very very very very cool... not just the perfectly white background and the crisp black and white and the framing, but also the expressiveness of this guy''s face and stance. And his cool hair :)</td>', 'Very very very very cool... not just the perfectly white background and the crisp black and white and the framing, but also the expressiveness of this guy''s face and stance. And his cool hair :)', '2002-05-27 04:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66153, 1926, 806, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the white space. Crop in closer to the portrait subject to direct your eye immediately to the expression. Otherwise a nice mood shot.</td>', 'I don''t understand the white space. Crop in closer to the portrait subject to direct your eye immediately to the expression. Otherwise a nice mood shot.', '2002-05-27 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
