(66193, 1927, 472, '<td valign="top">it''s a bit blurry but still amazong that you were somehow able to sneak a camera into a garbage show. I''m thinking you''re on max zoom here.  boy, shirley is looking very annie lennox these days, aint she?</td>', 'it''s a bit blurry but still amazong that you were somehow able to sneak a camera into a garbage show. I''m thinking you''re on max zoom here.  boy, shirley is looking very annie lennox these days, aint she?', '2002-05-27 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
