(66207, 1927, 1005, '<td valign="top">Maybe my eyes are getting old/tired, but somehow this doesn''t quite look clear.  Is the focus on her left forearm?  I have issues with the background, but I know, it couldn''t be helped, it''s just a bit distracting.  Her face could use a little more light, too.<br/>Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 8 total 7</td>', 'Maybe my eyes are getting old/tired, but somehow this doesn''t quite look clear.  Is the focus on her left forearm?  I have issues with the background, but I know, it couldn''t be helped, it''s just a bit distracting.  Her face could use a little more light, too.Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 8 total 7', '2002-05-29 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66208, 1927, 1009, '<td valign="top">Damn shes fine...  :-)</td>', 'Damn shes fine...  :-)', '2002-05-29 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66209, 1927, 1585, '<td valign="top">I realy wish that this was in focus. There are some great contrasts that would stand out if it was more in focus.</td>', 'I realy wish that this was in focus. There are some great contrasts that would stand out if it was more in focus.', '2002-05-29 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66210, 1927, 689, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and a little blurry.</td>', 'Out of focus and a little blurry.', '2002-05-31 00:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66211, 1927, 1037, '<td valign="top">You caught her with a great expression on her gorgeous face :). When I saw Garbage in January, at a bit music festival here in Australia, she couldn''t take the sun in her eyes and kept complaining, then cut the set short :(. Lucky you to get close enough to take this shot. I think turning up the contrast a bit would have helped.</td>', 'You caught her with a great expression on her gorgeous face :). When I saw Garbage in January, at a bit music festival here in Australia, she couldn''t take the sun in her eyes and kept complaining, then cut the set short :(. Lucky you to get close enough to take this shot. I think turning up the contrast a bit would have helped.', '2002-05-31 03:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66212, 1927, 1031, '<td valign="top">Is that a brace for treatment of "microphone elbow?"</td>', 'Is that a brace for treatment of "microphone elbow?"', '2002-06-01 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66213, 1927, 544, '<td valign="top">Just one other comment - I was really close to her (I could have grabbed the microphone without stretching) during much of the show, but before I took this one I slipped back a few people. I was getting jostled about very much, and the lighting was very low, so the photo lacked an absolute focus. I tried, though! :)<br/><br/>Oh - Annie Lennox is a good call, by the way :)</td>', 'Just one other comment - I was really close to her (I could have grabbed the microphone without stretching) during much of the show, but before I took this one I slipped back a few people. I was getting jostled about very much, and the lighting was very low, so the photo lacked an absolute focus. I tried, though! :)Oh - Annie Lennox is a good call, by the way :)', '2002-06-03 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66214, 1928, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great idea here.  Exposure could have probably been a bit longer to get rid of some of the grain.</td>', 'Great idea here.  Exposure could have probably been a bit longer to get rid of some of the grain.', '2002-05-27 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66215, 1928, 1808, '<td valign="top">This is technically tough to figure out, but what does it mean?</td>', 'This is technically tough to figure out, but what does it mean?', '2002-05-27 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66216, 1928, 47, '<td valign="top">uh.</td>', 'uh.', '2002-05-27 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66217, 1928, 1379, '<td valign="top">What luminous eyes!</td>', 'What luminous eyes!', '2002-05-27 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66218, 1928, 327, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors, I can''t see people but I like the colors.</td>', 'Very cool colors, I can''t see people but I like the colors.', '2002-05-27 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66219, 1928, 686, '<td valign="top">Where are the people in your shot???</td>', 'Where are the people in your shot???', '2002-05-27 19:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66220, 1928, 1877, '<td valign="top">Light is always fun to play with!</td>', 'Light is always fun to play with!', '2002-05-27 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66221, 1928, 1061, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect</td>', 'Interesting effect', '2002-05-27 21:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66222, 1928, 1820, '<td valign="top">It looks me  a little while to see that she is holding a toy.  Very neat and creative!!! =)</td>', 'It looks me  a little while to see that she is holding a toy.  Very neat and creative!!! =)', '2002-05-27 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66223, 1928, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph!  I love the colors and the motion... great job!</td>', 'Excellent photograph!  I love the colors and the motion... great job!', '2002-05-28 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66224, 1928, 1446, '<td valign="top">Raising my vote on this one.  I really like the colors here.  Very interesting photo.</td>', 'Raising my vote on this one.  I really like the colors here.  Very interesting photo.', '2002-05-28 13:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66225, 1928, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cutely wierd, how did you do it?  Person is a bit tooooo dark, though I don''t think you could have done any better.  Crops too much at bottom and top.  Got me thinking......<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 10 People 8 total 8<br/></td>', 'Cutely wierd, how did you do it?  Person is a bit tooooo dark, though I don''t think you could have done any better.  Crops too much at bottom and top.  Got me thinking......Photo 8 Creativity 10 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-28 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66226, 1928, 332, '<td valign="top">Good job. Not many good picture in this competition. But your''s a good one!</td>', 'Good job. Not many good picture in this competition. But your''s a good one!', '2002-05-28 20:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66227, 1928, 509, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but the composition looks off to me.  The person''s head looks almost centerred, but the circles (neon lights?) are too far off.  I don''t think you needed to show the lights on the right, they kinda detract from this.</td>', 'Good subject, but the composition looks off to me.  The person''s head looks almost centerred, but the circles (neon lights?) are too far off.  I don''t think you needed to show the lights on the right, they kinda detract from this.', '2002-05-28 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66228, 1928, 1024, '<td valign="top">Bright colors, and good composition.  According to the rule of thirds, the boys eyes are in precicely the proper place.</td>', 'Bright colors, and good composition.  According to the rule of thirds, the boys eyes are in precicely the proper place.', '2002-05-29 12:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66229, 1928, 885, '<td valign="top">neat neon colors and good idea.  I can''t necessarily tell what she is holding up, but I like it regardless.  I do wish I could see her mouth, but that obviously (I think) wasn''t possible.</td>', 'neat neon colors and good idea.  I can''t necessarily tell what she is holding up, but I like it regardless.  I do wish I could see her mouth, but that obviously (I think) wasn''t possible.', '2002-05-29 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66230, 1928, 301, '<td valign="top">constraints of photo size don''t do this any justice at all.  I love how the lights haven''t quite completed a full circle, leaving the viewer to fill in the rest.  I think it''s a shame that we can''t see the detail of the person quite well enough.  Not sure the hand in front of the face adds anything ... perhaps that''s how you achieved the lights, but I would have liked to have seen the eyes a little better.  Probably hard to do given the low light.</td>', 'constraints of photo size don''t do this any justice at all.  I love how the lights haven''t quite completed a full circle, leaving the viewer to fill in the rest.  I think it''s a shame that we can''t see the detail of the person quite well enough.  Not sure the hand in front of the face adds anything ... perhaps that''s how you achieved the lights, but I would have liked to have seen the eyes a little better.  Probably hard to do given the low light.', '2002-05-29 07:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66231, 1928, 1585, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I love all the colors.</td>', 'Interesting. I love all the colors.', '2002-05-29 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66232, 1928, 1009, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2002-05-29 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66233, 1928, 1907, '<td valign="top">confusing...odd... how did you make those?</td>', 'confusing...odd... how did you make those?', '2002-05-30 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(66234, 1928, 1066, '<td valign="top">What sold mer here?  Color, color , color.<br/><br/>I am an absolute SUCKER for neon lights and this was a good and creative use of them.  One of my 10 best.<br/><br/>I would have given you a 10 if the subject had been a bit clearer behind the glass but I know it was dark and that may have hurt your light effect.  But I have seen it done before so I know it''s possible.  More neon light glow to her face or a fill light of some sort  Still a great photo.</td>', 'What sold mer here?  Color, color , color.I am an absolute SUCKER for neon lights and this was a good and creative use of them.  One of my 10 best.I would have given you a 10 if the subject had been a bit clearer behind the glass but I know it was dark and that may have hurt your light effect.  But I have seen it done before so I know it''s possible.  More neon light glow to her face or a fill light of some sort  Still a great photo.', '2002-05-30 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66235, 1928, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great effect! Sometimes, though, in my opinion this rule against centering your subject just has to be broken to strengthen the photo. I think the case of concentric circles like this is one of them. Although, the colourful background over her left shoulder is nice. I love her hair too.</td>', 'Great effect! Sometimes, though, in my opinion this rule against centering your subject just has to be broken to strengthen the photo. I think the case of concentric circles like this is one of them. Although, the colourful background over her left shoulder is nice. I love her hair too.', '2002-05-31 03:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66236, 1928, 811, '<td valign="top">Okay, that''s cool.  Il ike the lights, and the implied motion.  Usually, I''m not a stickler about whether a picture is in the middle or not, but I think this one would be more effective if it were.  I think it needs at least a little "margin" on the left.</td>', 'Okay, that''s cool.  Il ike the lights, and the implied motion.  Usually, I''m not a stickler about whether a picture is in the middle or not, but I think this one would be more effective if it were.  I think it needs at least a little "margin" on the left.', '2002-06-01 22:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66237, 1928, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool lookin shot, though a tighter crop is defeinitely needed.  I think the lights no the right are very distracting.</td>', 'Cool lookin shot, though a tighter crop is defeinitely needed.  I think the lights no the right are very distracting.', '2002-06-02 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66238, 1928, 1750, '<td valign="top">cooll multiple exposures. This type isn''t easy to pull off.</td>', 'cooll multiple exposures. This type isn''t easy to pull off.', '2002-06-02 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66239, 1928, 806, '<td valign="top">Does anyone have an idea how I could have focused on the child''s eyes in the dark before the toy was turned on? Just wondering if there was any further technical advice - just for kicks, and for any other future shot that I may call on this in my memory banks for....<br/>Thanks!<br/>:-)</td>', 'Does anyone have an idea how I could have focused on the child''s eyes in the dark before the toy was turned on? Just wondering if there was any further technical advice - just for kicks, and for any other future shot that I may call on this in my memory banks for....Thanks!:-)', '2002-06-03 12:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66240, 1928, 772, '<td valign="top">Karen, this photo should have scored much higher... good job!  to get the focus you needed, you had a few options but in that environment, it may have been difficult.  I don''t know what features your camera has, but you may have been able t shine a light on her face to set up the focus... then shut down the light and let her turn the toy on then make your photo...  I, personally, dont see much of a focus problem on her eyes anyway... They look fine to me :)  I would have possibly taken a half step backward as well.. given myself a little more room and produced a crop on the photo that gave you the centering that would have quelled those comments... i like this shot and i gave it a 9 on my vote... good job!</td>', 'Karen, this photo should have scored much higher... good job!  to get the focus you needed, you had a few options but in that environment, it may have been difficult.  I don''t know what features your camera has, but you may have been able t shine a light on her face to set up the focus... then shut down the light and let her turn the toy on then make your photo...  I, personally, dont see much of a focus problem on her eyes anyway... They look fine to me :)  I would have possibly taken a half step backward as well.. given myself a little more room and produced a crop on the photo that gave you the centering that would have quelled those comments... i like this shot and i gave it a 9 on my vote... good job!', '2002-06-03 17:32:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66241, 1930, 138, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of a photo that would come with a frame. this is cool</td>', 'this reminds me of a photo that would come with a frame. this is cool', '2002-05-27 01:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66242, 1930, 1211, '<td valign="top">Let me be the first to comment on how absolutely beautiful this composition is.  I absolutely love it.  The lighting is superb.  I''ll have to write more about this when I can...right now, I''m just amazed at how wonderful this shot is.  (Later)  Ok, I know why I really like it (aside from the lovely subject), you managed to capture this persons humanity.  As someone told me, anyone can capture beauty with people, but you somehow have to also capture their humanity.  Bravo!</td>', 'Let me be the first to comment on how absolutely beautiful this composition is.  I absolutely love it.  The lighting is superb.  I''ll have to write more about this when I can...right now, I''m just amazed at how wonderful this shot is.  (Later)  Ok, I know why I really like it (aside from the lovely subject), you managed to capture this persons humanity.  As someone told me, anyone can capture beauty with people, but you somehow have to also capture their humanity.  Bravo!', '2002-05-27 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66243, 1930, 1581, '<td valign="top">could use a tad more contrast but well done</td>', 'could use a tad more contrast but well done', '2002-05-27 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66244, 1930, 1831, '<td valign="top">Clever Title, stunning model, great photo.</td>', 'Clever Title, stunning model, great photo.', '2002-05-27 01:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66245, 1930, 1750, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes. Like the lighting, separation from background and wistful/ urchin feel to the subject.<br/>The shadowing is good to a point. The 2 tone face is a bit uncomfortable.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes. Like the lighting, separation from background and wistful/ urchin feel to the subject.The shadowing is good to a point. The 2 tone face is a bit uncomfortable.', '2002-05-27 02:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66246, 1930, 92, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo ! The color is great for such a soft effect. The title is well thought out as well.</td>', 'Very nice photo ! The color is great for such a soft effect. The title is well thought out as well.', '2002-05-27 03:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66247, 1930, 1867, '<td valign="top">great person, great pose, great lighting, great colorand tones... great photo!</td>', 'great person, great pose, great lighting, great colorand tones... great photo!', '2002-05-27 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66248, 1930, 1519, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty photograph. Nice expression and pose.</td>', 'This is a very pretty photograph. Nice expression and pose.', '2002-05-27 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66249, 1930, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice hair and eyes.</td>', 'Nice hair and eyes.', '2002-05-27 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66250, 1930, 117, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2002-05-27 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66251, 1930, 449, '<td valign="top">great title! very nice composition.</td>', 'great title! very nice composition.', '2002-05-27 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66252, 1930, 327, '<td valign="top">Good composition, pose, light and love the b&amp;w. She''s a lovely _people_ and you did a good job.</td>', 'Good composition, pose, light and love the b&w. She''s a lovely _people_ and you did a good job.', '2002-05-27 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66253, 1930, 472, '<td valign="top">pretty gurl.  like the cropping. some may say something about the overexposure but i like it.</td>', 'pretty gurl.  like the cropping. some may say something about the overexposure but i like it.', '2002-05-27 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66254, 1930, 1877, '<td valign="top">good photo</td>', 'good photo', '2002-05-27 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66255, 1930, 1061, '<td valign="top">Well, it ALWAYS helps to have a gorgeous subject</td>', 'Well, it ALWAYS helps to have a gorgeous subject', '2002-05-27 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66256, 1930, 773, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo!  I wish the white was not so stark on the right side, but otherwise excellent.</td>', 'Fantastic photo!  I wish the white was not so stark on the right side, but otherwise excellent.', '2002-05-27 21:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66257, 1930, 543, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.  The high-key falls apart a little inthe ULHC - maybe a reflector would have helped with the shadows behind that strand of hair and on her neck.  Biggest little nit is that you''ve lost half a finger to overexposure.  High marks from me.</td>', 'Beautifully done.  The high-key falls apart a little inthe ULHC - maybe a reflector would have helped with the shadows behind that strand of hair and on her neck.  Biggest little nit is that you''ve lost half a finger to overexposure.  High marks from me.', '2002-05-28 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66258, 1930, 1446, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  The lighting a little bright on her hands IMO, but still one of my top 10 picks for the week.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  The lighting a little bright on her hands IMO, but still one of my top 10 picks for the week.', '2002-05-28 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66259, 1930, 1, '<td valign="top">Great exposure and composure.  The b/w tones work very well.</td>', 'Great exposure and composure.  The b/w tones work very well.', '2002-05-28 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66260, 1930, 656, '<td valign="top">too much hair in front of her face I think. Good light in her eyes though.</td>', 'too much hair in front of her face I think. Good light in her eyes though.', '2002-05-28 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66261, 1930, 907, '<td valign="top">she''d be beautiful in any month ;) The only thing I would change would be to thin out the tendril (sp?) of hair in front of her eye, otherwise great photo.</td>', 'she''d be beautiful in any month ;) The only thing I would change would be to thin out the tendril (sp?) of hair in front of her eye, otherwise great photo.', '2002-05-28 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66262, 1930, 2, '<td valign="top">Amazing job creating the softness on the right side of the image and still having beautiful tones on the left.</td>', 'Amazing job creating the softness on the right side of the image and still having beautiful tones on the left.', '2002-05-28 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66263, 1930, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Good balance, well composed.</td>', 'Very nice. Good balance, well composed.', '2002-05-28 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66264, 1930, 141, '<td valign="top">very nice look.  Beautiful eyes.</td>', 'very nice look.  Beautiful eyes.', '2002-05-28 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66265, 1930, 806, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Elicits a lot of nice emotions. Sweet. It would make a customer very happy to pass down to generations.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Elicits a lot of nice emotions. Sweet. It would make a customer very happy to pass down to generations.', '2002-05-28 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66266, 1930, 737, '<td valign="top">Such a sweet smile on a very pretty face. Nice pose. In my top 10.</td>', 'Such a sweet smile on a very pretty face. Nice pose. In my top 10.', '2002-05-28 18:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66267, 1930, 1379, '<td valign="top">Lovely....  <br/>Nice drama in her eyes.</td>', 'Lovely....  Nice drama in her eyes.', '2002-05-28 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66268, 1930, 1899, '<td valign="top">Great use of shadow, interesting composition</td>', 'Great use of shadow, interesting composition', '2002-05-28 20:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66269, 1930, 280, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait, 10.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait, 10.', '2002-05-29 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66270, 1930, 1681, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  My only problem is the level of light.  Not sure if you were attempting high-key or not.  My opinion is that it is not bright enough for high-key effect, but otherwise too bright.  especially the forward arm-wrist-hand.  Still gets a 9, but I think I would have given a 10 if either purposely "high-key"ed or darkened up some.</td>', 'Very good photo.  My only problem is the level of light.  Not sure if you were attempting high-key or not.  My opinion is that it is not bright enough for high-key effect, but otherwise too bright.  especially the forward arm-wrist-hand.  Still gets a 9, but I think I would have given a 10 if either purposely "high-key"ed or darkened up some.', '2002-05-29 07:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66271, 1930, 587, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. Seems a bit too washed out lower right, maybe less hair in front of her eye, and the ''hole'' in her ear (maybe an earring next time) but she is too pretty not to make it a great photo. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice photo. Seems a bit too washed out lower right, maybe less hair in front of her eye, and the ''hole'' in her ear (maybe an earring next time) but she is too pretty not to make it a great photo. Good job.', '2002-05-29 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66272, 1930, 1005, '<td valign="top">A very nice portrait.  The background is so washed out on the right side and even effects her dress, but the rest is so nice, I don''t know what I could suggest to improve....maybe change your lighting a bit.<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8</td>', 'A very nice portrait.  The background is so washed out on the right side and even effects her dress, but the rest is so nice, I don''t know what I could suggest to improve....maybe change your lighting a bit.Photo 8 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8', '2002-05-29 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66273, 1930, 301, '<td valign="top">gorgeous gal, gorgeous photo ... nuff said</td>', 'gorgeous gal, gorgeous photo ... nuff said', '2002-05-29 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66274, 1930, 1903, '<td valign="top">grayscale and natural lines/curves create a very pleasing portrait</td>', 'grayscale and natural lines/curves create a very pleasing portrait', '2002-05-29 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66275, 1930, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an exquisite portrait photograph... I believe that the minor glisten in her eyes really sets this one off.. I love it and I''m giving it a 10 for a job well done.  10 means VERY GOOD right?  This is better than VERY GOOD but I want to make a critique anyway... I like the lighting tones across her faceis very nice and I like the deviation of light tones from one side of the hair streak to the other... However, I believe the light on the right side of the frame is a little ''hot'' and her fingers and dress are washing out quite a bit.  I also really appreciate the mild sepia tone that has been applied to this image.  It makes it MUCH warmer feeling than a standard black and white... GREAT JOB!</td>', 'This is an exquisite portrait photograph... I believe that the minor glisten in her eyes really sets this one off.. I love it and I''m giving it a 10 for a job well done.  10 means VERY GOOD right?  This is better than VERY GOOD but I want to make a critique anyway... I like the lighting tones across her faceis very nice and I like the deviation of light tones from one side of the hair streak to the other... However, I believe the light on the right side of the frame is a little ''hot'' and her fingers and dress are washing out quite a bit.  I also really appreciate the mild sepia tone that has been applied to this image.  It makes it MUCH warmer feeling than a standard black and white... GREAT JOB!', '2002-05-29 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66276, 1930, 1679, '<td valign="top">Very moody! I like it!<br/>Beautiful catch lights in the eyes. Works wonders in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very moody! I like it!Beautiful catch lights in the eyes. Works wonders in B&W.', '2002-05-29 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66277, 1930, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very nice...</td>', 'Very nice...', '2002-05-29 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66278, 1930, 142, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait.  I  like how the face is so sharp and everything beyond her face fades into the light.</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait.  I  like how the face is so sharp and everything beyond her face fades into the light.', '2002-05-29 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66279, 1930, 1847, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  Love the overexposed whites in the background.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.  Love the overexposed whites in the background.', '2002-05-29 19:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66280, 1930, 1175, '<td valign="top">very pretty model.  love the hair, the lighting, the soft focus, the b&amp;w.  10.</td>', 'very pretty model.  love the hair, the lighting, the soft focus, the b&w.  10.', '2002-05-30 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66281, 1930, 312, '<td valign="top">this is a great portrait. some might say that the right side is overexposed or blown out, but i think it works nicely in this shot. good job.</td>', 'this is a great portrait. some might say that the right side is overexposed or blown out, but i think it works nicely in this shot. good job.', '2002-05-30 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66282, 1930, 1066, '<td valign="top">Well...I think we all know this is goood self portrait photography.  Interested to know how you got such nice lighting.  I tend to get harsher shadows but I don''t have any studio lights yet and depend on a lot of natural, one directional window light.<br/><br/>One of my 10 best.</td>', 'Well...I think we all know this is goood self portrait photography.  Interested to know how you got such nice lighting.  I tend to get harsher shadows but I don''t have any studio lights yet and depend on a lot of natural, one directional window light.One of my 10 best.', '2002-05-30 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66283, 1930, 573, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting, but would have liked to see more detail in the highlights.</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting, but would have liked to see more detail in the highlights.', '2002-05-30 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66284, 1930, 1641, '<td valign="top">The Best One So Far!!</td>', 'The Best One So Far!!', '2002-05-30 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66285, 1930, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the expression.  her hand and her dress though, seem to blend in with the white background (at least on this monitor).  while I like how the curve of the piece of hair mirrors the curve of her cheekbone and jawline, it bothers me that it''s in front of her eye.  Of coourse, it gives it a more casual feeling, but I think pushing it to the other side of her eye would have made a difference.</td>', 'I like the pose and the expression.  her hand and her dress though, seem to blend in with the white background (at least on this monitor).  while I like how the curve of the piece of hair mirrors the curve of her cheekbone and jawline, it bothers me that it''s in front of her eye.  Of coourse, it gives it a more casual feeling, but I think pushing it to the other side of her eye would have made a difference.', '2002-05-30 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66286, 1930, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  A little bright/washed out on the right side -- some detail is lost.  Otherwise, I think it is an excellent shot.</td>', 'Nice picture.  A little bright/washed out on the right side -- some detail is lost.  Otherwise, I think it is an excellent shot.', '2002-05-30 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66287, 1930, 1810, '<td valign="top">nice lightning</td>', 'nice lightning', '2002-05-31 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66288, 1930, 527, '<td valign="top">The hair strands and the composition are perfect. I know people have already mentioned the blown out areas and maybe you went a little too far with it. But I really love it regardless, one of the best portrait shots I have seen in a long time.</td>', 'The hair strands and the composition are perfect. I know people have already mentioned the blown out areas and maybe you went a little too far with it. But I really love it regardless, one of the best portrait shots I have seen in a long time.', '2002-05-31 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66289, 1930, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very, very beautiful. The lighting and soft, (slightly tinted?) black and white are very delicate. I love it.</td>', 'Very, very beautiful. The lighting and soft, (slightly tinted?) black and white are very delicate. I love it.', '2002-05-31 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66290, 1930, 1078, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I''m guessing some people won''t like the overexposure on the right, but it works for me.  I''ve looked for suggestions to offer, and simply can''t find any.  So there ya are.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I''m guessing some people won''t like the overexposure on the right, but it works for me.  I''ve looked for suggestions to offer, and simply can''t find any.  So there ya are.', '2002-05-31 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66291, 1930, 1031, '<td valign="top">On my monitor it loses the highlights on the far right; otherwise I like it a lot.</td>', 'On my monitor it loses the highlights on the far right; otherwise I like it a lot.', '2002-05-31 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66292, 1930, 205, '<td valign="top">This looks very professional only thing wrong with it is that the fabric on her knee fades away into the light as well as the detail on the edges of her hands<br/></td>', 'This looks very professional only thing wrong with it is that the fabric on her knee fades away into the light as well as the detail on the edges of her hands', '2002-06-01 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66293, 1930, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait</td>', 'Nice portrait', '2002-06-02 02:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66294, 1930, 1336, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2002-06-02 22:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66295, 1930, 1848, '<td valign="top">This would have been much better if you had been able to keep some detail in the highlights. It would still have been possible to have the light airy mood. I like the tight cropping around the face. The lighter area with hair strands behind the head is distracting, the crop could have eleminated that without unbalancing the image.</td>', 'This would have been much better if you had been able to keep some detail in the highlights. It would still have been possible to have the light airy mood. I like the tight cropping around the face. The lighter area with hair strands behind the head is distracting, the crop could have eleminated that without unbalancing the image.', '2002-06-03 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66296, 1930, 772, '<td valign="top">Constance, great photo and congrats on third!  This was one of my 10s this week :)</td>', 'Constance, great photo and congrats on third!  This was one of my 10s this week :)', '2002-06-03 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66297, 1930, 2, '<td valign="top">One of every ribbon now, eh?  Great job :)</td>', 'One of every ribbon now, eh?  Great job :)', '2002-06-03 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66298, 1930, 1715, '<td valign="top">I think this photo was very nice, but I don''t think it  was that interesting. It seems just like a picture of someone, I mean it doesn''t seem like there''s anything special about it. Maybe if you had something happening,  have her hold something, have more shadows, a darker backround, maybe something in front of her but not blocking her way, eh? Maybe it could seem as if a person was looking at her through a window</td>', 'I think this photo was very nice, but I don''t think it  was that interesting. It seems just like a picture of someone, I mean it doesn''t seem like there''s anything special about it. Maybe if you had something happening,  have her hold something, have more shadows, a darker backround, maybe something in front of her but not blocking her way, eh? Maybe it could seem as if a person was looking at her through a window', '2002-06-05 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66299, 1930, 2798, '<td valign="top">A definite 10 in my book. Fantastic portrait.</td>', 'A definite 10 in my book. Fantastic portrait.', '2002-07-30 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66300, 1931, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  How could any "good American" give this photo anything less than a 9?</td>', 'Great idea!  How could any "good American" give this photo anything less than a 9?', '2002-05-27 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66301, 1931, 92, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo !</td>', 'Beautiful photo !', '2002-05-27 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66302, 1931, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very cool, exactly the kind of effect that memorial was designed to create, I believe (although I''m not sure, I''m not American).</td>', 'Very cool, exactly the kind of effect that memorial was designed to create, I believe (although I''m not sure, I''m not American).', '2002-05-27 03:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66303, 1931, 1808, '<td valign="top">Good memorial day shot.</td>', 'Good memorial day shot.', '2002-05-27 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
