(66306, 1931, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo, wonderful perspective and DOF. Emotional photo. Nice job.</td>', 'Wonderful photo, wonderful perspective and DOF. Emotional photo. Nice job.', '2002-05-27 17:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66307, 1931, 671, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of reflection.</td>', 'Excellent use of reflection.', '2002-05-27 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66308, 1931, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo... I love the reflections from teh wall and the flag reflections make it even better.   Your entry is one of the more unique and well planned photos in this challenge... Kudos on the nice photo ! - 9</td>', 'This is a very nice photo... I love the reflections from teh wall and the flag reflections make it even better.   Your entry is one of the more unique and well planned photos in this challenge... Kudos on the nice photo ! - 9', '2002-05-28 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66309, 1931, 281, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and use of reflection.</td>', 'Nice composition and use of reflection.', '2002-05-28 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66310, 1931, 1717, '<td valign="top">wonderful composition!!  i love this!</td>', 'wonderful composition!!  i love this!', '2002-05-28 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66311, 1931, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, too bad the marble wasn''t smoother.  No suggestions on improving this shot, it appears as good as it could be.  Photo 9 Creativity 10 (++) People 9 total 9</td>', 'Nice effect, too bad the marble wasn''t smoother.  No suggestions on improving this shot, it appears as good as it could be.  Photo 9 Creativity 10 (++) People 9 total 9', '2002-05-28 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66312, 1931, 737, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo of "people" on Memorial Day week. In my top 10.</td>', 'Excellent photo of "people" on Memorial Day week. In my top 10.', '2002-05-28 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66313, 1931, 1009, '<td valign="top">Effective use of emotion, great idea...</td>', 'Effective use of emotion, great idea...', '2002-05-28 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66314, 1931, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice reflection photo.</td>', 'This is a very nice reflection photo.', '2002-05-29 12:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66315, 1931, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat with the flag included, and the words (Vietman veterans'' memorial?).  The problem is, though, that without the reflection, flag, and words, the picture would be sort of blah.  The actual image in the reflection doesn''t seem to really stand up to the frame.  Obviously, you can''t ask Vietman veterans to move on Memorial day, but still...OK, I think my comment is what you were referring to in the forums, so I''m going to try to explain it a little better.  What I mean is that you''ve really got a great frame going here, with the words, reflection, flag, etc.  It''s really a very nice idea.  But the actual subject of the photo, the people, are kind of cluttered and  just really not that interesting, and they don''t seem to be very expressive of Vietnam or memorializing.  Without your frame, it could be just a snapshot at a family barbecue or something.  While I understand that your control is very very limited in these types of situations and I can''t comment on what other opportunities you might have had, this picture just struck me as being very nicely framed, with a not-so-interesting subject.</td>', 'Neat with the flag included, and the words (Vietman veterans'' memorial?).  The problem is, though, that without the reflection, flag, and words, the picture would be sort of blah.  The actual image in the reflection doesn''t seem to really stand up to the frame.  Obviously, you can''t ask Vietman veterans to move on Memorial day, but still...OK, I think my comment is what you were referring to in the forums, so I''m going to try to explain it a little better.  What I mean is that you''ve really got a great frame going here, with the words, reflection, flag, etc.  It''s really a very nice idea.  But the actual subject of the photo, the people, are kind of cluttered and  just really not that interesting, and they don''t seem to be very expressive of Vietnam or memorializing.  Without your frame, it could be just a snapshot at a family barbecue or something.  While I understand that your control is very very limited in these types of situations and I can''t comment on what other opportunities you might have had, this picture just struck me as being very nicely framed, with a not-so-interesting subject.', '2002-05-29 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66316, 1931, 616, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2002-05-29 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66317, 1931, 1907, '<td valign="top">great!</td>', 'great!', '2002-05-30 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66318, 1931, 1910, '<td valign="top">ok, ok you probably won congratz!</td>', 'ok, ok you probably won congratz!', '2002-05-30 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66319, 1931, 1066, '<td valign="top">Tough picture.  It has been taken a million times before and I have seen it almost that much :-)<br/><br/>So you had some big shoes to fill.  Nicely done.  Congratulations on your example and a very nice one it is :-)</td>', 'Tough picture.  It has been taken a million times before and I have seen it almost that much :-)So you had some big shoes to fill.  Nicely done.  Congratulations on your example and a very nice one it is :-)', '2002-05-30 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66320, 1931, 878, '<td valign="top">Very nice, all around good photo.  I like how the reflection of the sky takes over the wall.  It almost has a photoshop edited effect to it (even though it isnt).  Curious as to how many shots you took of this before you got this one.</td>', 'Very nice, all around good photo.  I like how the reflection of the sky takes over the wall.  It almost has a photoshop edited effect to it (even though it isnt).  Curious as to how many shots you took of this before you got this one.', '2002-05-30 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66321, 1931, 1325, '<td valign="top">Why did you fuzzy up the people?  In doing so you have denied your viewer the ability to share in their emotions which are most clearly reflected in their faces.  Yes the stance of the body may in fact give part of the message but not completely.  The magic of photography is taking your viewer into a place they have never been and sharing it with those who were there.   I have read the the rants about lack of appreciation for creativity but sometimes you defeat your viewer with it.</td>', 'Why did you fuzzy up the people?  In doing so you have denied your viewer the ability to share in their emotions which are most clearly reflected in their faces.  Yes the stance of the body may in fact give part of the message but not completely.  The magic of photography is taking your viewer into a place they have never been and sharing it with those who were there.   I have read the the rants about lack of appreciation for creativity but sometimes you defeat your viewer with it.', '2002-05-31 08:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66322, 1931, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a little washed out on the right side though.  Everyone looks so reflective, except for the woman in the jumper.  It looks like she is smiling.  I guess you could''ve said, "hey, you, stop smiling.  Look serious."  Ha.Ha.  I like the epheral feel of the reflection and the boldness of the flag on the left.</td>', 'Nice shot, a little washed out on the right side though.  Everyone looks so reflective, except for the woman in the jumper.  It looks like she is smiling.  I guess you could''ve said, "hey, you, stop smiling.  Look serious."  Ha.Ha.  I like the epheral feel of the reflection and the boldness of the flag on the left.', '2002-05-31 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66323, 1931, 543, '<td valign="top">A very evocative place.  You''ve captured it well, but everything from the small flag to the R edge of the frame could be cropped to strengthen the image.  Personally, I''d lose the girl looking the "wrong" way, too.</td>', 'A very evocative place.  You''ve captured it well, but everything from the small flag to the R edge of the frame could be cropped to strengthen the image.  Personally, I''d lose the girl looking the "wrong" way, too.', '2002-05-31 13:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66324, 1931, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think we need more reflective contemplation and few casualties to memorialize...</td>', 'I think we need more reflective contemplation and few casualties to memorialize...', '2002-05-31 21:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66325, 1931, 1750, '<td valign="top">This reflection really reaches out and touches me and that''s what photojournalism is all about.</td>', 'This reflection really reaches out and touches me and that''s what photojournalism is all about.', '2002-06-02 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66326, 1932, 1175, '<td valign="top">Damn I''d hate to be that guy.  Lighting is way to harsh, he''s really not to pretty to look at.</td>', 'Damn I''d hate to be that guy.  Lighting is way to harsh, he''s really not to pretty to look at.', '2002-05-27 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66327, 1932, 661, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t want to get in a fight with him.  Interesting juxatapositioning with the Medusa head.</td>', 'I wouldn''t want to get in a fight with him.  Interesting juxatapositioning with the Medusa head.', '2002-05-27 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66328, 1932, 1750, '<td valign="top">Needs more separation of subject from background. Whatever that is to his left, it''s distracting. You did capture that "tough/sweet" look .</td>', 'Needs more separation of subject from background. Whatever that is to his left, it''s distracting. You did capture that "tough/sweet" look .', '2002-05-27 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66329, 1932, 301, '<td valign="top">Sure he wasn''t squeezing zits beforehand? :)  Strong flash has caused the reflections off the subject''s nose.  It''s a shame that the band-aids don''t really show that well.  It took me a while to realise the meaning of your title.  I don''t really like the placement of the subject either, seeing as there really isn''t anything in the background</td>', 'Sure he wasn''t squeezing zits beforehand? :)  Strong flash has caused the reflections off the subject''s nose.  It''s a shame that the band-aids don''t really show that well.  It took me a while to realise the meaning of your title.  I don''t really like the placement of the subject either, seeing as there really isn''t anything in the background', '2002-05-27 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66330, 1932, 772, '<td valign="top">I think a little more creative framing of this photograph would have improved it somewhat...</td>', 'I think a little more creative framing of this photograph would have improved it somewhat...', '2002-05-27 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66331, 1932, 117, '<td valign="top">kind of reminds me of keith richards</td>', 'kind of reminds me of keith richards', '2002-05-27 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66332, 1932, 668, '<td valign="top">haha  almost scary - why the bandaids?</td>', 'haha  almost scary - why the bandaids?', '2002-05-27 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66333, 1932, 472, '<td valign="top">this picture is insane.  i feel like i''m looking at myself.  this man has suffered much pain, but he looks like a fast healer.  the pathos, the passion, and the love in this photo are evident. great work. i give it a 10.</td>', 'this picture is insane.  i feel like i''m looking at myself.  this man has suffered much pain, but he looks like a fast healer.  the pathos, the passion, and the love in this photo are evident. great work. i give it a 10.', '2002-05-27 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66334, 1932, 327, '<td valign="top">I''d hate to see the other guy! &amp;lt;lol&amp;gt; Fun shot. Little over exposed.</td>', 'I''d hate to see the other guy! &lt;lol&gt; Fun shot. Little over exposed.', '2002-05-27 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66335, 1932, 1061, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  What''s going on here?</td>', 'Ouch!  What''s going on here?', '2002-05-27 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66336, 1932, 570, '<td valign="top">dude......</td>', 'dude......', '2002-05-28 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66337, 1932, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s an intense face. I like the background. The lighting could do with some work, but as it is it just makes him look even more sickly.</td>', 'Wow, that''s an intense face. I like the background. The lighting could do with some work, but as it is it just makes him look even more sickly.', '2002-05-28 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66338, 1932, 1446, '<td valign="top">Skin tone looks kind of green on my monitor.....Is that the result of the fight??</td>', 'Skin tone looks kind of green on my monitor.....Is that the result of the fight??', '2002-05-28 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66339, 1932, 255, '<td valign="top">i like the framing of this picture, but i''m not fond of the flash bouncing off of his skin. not only does it look hot in places, it makes him look sallow--almost jaundiced. Maybe a fill would have worked here?</td>', 'i like the framing of this picture, but i''m not fond of the flash bouncing off of his skin. not only does it look hot in places, it makes him look sallow--almost jaundiced. Maybe a fill would have worked here?', '2002-05-29 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66340, 1932, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is the subject really as yellow as I see him?  Lips are rosy pink, eyes brown, hair black, but even the bandaids look yellow.  Flash burn between the eyebrows, not good, try taking a step backwards.<br/>Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 8 total 7</td>', 'Is the subject really as yellow as I see him?  Lips are rosy pink, eyes brown, hair black, but even the bandaids look yellow.  Flash burn between the eyebrows, not good, try taking a step backwards.Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 8 total 7', '2002-05-29 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66341, 1932, 1911, '<td valign="top">is this guy on drugs?</td>', 'is this guy on drugs?', '2002-05-30 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66342, 1932, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I think the lighting is a bit too harsh so that the bandages don''t show up as much as they could have if he was lit from the side or something.</td>', 'Interesting.  I think the lighting is a bit too harsh so that the bandages don''t show up as much as they could have if he was lit from the side or something.', '2002-05-30 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66343, 1932, 1280, '<td valign="top">This certainly illustrates battered and bruised.</td>', 'This certainly illustrates battered and bruised.', '2002-05-31 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66344, 1933, 1379, '<td valign="top">Looks so lonesome.....  I think the black and white really enhance this shot.  The reflections on the floor are great.</td>', 'Looks so lonesome.....  I think the black and white really enhance this shot.  The reflections on the floor are great.', '2002-05-27 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66345, 1933, 1211, '<td valign="top">This is great.  Love the composition.  Especially like how no one else is visible in the picture.  Really like b/w here.</td>', 'This is great.  Love the composition.  Especially like how no one else is visible in the picture.  Really like b/w here.', '2002-05-27 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66346, 1933, 1037, '<td valign="top">There''s lots of pathos in this image, and the soft lighting and black and white work well. The focus is just a little off.</td>', 'There''s lots of pathos in this image, and the soft lighting and black and white work well. The focus is just a little off.', '2002-05-27 03:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66347, 1933, 509, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I think it may be better in color</td>', 'I like this, but I think it may be better in color', '2002-05-27 07:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66348, 1933, 1808, '<td valign="top">If it''s lunch time, where is everyone?</td>', 'If it''s lunch time, where is everyone?', '2002-05-27 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66349, 1933, 668, '<td valign="top">excelent composition<br/>unsettling<br/>i like</td>', 'excelent compositionunsettlingi like', '2002-05-27 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66350, 1933, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent in black and white.  a TOUCH blurry, which I think adds to the detachment generated by the lone customer with back to camera.  very well done exposure/light. I''m jealous : )</td>', 'excellent in black and white.  a TOUCH blurry, which I think adds to the detachment generated by the lone customer with back to camera.  very well done exposure/light. I''m jealous : )', '2002-05-27 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66351, 1933, 327, '<td valign="top">Good looking b&amp;w, well done. I like this shot.</td>', 'Good looking b&w, well done. I like this shot.', '2002-05-27 18:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66352, 1933, 1886, '<td valign="top">very nice shot</td>', 'very nice shot', '2002-05-28 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66353, 1933, 975, '<td valign="top">Did you flip it horizontally on purpose???  Nice picture, though.  Maybe focus could be a little better!</td>', 'Did you flip it horizontally on purpose???  Nice picture, though.  Maybe focus could be a little better!', '2002-05-28 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66354, 1933, 907, '<td valign="top">great choice for b&amp;w</td>', 'great choice for b&w', '2002-05-28 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66355, 1933, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.. The black and white aspect of it really strikes me as well... The focus is a little soft and I may be able to contribute that to a lower end camera.  What I don''t understand about this photo is the ''mirrored'' signs on the right wall behind the bar... I am unable to tell if this is only on that wall or if this whole photo is mirrored?  Regardless... its a great photo and it gets a 9 this week... good job!</td>', 'I really like this photo.. The black and white aspect of it really strikes me as well... The focus is a little soft and I may be able to contribute that to a lower end camera.  What I don''t understand about this photo is the ''mirrored'' signs on the right wall behind the bar... I am unable to tell if this is only on that wall or if this whole photo is mirrored?  Regardless... its a great photo and it gets a 9 this week... good job!', '2002-05-28 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66356, 1933, 773, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, and I think you chose well with black and white rather than color.   It makes the photo much more interesting this way.</td>', 'I like this photo, and I think you chose well with black and white rather than color.   It makes the photo much more interesting this way.', '2002-05-28 15:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66357, 1933, 1, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a diner than a gas station, eh?  The man seems to be out of focus as well (that or blurred).</td>', 'This looks more like a diner than a gas station, eh?  The man seems to be out of focus as well (that or blurred).', '2002-05-28 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66358, 1933, 1041, '<td valign="top">Did you know that person?  If yes, I would''ve asked him to move to a different table so that his reflection is not cut off by the poster.  That would also have given more visibility to his face, something I''m lacking in this photo.  Other than that, I like the b&amp;w, the angle and framing.</td>', 'Did you know that person?  If yes, I would''ve asked him to move to a different table so that his reflection is not cut off by the poster.  That would also have given more visibility to his face, something I''m lacking in this photo.  Other than that, I like the b&w, the angle and framing.', '2002-05-29 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66359, 1933, 255, '<td valign="top">this a great shot in that it makes you feel...lonely. or something. i only wish the guy was in better focus, otherwise very nice.</td>', 'this a great shot in that it makes you feel...lonely. or something. i only wish the guy was in better focus, otherwise very nice.', '2002-05-29 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66360, 1933, 1005, '<td valign="top">What''s your point?  I am attempting to find something constructive to comment on, but I just don''t see anything here to "move me".  Your subject is not well portrayed, dark, hard to make out.  I see better detail in the chair in the foreground.<br/>Sorry  Photo 6 Creativity 4 People 5 total 5</td>', 'What''s your point?  I am attempting to find something constructive to comment on, but I just don''t see anything here to "move me".  Your subject is not well portrayed, dark, hard to make out.  I see better detail in the chair in the foreground.Sorry  Photo 6 Creativity 4 People 5 total 5', '2002-05-29 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66361, 1933, 674, '<td valign="top">The window gives a distracting white patch, perhaps fill in flash would have helped.</td>', 'The window gives a distracting white patch, perhaps fill in flash would have helped.', '2002-05-30 00:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66362, 1933, 885, '<td valign="top">Did you flip this 180 degrees?  Looks like some of the letters are backwards.  I like the floor and the stools.  I don''t like the person behind the counter with their head behind the poster.</td>', 'Did you flip this 180 degrees?  Looks like some of the letters are backwards.  I like the floor and the stools.  I don''t like the person behind the counter with their head behind the poster.', '2002-05-30 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66363, 1933, 1024, '<td valign="top">This photograph gives me such a feeling of nostalgia.  Good use of black and white, it transports me back in time.</td>', 'This photograph gives me such a feeling of nostalgia.  Good use of black and white, it transports me back in time.', '2002-05-30 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66364, 1933, 1651, '<td valign="top">i like it.</td>', 'i like it.', '2002-05-30 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66365, 1933, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the focus is intentionally a bit soft (to give a feeling of reminiscence) or not, but I feel like this needs to be a little sharper.  I don''t know if that''s a "model" or if this is a grab shot, but if a model, I might have tried a slightly different location so the poster doesn''t cut off the head in the reflection.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the focus is intentionally a bit soft (to give a feeling of reminiscence) or not, but I feel like this needs to be a little sharper.  I don''t know if that''s a "model" or if this is a grab shot, but if a model, I might have tried a slightly different location so the poster doesn''t cut off the head in the reflection.', '2002-05-31 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66366, 1933, 878, '<td valign="top">A little out of focus and getting more of tehe diner would be cool too.</td>', 'A little out of focus and getting more of tehe diner would be cool too.', '2002-06-02 02:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66367, 1933, 1908, '<td valign="top">It''s lacking that zing. But hey I do like b&amp;w points for that. Also the person should be to the right more and slighty more the profile would make this better</td>', 'It''s lacking that zing. But hey I do like b&w points for that. Also the person should be to the right more and slighty more the profile would make this better', '2002-06-02 03:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66368, 1933, 1750, '<td valign="top">The metal really makes this photo. It ties the floor in with both subject and background. It''s likely I would have dodged the walls a bit to brighten up and separate the background.</td>', 'The metal really makes this photo. It ties the floor in with both subject and background. It''s likely I would have dodged the walls a bit to brighten up and separate the background.', '2002-06-02 03:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66369, 1934, 1211, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2002-05-27 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66370, 1934, 92, '<td valign="top">The ladies seem very bored with it all LOL ... It''s like their thinking...we could be making candles and getting our sewing done instead of looking at endless water in public. LOL...I love this photo !</td>', 'The ladies seem very bored with it all LOL ... It''s like their thinking...we could be making candles and getting our sewing done instead of looking at endless water in public. LOL...I love this photo !', '2002-05-27 02:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66371, 1934, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, very surreal! You did very well in capturing this group of people in such a great location. The composition is just a little off to me.</td>', 'Wow, very surreal! You did very well in capturing this group of people in such a great location. The composition is just a little off to me.', '2002-05-27 04:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66372, 1934, 1808, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Must be real life.</td>', 'Interesting. Must be real life.', '2002-05-27 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66373, 1934, 47, '<td valign="top">if you had taken two steps to the left and gotten rid of those houses while centering the amish folks, and then dropped a bomb on that fucking idiot in the red shirt in the background, this would have been an even better shot.<br/><br/>the waves in the background between the folks in the foreground are a bit distracting.. but obviously that isnt your fault.</td>', 'if you had taken two steps to the left and gotten rid of those houses while centering the amish folks, and then dropped a bomb on that fucking idiot in the red shirt in the background, this would have been an even better shot.the waves in the background between the folks in the foreground are a bit distracting.. but obviously that isnt your fault.', '2002-05-27 10:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66374, 1934, 449, '<td valign="top">I saw that same suit in Vicky''s secret last month.</td>', 'I saw that same suit in Vicky''s secret last month.', '2002-05-27 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66375, 1934, 1379, '<td valign="top">Hey, Quakers wanna see the Pacific, too!  I especially love the matching shawl and skirt set.  Do you think the guy in the center (beardless) was some kind of escort or chaperone?  What a random thing to see!</td>', 'Hey, Quakers wanna see the Pacific, too!  I especially love the matching shawl and skirt set.  Do you think the guy in the center (beardless) was some kind of escort or chaperone?  What a random thing to see!', '2002-05-27 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66376, 1934, 327, '<td valign="top">O'' my gosh this is funny to see. &amp;lt;lol&amp;gt; How great! Just a wonderful, fun shot and you''ve done it well. Beautiful colors, clear, clean shot! These are great _people_.</td>', 'O'' my gosh this is funny to see. &lt;lol&gt; How great! Just a wonderful, fun shot and you''ve done it well. Beautiful colors, clear, clean shot! These are great _people_.', '2002-05-27 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66377, 1934, 741, '<td valign="top">Great surreal shot - the kid in the red shirt is a bit distracting, a slight change of angle would have removed them and imporved the shot.</td>', 'Great surreal shot - the kid in the red shirt is a bit distracting, a slight change of angle would have removed them and imporved the shot.', '2002-05-28 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66378, 1934, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.. I believe that centering them up in the frame would have improved the overall photo just a bit :)</td>', 'Nice photo.. I believe that centering them up in the frame would have improved the overall photo just a bit :)', '2002-05-28 06:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66379, 1934, 656, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast.  Feel the people in the background could have been used to really show the contrast if you''d taken it from a slightly different location - more to the left maybe, to loose some background and have people playing more traditionally in the surf ?</td>', 'Interesting contrast.  Feel the people in the background could have been used to really show the contrast if you''d taken it from a slightly different location - more to the left maybe, to loose some background and have people playing more traditionally in the surf ?', '2002-05-28 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66380, 1934, 1844, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot. One can feel the interaction between the people. They ARE out of place somehow but sweet at the same time. I appreciate the humor.<br/>Should have cropped the space behind the woman with the blue dress at the left.Maybe only leave the lover buildings on the horizon. But still the bset so far.</td>', 'I like this one a lot. One can feel the interaction between the people. They ARE out of place somehow but sweet at the same time. I appreciate the humor.Should have cropped the space behind the woman with the blue dress at the left.Maybe only leave the lover buildings on the horizon. But still the bset so far.', '2002-05-28 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66381, 1934, 1005, '<td valign="top">Must have been a long buggy ride!  I like this one.  Swing a little to the right, you would have centered your group better and avoided some of the noisy clutter in the upper left corner.  Step to your left three steps and center would have been great!<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 (if this was a setup, plus 2 points here)  People 10 total 9</td>', 'Must have been a long buggy ride!  I like this one.  Swing a little to the right, you would have centered your group better and avoided some of the noisy clutter in the upper left corner.  Step to your left three steps and center would have been great!Photo 9 Creativity 7 (if this was a setup, plus 2 points here)  People 10 total 9', '2002-05-28 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66382, 1934, 2, '<td valign="top">I really feel like the image is off balance.  Just about everyone weighs down the right side of the image, and the crop is also heavily to the right side of the image.  I''m guessing this was to get the entire shadow of the woman on the left.  I can definitely understand that.  Maybe if you were able to take another shot with yourself placed a little further to the right..</td>', 'I really feel like the image is off balance.  Just about everyone weighs down the right side of the image, and the crop is also heavily to the right side of the image.  I''m guessing this was to get the entire shadow of the woman on the left.  I can definitely understand that.  Maybe if you were able to take another shot with yourself placed a little further to the right..', '2002-05-28 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66383, 1934, 509, '<td valign="top">Amish at the beach...who knew?  Unusual and interesting subject, good job, This might have been better from a different angle though, in terms of where the shadows fall - One shadow almost covers the second man from the right</td>', 'Amish at the beach...who knew?  Unusual and interesting subject, good job, This might have been better from a different angle though, in terms of where the shadows fall - One shadow almost covers the second man from the right', '2002-05-28 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66384, 1934, 737, '<td valign="top">Something about this really catches the "people" aspect for me. Nice shot. In my top 5.</td>', 'Something about this really catches the "people" aspect for me. Nice shot. In my top 5.', '2002-05-28 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66385, 1934, 301, '<td valign="top">he he ... I hope that isn''t a camera he''s holding :).  I think a tighter crop and less DOF would have worked better.  The kids in the water, especially the one in the red shirt are a bit distracting.</td>', 'he he ... I hope that isn''t a camera he''s holding :).  I think a tighter crop and less DOF would have worked better.  The kids in the water, especially the one in the red shirt are a bit distracting.', '2002-05-29 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66386, 1934, 587, '<td valign="top">this is hysterical. Given the opportunity to ''change'' something, I wish the shadows weren''t there, but they certainly don''t ruin this. Great photo!</td>', 'this is hysterical. Given the opportunity to ''change'' something, I wish the shadows weren''t there, but they certainly don''t ruin this. Great photo!', '2002-05-29 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66387, 1934, 1599, '<td valign="top">yup</td>', 'yup', '2002-05-29 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66388, 1934, 1547, '<td valign="top">Great subject matter. It''s too bad the cliffs line up with their heads the way it does.  I think it would have been better visually to have had the cliffs either clear the top of their heads of had the heads line up above the cliffs.  Great shot though.</td>', 'Great subject matter. It''s too bad the cliffs line up with their heads the way it does.  I think it would have been better visually to have had the cliffs either clear the top of their heads of had the heads line up above the cliffs.  Great shot though.', '2002-05-29 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66389, 1934, 1585, '<td valign="top">Is the guy on the right holding a camera? Shouldn''t he have to draw or paint pictures of the beach? A little more centered and it would be great.</td>', 'Is the guy on the right holding a camera? Shouldn''t he have to draw or paint pictures of the beach? A little more centered and it would be great.', '2002-05-29 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66390, 1934, 1847, '<td valign="top">I lingered on this photo for a while, creating a story in my head about these people.  That seems to me to define a good photo!  (Plus the blues are gorgeous)</td>', 'I lingered on this photo for a while, creating a story in my head about these people.  That seems to me to define a good photo!  (Plus the blues are gorgeous)', '2002-05-29 19:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66391, 1934, 1024, '<td valign="top">The only (small) distraction is the boy in the red shirt in the background.  Could you have waited until he left, or moved your angle alittle bit so that he was not between the subjects?</td>', 'The only (small) distraction is the boy in the red shirt in the background.  Could you have waited until he left, or moved your angle alittle bit so that he was not between the subjects?', '2002-05-30 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66392, 1934, 885, '<td valign="top">Yes they do look out of place, and so does that person in the red shirt bending down between the two women.  It''s a cool picture, the shadows might be a little underexposed, but it makes up for a lot of its faults in sheer surreality.</td>', 'Yes they do look out of place, and so does that person in the red shirt bending down between the two women.  It''s a cool picture, the shadows might be a little underexposed, but it makes up for a lot of its faults in sheer surreality.', '2002-05-30 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66393, 1934, 718, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite place in the world!</td>', 'This is my favorite place in the world!', '2002-05-30 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66394, 1934, 1325, '<td valign="top">You captured a unique scene here.  The contrast between the Dunkard dress &amp; the beach houses behind are a real contrast in the differences of people.  Good job.</td>', 'You captured a unique scene here.  The contrast between the Dunkard dress & the beach houses behind are a real contrast in the differences of people.  Good job.', '2002-05-31 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66395, 1934, 142, '<td valign="top">Cool scene.  The only fault I can find is that I keep wishing there was a girl with a thong swimsuit in the background just to bring out the contrast and whatever reactions these people would have.</td>', 'Cool scene.  The only fault I can find is that I keep wishing there was a girl with a thong swimsuit in the background just to bring out the contrast and whatever reactions these people would have.', '2002-06-01 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66396, 1934, 1908, '<td valign="top">I like to to see the all the people''s faces and in the end what are u trying to say with the photo</td>', 'I like to to see the all the people''s faces and in the end what are u trying to say with the photo', '2002-06-02 02:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66397, 1934, 878, '<td valign="top">Hehehe doesn''t it look like Brother Jezabiah on the far right has a digicam :D</td>', 'Hehehe doesn''t it look like Brother Jezabiah on the far right has a digicam :D', '2002-06-02 03:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66398, 1934, 661, '<td valign="top">Interesting grouping in an interesting location.  Like the contrast with the black and the colors.</td>', 'Interesting grouping in an interesting location.  Like the contrast with the black and the colors.', '2002-06-02 20:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66399, 1934, 1750, '<td valign="top">The purple dress makes this picture, but once I noticed the woman in red in the background she detracted from the scene.</td>', 'The purple dress makes this picture, but once I noticed the woman in red in the background she detracted from the scene.', '2002-06-02 21:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66400, 1934, 773, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I love the mood of the photo.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I love the mood of the photo.', '2002-06-02 23:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66401, 1935, 801, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. Nice low-key image</td>', 'Congratulations. Nice low-key image', '2002-05-27 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66402, 1935, 1581, '<td valign="top">stunning. very christina riche</td>', 'stunning. very christina riche', '2002-05-27 01:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66403, 1935, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely fantastic :). I love the colouring. It looks just like one of the watercolour illustrations from a fairy tale book I have. I also love the draping of the dress, the way it''s caught by the lighting. If only the light wasn''t glancing off that upper left hand corner!</td>', 'This is absolutely fantastic :). I love the colouring. It looks just like one of the watercolour illustrations from a fairy tale book I have. I also love the draping of the dress, the way it''s caught by the lighting. If only the light wasn''t glancing off that upper left hand corner!', '2002-05-27 03:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66404, 1935, 1865, '<td valign="top">Nice dreamy feel to the pic. Good selection of colors on the backdrop and clothes. to enhance the effect.</td>', 'Nice dreamy feel to the pic. Good selection of colors on the backdrop and clothes. to enhance the effect.', '2002-05-27 05:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66405, 1935, 1831, '<td valign="top">cracking photo, cracking model. Should be in FHM or Loaded.</td>', 'cracking photo, cracking model. Should be in FHM or Loaded.', '2002-05-27 06:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66406, 1935, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice fashion picture.</td>', 'Nice fashion picture.', '2002-05-27 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66407, 1935, 616, '<td valign="top">wow that is a nice photo. That green dress is amazing! That thing over laping on the right side is a little distracting though...</td>', 'wow that is a nice photo. That green dress is amazing! That thing over laping on the right side is a little distracting though...', '2002-05-27 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66408, 1935, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Perhaps could have been a bit brighter.  What''s that on the right edge of the screen?  Love the colors.</td>', 'Great composition.  Perhaps could have been a bit brighter.  What''s that on the right edge of the screen?  Love the colors.', '2002-05-27 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66409, 1935, 327, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot, love the green dress. I''d like her pose better if her neck didn''t look so uncomfortable. This is good work, nice light.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot, love the green dress. I''d like her pose better if her neck didn''t look so uncomfortable. This is good work, nice light.', '2002-05-27 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66410, 1935, 1061, '<td valign="top">Excellent</td>', 'Excellent', '2002-05-27 21:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66411, 1935, 1878, '<td valign="top">You got a well deserved 10.</td>', 'You got a well deserved 10.', '2002-05-27 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66412, 1935, 1834, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2002-05-28 11:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66413, 1935, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  The blueish ting on her legs and hand on the left is a bit strange but this photo stands out this week... good job! = 9</td>', 'Nice photo!  The blueish ting on her legs and hand on the left is a bit strange but this photo stands out this week... good job! = 9', '2002-05-28 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66414, 1935, 1717, '<td valign="top">nice shadows and color.  good composition.</td>', 'nice shadows and color.  good composition.', '2002-05-28 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66415, 1935, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, good color and effect! It would be interesting to see without the reflection from the backdrop in the upper left. Regardless, well done.</td>', 'Nice lighting, good color and effect! It would be interesting to see without the reflection from the backdrop in the upper left. Regardless, well done.', '2002-05-28 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66416, 1935, 737, '<td valign="top">A real good shot, though I would have preferred a little more light on the left hand. Great lighting on the face. All in all, in my top 10.</td>', 'A real good shot, though I would have preferred a little more light on the left hand. Great lighting on the face. All in all, in my top 10.', '2002-05-28 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66417, 1935, 1897, '<td valign="top">Very striking, good mood and colors.</td>', 'Very striking, good mood and colors.', '2002-05-28 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66418, 1935, 806, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to make of this... I''m a little haunted, yet I keep coming back to it. Appealing.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to make of this... I''m a little haunted, yet I keep coming back to it. Appealing.', '2002-05-28 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66419, 1935, 312, '<td valign="top">i like this shot, but i think it''s really underexposed. looks like you may have tried to compensate for it in photoshop and got the whites a little too exposed without really making the rest any better. everything else about the shot is good, though.</td>', 'i like this shot, but i think it''s really underexposed. looks like you may have tried to compensate for it in photoshop and got the whites a little too exposed without really making the rest any better. everything else about the shot is good, though.', '2002-05-28 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66420, 1935, 1005, '<td valign="top">I am assuming the color was "on purpose", so I am giving you the benefit of that doubt (the title helped you here).  I think I would have liked to see the girls hair better, or lose the bright spot in the upper left corner, either way, it''s better, IMO)<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 10 People 9 total 9  (if the surreal coloring was an accident, please lower your score 4 points, but only you can say that for certain, so you get the 9)</td>', 'I am assuming the color was "on purpose", so I am giving you the benefit of that doubt (the title helped you here).  I think I would have liked to see the girls hair better, or lose the bright spot in the upper left corner, either way, it''s better, IMO)Photo 9 Creativity 10 People 9 total 9  (if the surreal coloring was an accident, please lower your score 4 points, but only you can say that for certain, so you get the 9)', '2002-05-28 18:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66421, 1935, 1603, '<td valign="top">Great pic...Love the colors.</td>', 'Great pic...Love the colors.', '2002-05-29 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66422, 1935, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This pops!  I like the creases in the fabric as it wrinkles over her body.</td>', 'Wow!  This pops!  I like the creases in the fabric as it wrinkles over her body.', '2002-05-29 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66423, 1935, 1679, '<td valign="top">Very good contrast, tonality and use of colours. I also like the toned eyes. Nice pose, too.<br/>Simple, but nice!</td>', 'Very good contrast, tonality and use of colours. I also like the toned eyes. Nice pose, too.Simple, but nice!', '2002-05-29 18:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66424, 1935, 1009, '<td valign="top">Cool</td>', 'Cool', '2002-05-29 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66425, 1935, 1847, '<td valign="top">Fantastic colors!  Wonderful pose.  Something I can''t put my finger on about the cropping isn''t sitting quite right, but a small, SMALL annoyance.  Fantastic shot!</td>', 'Fantastic colors!  Wonderful pose.  Something I can''t put my finger on about the cropping isn''t sitting quite right, but a small, SMALL annoyance.  Fantastic shot!', '2002-05-29 19:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66426, 1935, 674, '<td valign="top">Rather over exposed patch top left detracts from the image</td>', 'Rather over exposed patch top left detracts from the image', '2002-05-30 00:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66427, 1935, 1910, '<td valign="top">nice usage of color</td>', 'nice usage of color', '2002-05-30 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66428, 1935, 1066, '<td valign="top">Great color...Love the green dress, maroon background..every color here.<br/><br/>I found myself wanting a little more detail to the hair..she has such great lenght and color that it just SCREAMS to be highlighted more.<br/><br/>One of my 10 best.</td>', 'Great color...Love the green dress, maroon background..every color here.I found myself wanting a little more detail to the hair..she has such great lenght and color that it just SCREAMS to be highlighted more.One of my 10 best.', '2002-05-30 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66429, 1935, 573, '<td valign="top">I starred at this picture for five minutes wondering what drew me to it.  Then all of a sudden I realized my focus was fixed to her face even though I wanted to look at everything else, good use of composition and lighting.</td>', 'I starred at this picture for five minutes wondering what drew me to it.  Then all of a sudden I realized my focus was fixed to her face even though I wanted to look at everything else, good use of composition and lighting.', '2002-05-30 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66430, 1935, 1909, '<td valign="top">Has a genuine feel of a black and white old photo thats been colourised</td>', 'Has a genuine feel of a black and white old photo thats been colourised', '2002-05-31 02:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66431, 1935, 1175, '<td valign="top">"Pretty girl killed by vomit colored dress"  I really like this picture but I dislike the dress.  Bottom of the skirt is rolled up.  Face seems a bit to bright, glare on the background in the upper left hand corner distracting.  Its a good idea that in my opinion was mostly hurt by color choice.</td>', '"Pretty girl killed by vomit colored dress"  I really like this picture but I dislike the dress.  Bottom of the skirt is rolled up.  Face seems a bit to bright, glare on the background in the upper left hand corner distracting.  Its a good idea that in my opinion was mostly hurt by color choice.', '2002-05-31 08:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66432, 1935, 1078, '<td valign="top">OK, so I know it''s not intentional, but I like how she''s looking at the 10 on the voting score....  :-)  The colors (the red and green) definitely aren''t standard, but they all work really well together.  Her face loks a little grainy, sharpened, over saturated or something (I can''t quite tell what it is that I''m seeing -- sorry), but I like the look it gives to the shot.  There''s that little loop of something on the far right edge that I could wish wasn''t there, but that''s not that big a deal.  Good shot.</td>', 'OK, so I know it''s not intentional, but I like how she''s looking at the 10 on the voting score....  :-)  The colors (the red and green) definitely aren''t standard, but they all work really well together.  Her face loks a little grainy, sharpened, over saturated or something (I can''t quite tell what it is that I''m seeing -- sorry), but I like the look it gives to the shot.  There''s that little loop of something on the far right edge that I could wish wasn''t there, but that''s not that big a deal.  Good shot.', '2002-05-31 11:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66433, 1935, 543, '<td valign="top">Hey, Buddy, this is supposed to be an *amature* photo contest.  {g}</td>', 'Hey, Buddy, this is supposed to be an *amature* photo contest.  {g}', '2002-05-31 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(66434, 1935, 142, '<td valign="top">I''m really looking forward to finding out how you set this photo up.  Good job!</td>', 'I''m really looking forward to finding out how you set this photo up.  Good job!', '2002-06-01 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66435, 1935, 205, '<td valign="top">This is nice<br/></td>', 'This is nice', '2002-06-01 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66436, 1935, 878, '<td valign="top">This is a nice clean shot great layout the only thing I would change is to add a dimly lit soft light in the bottom right.</td>', 'This is a nice clean shot great layout the only thing I would change is to add a dimly lit soft light in the bottom right.', '2002-06-02 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66437, 1935, 661, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the composition.</td>', 'I like the colors and the composition.', '2002-06-02 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66438, 1935, 1446, '<td valign="top">Are you a Saudek fan?</td>', 'Are you a Saudek fan?', '2002-06-02 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66439, 1935, 1750, '<td valign="top">You''re really messing with me now. This is the third picture I want to call "my favorite. It''s a stunning photo because of that green dress and the Goth skin against the dark background.</td>', 'You''re really messing with me now. This is the third picture I want to call "my favorite. It''s a stunning photo because of that green dress and the Goth skin against the dark background.', '2002-06-02 20:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66440, 1935, 1, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a bit saturated, though I think it''s probably the result you wanted.  The top left thing and whatever the other thing is on the right seem distracting.</td>', 'Colors seem a bit saturated, though I think it''s probably the result you wanted.  The top left thing and whatever the other thing is on the right seem distracting.', '2002-06-02 21:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66441, 1935, 1336, '<td valign="top">well shot.  great colors.</td>', 'well shot.  great colors.', '2002-06-02 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66442, 1935, 1066, '<td valign="top">Yah!!  Kollin. <br/><br/>I must say Kollin, this model owes you a great debt because this is one nice photo you gave her.<br/><br/>I am not one to mess with a photograph..it is what it is.  But I wonder what she would have looked like laying on a white background..allowing her hair to really be seen.  Would have it ruined the nice , dark shadows?  Hard to say.  But I find this photo very good regardless.</td>', 'Yah!!  Kollin. I must say Kollin, this model owes you a great debt because this is one nice photo you gave her.I am not one to mess with a photograph..it is what it is.  But I wonder what she would have looked like laying on a white background..allowing her hair to really be seen.  Would have it ruined the nice , dark shadows?  Hard to say.  But I find this photo very good regardless.', '2002-06-04 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66443, 1935, 472, '<td valign="top">dude. thanks : ) .  i hadnt looked back here in awhile.  i *did* want to shoot her against white but we ran out of time.  a beautiful girl and really a pleasure to work with.  I''ll put up some other shots from this session as soon as I can : ) ..</td>', 'dude. thanks : ) .  i hadnt looked back here in awhile.  i *did* want to shoot her against white but we ran out of time.  a beautiful girl and really a pleasure to work with.  I''ll put up some other shots from this session as soon as I can : ) ..', '2002-06-04 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66444, 1935, 1715, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if I added a comment to this one yet, but I think this is a very excellent picture. If anyone says something''s distracting them, or there''s too much  light on their face, or anything like that, I just think those people don''t want to admit that your photograph might be better than some of the things they have ever taken, or submited in one of the challenges :-)<br/><br/>(I love posting comments, muhahahahhaha)</td>', 'I''m not sure if I added a comment to this one yet, but I think this is a very excellent picture. If anyone says something''s distracting them, or there''s too much  light on their face, or anything like that, I just think those people don''t want to admit that your photograph might be better than some of the things they have ever taken, or submited in one of the challenges :-)(I love posting comments, muhahahahhaha)', '2002-06-05 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66445, 1935, 472, '<td valign="top">well, thank you, ME.  that''s extremely kind of you, even if it isn''t true ~_~</td>', 'well, thank you, ME.  that''s extremely kind of you, even if it isn''t true ~_~', '2002-06-07 00:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66446, 1938, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting glow of the light in this photo... good job!</td>', 'I like the interesting glow of the light in this photo... good job!', '2002-05-27 11:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66447, 1938, 1808, '<td valign="top">Nice implied action.</td>', 'Nice implied action.', '2002-05-27 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66448, 1938, 668, '<td valign="top">ew too glossy shiny luminous</td>', 'ew too glossy shiny luminous', '2002-05-27 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66449, 1938, 1569, '<td valign="top">Andrew needs to be in focus.</td>', 'Andrew needs to be in focus.', '2002-05-27 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66450, 1938, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute little _people_ fella at the zoo. Did you use a filter or is this just blurring from the sun? Nice shot.</td>', 'Cute little _people_ fella at the zoo. Did you use a filter or is this just blurring from the sun? Nice shot.', '2002-05-27 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66451, 1938, 907, '<td valign="top">Andrew and 10 others...wish they were cropped out, cute little boy. Sunlight is very hard to get ''just right'' - valant effort.</td>', 'Andrew and 10 others...wish they were cropped out, cute little boy. Sunlight is very hard to get ''just right'' - valant effort.', '2002-05-28 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66452, 1938, 280, '<td valign="top">The quality of this shot isnt so good, I dont know if it''s your camera or you mayve used too much compression when you saved this image.</td>', 'The quality of this shot isnt so good, I dont know if it''s your camera or you mayve used too much compression when you saved this image.', '2002-05-28 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66453, 1938, 1041, '<td valign="top">Andrew''s a cutie!  I think I would''ve preferred the photo better if it wasn''t quite as compressed (you can submit a photo of up to 150kb in size, yours is just over 30 kb) and if you had got a lower camera angle so that you''d be more on eye-level with Andrew.  I love the expression on his face.</td>', 'Andrew''s a cutie!  I think I would''ve preferred the photo better if it wasn''t quite as compressed (you can submit a photo of up to 150kb in size, yours is just over 30 kb) and if you had got a lower camera angle so that you''d be more on eye-level with Andrew.  I love the expression on his face.', '2002-05-28 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66454, 1938, 811, '<td valign="top">Great expression on the face.  It''s also kind of neat that you are taking a picture of him, and everyone else is taking a picture of something else.  A little bright in spots, and "jaggy" in others.  If you sharpened it, you may have done a little too much.</td>', 'Great expression on the face.  It''s also kind of neat that you are taking a picture of him, and everyone else is taking a picture of something else.  A little bright in spots, and "jaggy" in others.  If you sharpened it, you may have done a little too much.', '2002-05-28 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66455, 1938, 1005, '<td valign="top">Try cleaning your lens (were you going for the "soft" focus effect?)  Sunlight reflecting off the boys arms is tooooo harsh.  Not bad, but try again, this one needs work.<br/>Photo 6 Creativity 6 People 7 total 6</td>', 'Try cleaning your lens (were you going for the "soft" focus effect?)  Sunlight reflecting off the boys arms is tooooo harsh.  Not bad, but try again, this one needs work.Photo 6 Creativity 6 People 7 total 6', '2002-05-28 18:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66456, 1938, 1379, '<td valign="top">Andrew is so radiant in the sunshine... It''s like a dream.  I''m glad he got the front row!</td>', 'Andrew is so radiant in the sunshine... It''s like a dream.  I''m glad he got the front row!', '2002-05-28 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66457, 1938, 1009, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if the lighting effect is intentional or not, if so then kudos. I like the over exposed look in this pic, gives a dreamy quality... not quite reality.</td>', 'Don''t know if the lighting effect is intentional or not, if so then kudos. I like the over exposed look in this pic, gives a dreamy quality... not quite reality.', '2002-05-28 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66458, 1938, 255, '<td valign="top">taking pictures in direct sunlight is hard--way too many ''hot spots''. i might have focused more on andrew, and since he is relatively level with the fence, used that as a background so you could see the water and animals in the picture.</td>', 'taking pictures in direct sunlight is hard--way too many ''hot spots''. i might have focused more on andrew, and since he is relatively level with the fence, used that as a background so you could see the water and animals in the picture.', '2002-05-29 00:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66459, 1938, 1, '<td valign="top">Very over-exposed, the child seems almost ghostly.  There''s no resemblance of a zoo either, who knows what''s past the gate?  I think the inclusion of some zoo animals would''ve helped.</td>', 'Very over-exposed, the child seems almost ghostly.  There''s no resemblance of a zoo either, who knows what''s past the gate?  I think the inclusion of some zoo animals would''ve helped.', '2002-05-29 06:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66460, 1938, 509, '<td valign="top">This has a nice soft focus to it, but it looks overly compressed to me.  Very cool that you''re not the only one there with a digital.  Is that a Canon Pro90 I see?  I also think the person immediately on the left could be cut out.  The focus is very strong on his (or her) hands.</td>', 'This has a nice soft focus to it, but it looks overly compressed to me.  Very cool that you''re not the only one there with a digital.  Is that a Canon Pro90 I see?  I also think the person immediately on the left could be cut out.  The focus is very strong on his (or her) hands.', '2002-05-29 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66461, 1938, 1599, '<td valign="top">ok</td>', 'ok', '2002-05-29 16:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66462, 1938, 1679, '<td valign="top">Lots of jaggies and bloomed highlights?<br/>Lots of cameras, too! Where were you?</td>', 'Lots of jaggies and bloomed highlights?Lots of cameras, too! Where were you?', '2002-05-29 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66463, 1938, 573, '<td valign="top">This is only a snapshot, I feel that there was not much thought that went into this image.</td>', 'This is only a snapshot, I feel that there was not much thought that went into this image.', '2002-05-30 20:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66464, 1938, 1031, '<td valign="top">One of the first things I did when I got my digital camera was take a trip to the zoo with my son.<br/>If you had anough data/resolution, I think I''d have cropped off the heads of the people at the top so as to further isolate Andrew (he''d be the only "whole" person in the frame).</td>', 'One of the first things I did when I got my digital camera was take a trip to the zoo with my son.If you had anough data/resolution, I think I''d have cropped off the heads of the people at the top so as to further isolate Andrew (he''d be the only "whole" person in the frame).', '2002-06-01 23:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66465, 1939, 1808, '<td valign="top">I thought of that title before I read yours! Fun! Good action.</td>', 'I thought of that title before I read yours! Fun! Good action.', '2002-05-27 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66466, 1939, 47, '<td valign="top">this has snapshot written all over it.</td>', 'this has snapshot written all over it.', '2002-05-27 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66467, 1939, 772, '<td valign="top">Lots of ''fun'' going on in this photo... good job!</td>', 'Lots of ''fun'' going on in this photo... good job!', '2002-05-27 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66468, 1939, 1379, '<td valign="top">Hooray!  This looks like it was a fun event!!<br/>I love the sheen on the coiffed hair in the foreground, and the expressions on the faces.  Everyone is really enjoying it!</td>', 'Hooray!  This looks like it was a fun event!!I love the sheen on the coiffed hair in the foreground, and the expressions on the faces.  Everyone is really enjoying it!', '2002-05-27 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66469, 1939, 327, '<td valign="top">Okay this looks like a fun time. Great work, great _people_.</td>', 'Okay this looks like a fun time. Great work, great _people_.', '2002-05-27 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66470, 1939, 301, '<td valign="top">At the moment, it is very hard to work out where the real point of interest in this photo is. I assume it''s the bride and groom since the people in the foreground are all turned away from the camera.  Less DOF to blur the foreground would help accentuate the bride and groom.</td>', 'At the moment, it is very hard to work out where the real point of interest in this photo is. I assume it''s the bride and groom since the people in the foreground are all turned away from the camera.  Less DOF to blur the foreground would help accentuate the bride and groom.', '2002-05-28 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66471, 1939, 757, '<td valign="top">kinda busy, if you could have focused in one a particular person would have made a better picture.</td>', 'kinda busy, if you could have focused in one a particular person would have made a better picture.', '2002-05-28 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66472, 1939, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very candid!  Good color and focus.  Conveys a HAPPY group, nicely done.  SMALL NIT:  I want to see the bride and groom better!<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 10 total 9</td>', 'Great shot, very candid!  Good color and focus.  Conveys a HAPPY group, nicely done.  SMALL NIT:  I want to see the bride and groom better!Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 10 total 9', '2002-05-29 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66473, 1939, 616, '<td valign="top">The flash filled in very well. That looks like a fun bunch.</td>', 'The flash filled in very well. That looks like a fun bunch.', '2002-05-29 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66474, 1939, 885, '<td valign="top">neat how everyone seems to be having such a great time</td>', 'neat how everyone seems to be having such a great time', '2002-05-30 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66475, 1939, 1175, '<td valign="top">This would make a nice photo for a family album, but why should I give a damn?  I think the worst subject to take is family.  They offer you a sense of comfort and you then enjoy your picture more than others might.   There is too much going on in this picture, too much noise.  Lighting is too harsh.  This would have been better if you could have gotten close to the bride and groom.</td>', 'This would make a nice photo for a family album, but why should I give a damn?  I think the worst subject to take is family.  They offer you a sense of comfort and you then enjoy your picture more than others might.   There is too much going on in this picture, too much noise.  Lighting is too harsh.  This would have been better if you could have gotten close to the bride and groom.', '2002-05-31 07:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66476, 1939, 1750, '<td valign="top">This is a fun mood picture. The material coming down from the ceiling really softens the dark and straight line.</td>', 'This is a fun mood picture. The material coming down from the ceiling really softens the dark and straight line.', '2002-06-02 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66477, 1939, 1908, '<td valign="top">great shoot like the way the lighting is capurtured</td>', 'great shoot like the way the lighting is capurtured', '2002-06-02 03:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66478, 1941, 327, '<td valign="top">Fish on!! Fun action shot. Little OOF but it''s nice work.</td>', 'Fish on!! Fun action shot. Little OOF but it''s nice work.', '2002-05-27 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66479, 1941, 772, '<td valign="top">The fisherman is a little out of focus.. other than that, good job!</td>', 'The fisherman is a little out of focus.. other than that, good job!', '2002-05-27 20:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66480, 1941, 1750, '<td valign="top">Nice separation of subject from background. Good night shot. Fish has a shadow.</td>', 'Nice separation of subject from background. Good night shot. Fish has a shadow.', '2002-05-28 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66481, 1941, 301, '<td valign="top">It looks like your camera has focused on the background of your photo</td>', 'It looks like your camera has focused on the background of your photo', '2002-05-28 08:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66482, 1941, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a bit of a snapshot, but I love that guy, in his singlet with a ciggie hanging out of his mouth, looking unimpressed with his catch. It''s funny :)</td>', 'This is a bit of a snapshot, but I love that guy, in his singlet with a ciggie hanging out of his mouth, looking unimpressed with his catch. It''s funny :)', '2002-05-28 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66483, 1941, 156, '<td valign="top">if your camera has the ability, spot metering or manually focusing would have the subject focused versus the background, if not, pointing the camera at the subject and lightly depressing the button would "force" the camera to focus where you wanted it to</td>', 'if your camera has the ability, spot metering or manually focusing would have the subject focused versus the background, if not, pointing the camera at the subject and lightly depressing the button would "force" the camera to focus where you wanted it to', '2002-05-28 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66484, 1941, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is that bait?  (I hope it''s not the catch of the day!) Focus appears centered on man''s forward arm.   Motion might not be good in this case, try faster exposure.  Man really stands out, like an overlay, but it''s not.  I like that you caught the sinker.  Nice touch.<br/>Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 7 total 7</td>', 'Is that bait?  (I hope it''s not the catch of the day!) Focus appears centered on man''s forward arm.   Motion might not be good in this case, try faster exposure.  Man really stands out, like an overlay, but it''s not.  I like that you caught the sinker.  Nice touch.Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 7 total 7', '2002-05-28 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66485, 1941, 748, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it better if the tree had not been on the subject''s back.</td>', 'I would have liked it better if the tree had not been on the subject''s back.', '2002-05-28 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66486, 1941, 205, '<td valign="top">I hope he through it back</td>', 'I hope he through it back', '2002-05-28 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66487, 1941, 1009, '<td valign="top">Thats where they get fish sticks...</td>', 'Thats where they get fish sticks...', '2002-05-29 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66488, 1941, 1679, '<td valign="top">Good use of fill-in. But your main subject is blurred. It''s a pitty, as it is a well-balanced shot. The camera seems to have focused on the background.</td>', 'Good use of fill-in. But your main subject is blurred. It''s a pitty, as it is a well-balanced shot. The camera seems to have focused on the background.', '2002-05-29 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66489, 1941, 1031, '<td valign="top">If enough resolution was available I would probably have cropped this a little tighter.</td>', 'If enough resolution was available I would probably have cropped this a little tighter.', '2002-05-30 18:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66490, 1941, 1, '<td valign="top">Focus is so off that this almost looks fake.  The flash doesn''t work well for the time of day that it is.</td>', 'Focus is so off that this almost looks fake.  The flash doesn''t work well for the time of day that it is.', '2002-06-02 21:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66491, 1942, 1379, '<td valign="top">Her hair wisping into her face is great.  I like the shadows you caught on her eyes with the sunshine warming her cheeks.  So cute!</td>', 'Her hair wisping into her face is great.  I like the shadows you caught on her eyes with the sunshine warming her cheeks.  So cute!', '2002-05-27 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66492, 1942, 92, '<td valign="top">A well deserved 10.</td>', 'A well deserved 10.', '2002-05-27 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66493, 1942, 318, '<td valign="top">Very good, but a bit overexposed.</td>', 'Very good, but a bit overexposed.', '2002-05-27 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66494, 1942, 327, '<td valign="top">Fantastic composition. Very well done. Lovely young lady, kissable cheeks!! Good job-congrats on a good photo.</td>', 'Fantastic composition. Very well done. Lovely young lady, kissable cheeks!! Good job-congrats on a good photo.', '2002-05-27 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66495, 1942, 1, '<td valign="top">absolutely adorable.  the expression is priceless.  the included shirt/chain in the frame work very well, as does the DOF.</td>', 'absolutely adorable.  the expression is priceless.  the included shirt/chain in the frame work very well, as does the DOF.', '2002-05-27 20:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66496, 1942, 1750, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. good zone technique. Love the sun reflections in this littel cutie''s hair.</td>', 'I like this shot. good zone technique. Love the sun reflections in this littel cutie''s hair.', '2002-05-28 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66497, 1942, 656, '<td valign="top">great expression - much better than having her staring straight into the camera.</td>', 'great expression - much better than having her staring straight into the camera.', '2002-05-28 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66498, 1942, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent photo!  The title adds a lot to it as well.  I am asking myself what she is looking at... The lighting on the left side of her face is slightly bright but the shadows cast by that light are very nice!  The detail in her hair is also excellent.  Nice job!</td>', 'This is an excellent photo!  The title adds a lot to it as well.  I am asking myself what she is looking at... The lighting on the left side of her face is slightly bright but the shadows cast by that light are very nice!  The detail in her hair is also excellent.  Nice job!', '2002-05-28 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66499, 1942, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice, well captured.  Her right cheek and shirt collar are too washed out, left cheek and forehead much better.  (No downgrade, but why black and white?)<br/>Photo 7 Creativity 6 People 8 total 7</td>', 'Nice, well captured.  Her right cheek and shirt collar are too washed out, left cheek and forehead much better.  (No downgrade, but why black and white?)Photo 7 Creativity 6 People 8 total 7', '2002-05-28 14:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66500, 1942, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white ... is a little overexposed on the collar and the cheek.</td>', 'Nice black and white ... is a little overexposed on the collar and the cheek.', '2002-05-28 17:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66501, 1942, 1534, '<td valign="top">This such a beautiful and innocent picture!</td>', 'This such a beautiful and innocent picture!', '2002-05-28 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66502, 1942, 1446, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  Good lighting.  And of course an adorable subject. One of the better of the portrait shots IMO.</td>', 'Nice portrait.  Good lighting.  And of course an adorable subject. One of the better of the portrait shots IMO.', '2002-05-29 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
