(66507, 1942, 1175, '<td valign="top">Good expression.  Lighting might be a little to hard on the fice.  Can''t really make out the left side of the nose.  I think the picture might need a little more contrast, it might be because of the bright lighting.</td>', 'Good expression.  Lighting might be a little to hard on the fice.  Can''t really make out the left side of the nose.  I think the picture might need a little more contrast, it might be because of the bright lighting.', '2002-05-31 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
