(66521, 1943, 1520, '<td valign="top">I want that lens adapter, filter and flash!!!   :)    I like the angle of the picture.  I don''t like that thing behind the head on the right.  The bed (?) behind the hand is also distracting because there is so much stuff on it.  I might''ve framed down and to the left a little so that your eyes were higher and your head was a little more to the right.  Good facial expression though.<br/><br/></td>', 'I want that lens adapter, filter and flash!!!   :)    I like the angle of the picture.  I don''t like that thing behind the head on the right.  The bed (?) behind the hand is also distracting because there is so much stuff on it.  I might''ve framed down and to the left a little so that your eyes were higher and your head was a little more to the right.  Good facial expression though.', '2002-05-28 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66522, 1943, 156, '<td valign="top">background clutter and tilt is distracting</td>', 'background clutter and tilt is distracting', '2002-05-28 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66523, 1943, 1005, '<td valign="top">Not getting the shot you want?  Almost great.  You have some incedental motion at the top of the flash, doesn''t help.  The lamp in the background kinda appears to be growing out of the subject''s head, not good.  Too cluttered in lower left corner, too bare upper left corner.  Try for more balance, grasshopper.<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 6 People 9 (solid shot of the man)  total 7</td>', 'Not getting the shot you want?  Almost great.  You have some incedental motion at the top of the flash, doesn''t help.  The lamp in the background kinda appears to be growing out of the subject''s head, not good.  Too cluttered in lower left corner, too bare upper left corner.  Try for more balance, grasshopper.Photo 8 Creativity 6 People 9 (solid shot of the man)  total 7', '2002-05-28 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66524, 1943, 1446, '<td valign="top">Showing off the equipment?  The lower left background is distracting to me.</td>', 'Showing off the equipment?  The lower left background is distracting to me.', '2002-05-28 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66525, 1943, 1175, '<td valign="top">Flash is a bit too harsh.  There is some blurring around the camera that is annoying.  Should be more blur if you are trying to give the impression of movement.</td>', 'Flash is a bit too harsh.  There is some blurring around the camera that is annoying.  Should be more blur if you are trying to give the impression of movement.', '2002-05-28 16:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66526, 1943, 1041, '<td valign="top">The expression is priceless and I totally understand it! :)  B&amp;w works well.  One thing that would have made this photo more than a quick snapshot (or that''s what it appears to be) IMO is to at least turn off the lamp. Better yet, move your position a little to the left (if that is possible) so that the lamp and other dark object don''t "grow" out of his head and the clutter on the bed isn''t quite as visible.</td>', 'The expression is priceless and I totally understand it! :)  B&w works well.  One thing that would have made this photo more than a quick snapshot (or that''s what it appears to be) IMO is to at least turn off the lamp. Better yet, move your position a little to the left (if that is possible) so that the lamp and other dark object don''t "grow" out of his head and the clutter on the bed isn''t quite as visible.', '2002-05-29 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66527, 1943, 301, '<td valign="top">look out for lights embedded in your head :)</td>', 'look out for lights embedded in your head :)', '2002-05-29 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66528, 1943, 587, '<td valign="top">:) I recognize that look! heh, 1/2 the time I resemble that look :) Good job, wish the bed was made (I''m drawn to the object on the bed), but a good photo.</td>', ':) I recognize that look! heh, 1/2 the time I resemble that look :) Good job, wish the bed was made (I''m drawn to the object on the bed), but a good photo.', '2002-05-29 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66529, 1943, 1599, '<td valign="top">n/a</td>', 'n/a', '2002-05-29 15:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66530, 1943, 1009, '<td valign="top">Hehehehe... been there done that.</td>', 'Hehehehe... been there done that.', '2002-05-29 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66531, 1943, 1585, '<td valign="top">Don''t kick yourself for taking this one a week early. It''s still good. Good balance.</td>', 'Don''t kick yourself for taking this one a week early. It''s still good. Good balance.', '2002-05-29 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66532, 1943, 1, '<td valign="top">I''ve so been there, but never had a big ol flash on my camera.  The background could really use some work, it makes the photo seem real snap shotty.</td>', 'I''ve so been there, but never had a big ol flash on my camera.  The background could really use some work, it makes the photo seem real snap shotty.', '2002-05-30 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66533, 1943, 1031, '<td valign="top">I can relate...</td>', 'I can relate...', '2002-05-30 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66534, 1943, 811, '<td valign="top">Yep, can be (frustrating that is).  Good lighting and effective use of black and white.</td>', 'Yep, can be (frustrating that is).  Good lighting and effective use of black and white.', '2002-06-01 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66535, 1943, 1750, '<td valign="top">Just don''t toss it out the window!  Great use of zone. Love the tilted angle.</td>', 'Just don''t toss it out the window!  Great use of zone. Love the tilted angle.', '2002-06-02 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66536, 1944, 1808, '<td valign="top">Cute kids.</td>', 'Cute kids.', '2002-05-27 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66537, 1944, 1211, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit off with one looking at the camera and looking natural, one not looking at the camera at all, and one posing for the camera.</td>', 'Seems a bit off with one looking at the camera and looking natural, one not looking at the camera at all, and one posing for the camera.', '2002-05-27 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66538, 1944, 327, '<td valign="top">Little peoples! Very nice, clean clear shot. Wish you''d of cropped out the sides and left the top of her head. Good work and great looking kiddo''s!!</td>', 'Little peoples! Very nice, clean clear shot. Wish you''d of cropped out the sides and left the top of her head. Good work and great looking kiddo''s!!', '2002-05-27 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66539, 1944, 671, '<td valign="top">I like your use of "thirds" to define the space.</td>', 'I like your use of "thirds" to define the space.', '2002-05-27 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66540, 1944, 772, '<td valign="top">I believe that a vertical crop on this photo would have helped with the pronunciation of the subject a little more.  When I photograph children, I try to get down on their level and not photograph them at a downward angle :)</td>', 'I believe that a vertical crop on this photo would have helped with the pronunciation of the subject a little more.  When I photograph children, I try to get down on their level and not photograph them at a downward angle :)', '2002-05-28 05:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66541, 1944, 1005, '<td valign="top">Popular head cut off, please get all of the taller girl.  This might have been better suited to portrait 480x640, instead of landscapte 640x480.<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 6 People 9 total 7</td>', 'Popular head cut off, please get all of the taller girl.  This might have been better suited to portrait 480x640, instead of landscapte 640x480.Photo 8 Creativity 6 People 9 total 7', '2002-05-28 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66542, 1944, 1446, '<td valign="top">Cute kids.  The car in the upper right is distracting to me.  Cropping this very close to the subjects in a vertical would have made me like it a lot better.</td>', 'Cute kids.  The car in the upper right is distracting to me.  Cropping this very close to the subjects in a vertical would have made me like it a lot better.', '2002-05-28 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66543, 1944, 811, '<td valign="top">I think if you could have had the kids line up shortest to tallest, it would have really emphasized the converging lines of the grass and side walk.  Another suggestion would be to get down on their level.  Good shot.</td>', 'I think if you could have had the kids line up shortest to tallest, it would have really emphasized the converging lines of the grass and side walk.  Another suggestion would be to get down on their level.  Good shot.', '2002-05-28 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66544, 1944, 1560, '<td valign="top">The looks on their faces are priceless.</td>', 'The looks on their faces are priceless.', '2002-05-28 20:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66545, 1944, 301, '<td valign="top">I would have taken this in portrait.  The grass on the left and car on the right aren''t really required in the photo.  Try getting down lower for a different angle - it would also help in not cropping the girl at the back.</td>', 'I would have taken this in portrait.  The grass on the left and car on the right aren''t really required in the photo.  Try getting down lower for a different angle - it would also help in not cropping the girl at the back.', '2002-05-29 04:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66546, 1944, 885, '<td valign="top">I think a vertical cropping, excluding the car wheels and the grass, would have made a better composition</td>', 'I think a vertical cropping, excluding the car wheels and the grass, would have made a better composition', '2002-05-30 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66547, 1944, 1679, '<td valign="top">Nice. It would probably look better though in portrait orientation and with the other girl looking at you. It looks like you could ask here to look at you. Judging by the other two kids, they all wanted to have their photo taken, so it would be a good opportunity. In portrait orientation, you could have also got rid of the cars on the right and the ugly, untreated grass on the left.</td>', 'Nice. It would probably look better though in portrait orientation and with the other girl looking at you. It looks like you could ask here to look at you. Judging by the other two kids, they all wanted to have their photo taken, so it would be a good opportunity. In portrait orientation, you could have also got rid of the cars on the right and the ugly, untreated grass on the left.', '2002-05-30 20:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66548, 1944, 1750, '<td valign="top">I like how these kids are placed and where. Great skin tones on these adorable kids. It does look a little flat though.</td>', 'I like how these kids are placed and where. Great skin tones on these adorable kids. It does look a little flat though.', '2002-06-02 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66549, 1945, 449, '<td valign="top">would like to see this in b&amp;w instead. maybe a bit more light. great idea. Congrats!</td>', 'would like to see this in b&w instead. maybe a bit more light. great idea. Congrats!', '2002-05-27 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66550, 1945, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely shot.  I''d prefer a little less wall on the right though.</td>', 'Nicely shot.  I''d prefer a little less wall on the right though.', '2002-05-27 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66551, 1945, 327, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the baby! Nice shot and I like the tone.</td>', 'Congrats on the baby! Nice shot and I like the tone.', '2002-05-27 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66552, 1945, 1877, '<td valign="top">i like it, but it would have been better if the stretchy strap wasn''t there and it was in b&amp;w not sepia.. but good idea.</td>', 'i like it, but it would have been better if the stretchy strap wasn''t there and it was in b&w not sepia.. but good idea.', '2002-05-27 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66553, 1945, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  I don''t particularly like the color tone, but everything else is great :)  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice shot!  I don''t particularly like the color tone, but everything else is great :)  Good job!', '2002-05-28 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66554, 1945, 1446, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot.  I like the texture of the skin.  I think I might have perfered this shot in color.....Did I say that?  Still a very good shot.</td>', 'A very interesting shot.  I like the texture of the skin.  I think I might have perfered this shot in color.....Did I say that?  Still a very good shot.', '2002-05-28 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66555, 1945, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting color effect, is this straight from the camera or with some color changes in post-processing?  Just curious, b/c I know the Casio digital cameras have a lot of different color filters.  The colors fit this shot well.  Very nicely done</td>', 'Interesting color effect, is this straight from the camera or with some color changes in post-processing?  Just curious, b/c I know the Casio digital cameras have a lot of different color filters.  The colors fit this shot well.  Very nicely done', '2002-05-28 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66556, 1945, 280, '<td valign="top">Good use of sepia.</td>', 'Good use of sepia.', '2002-05-28 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
