(66558, 1945, 332, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.</td>', 'Nice framing.', '2002-05-28 20:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66559, 1945, 1759, '<td valign="top">I see this as a reasonably good shot, but somewhat sterile. More belly and/or clothing that acentuates the photo. Maybe a chain draped over the top?</td>', 'I see this as a reasonably good shot, but somewhat sterile. More belly and/or clothing that acentuates the photo. Maybe a chain draped over the top?', '2002-05-28 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66560, 1945, 205, '<td valign="top">only? damn gonna be big one</td>', 'only? damn gonna be big one', '2002-05-28 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66561, 1945, 1005, '<td valign="top">Technically, I see nothing wrong with this photo, but I do keep asking myself why sepia?  But what do I know.....  You cut off her thumb!  Nit time:  Not fond of body parts for people shots and yes, I know there''s a baby inside, but I don''t see him/her.   Probably a personal problem.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 7 People (sorry) 6 total 7</td>', 'Technically, I see nothing wrong with this photo, but I do keep asking myself why sepia?  But what do I know.....  You cut off her thumb!  Nit time:  Not fond of body parts for people shots and yes, I know there''s a baby inside, but I don''t see him/her.   Probably a personal problem.Photo 9 Creativity 7 People (sorry) 6 total 7', '2002-05-29 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66562, 1945, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I love the hand especially.</td>', 'Very nice... I love the hand especially.', '2002-05-29 04:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66563, 1945, 142, '<td valign="top">Very special photo.  I like the use of your coloring.  It adds to the mood of the photo.</td>', 'Very special photo.  I like the use of your coloring.  It adds to the mood of the photo.', '2002-05-29 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66564, 1945, 1066, '<td valign="top">The pregnant factor just added to a good capture.  I think I would have liked this photo whether it was a pregnant woman or a beer belly man.  It''s not perfect technically to MY eye but I am true to my word in that there is more to photography than just my technical perception....one of my four 10''s this week.</td>', 'The pregnant factor just added to a good capture.  I think I would have liked this photo whether it was a pregnant woman or a beer belly man.  It''s not perfect technically to MY eye but I am true to my word in that there is more to photography than just my technical perception....one of my four 10''s this week.', '2002-05-30 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66565, 1945, 1175, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for your interpretation of the subject.  This is a nice photo but I think there is too much light.  I don''t like the use of Sepia for this photo either.  Sepia to me is the connotation of old and worn and a picture of a 6-month preganancy should be neither.</td>', 'I don''t really care for your interpretation of the subject.  This is a nice photo but I think there is too much light.  I don''t like the use of Sepia for this photo either.  Sepia to me is the connotation of old and worn and a picture of a 6-month preganancy should be neither.', '2002-05-31 07:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66566, 1945, 1750, '<td valign="top">Congrats Mom! Good choice of tone.</td>', 'Congrats Mom! Good choice of tone.', '2002-06-02 03:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66567, 1945, 472, '<td valign="top">great closeup, framing. like the sepia.</td>', 'great closeup, framing. like the sepia.', '2002-06-02 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66568, 1946, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love the multitasking:  burger in one hand, car in the other.  Black and white suited this shot.</td>', 'I love the multitasking:  burger in one hand, car in the other.  Black and white suited this shot.', '2002-05-27 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66569, 1946, 661, '<td valign="top">I think if you''d cropped the top a little tighter you wouldn''t notice the trash can so much.  Nice black and white.</td>', 'I think if you''d cropped the top a little tighter you wouldn''t notice the trash can so much.  Nice black and white.', '2002-05-27 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
