(66602, 1947, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition on this shot, and the fact that it stands out from the rest of them.  This would be a good picture for a creative writing class to write a story about, I think.  It''s a little bright on the left side.</td>', 'I really like the composition on this shot, and the fact that it stands out from the rest of them.  This would be a good picture for a creative writing class to write a story about, I think.  It''s a little bright on the left side.', '2002-05-28 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66603, 1947, 806, '<td valign="top">What an imagination! Good for you.</td>', 'What an imagination! Good for you.', '2002-05-28 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66604, 1947, 689, '<td valign="top">Creative photo .... nice use of b&amp;w ... I know you cant do this for the challenge, but try leaving the eye in color ... would give an interesting look.</td>', 'Creative photo .... nice use of b&w ... I know you cant do this for the challenge, but try leaving the eye in color ... would give an interesting look.', '2002-05-28 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66605, 1947, 1005, '<td valign="top">VERY nice, there is alot of "interest" in this photo.  My only problem is, I have consistantly downgraded others for small parts of people shots (mostly lame efforts), but this is soo good!  You get an exception.<br/>Photo 10  Creativity 10 People 8 (minus only 2 for very partial person) total 9  (all the other partials got 5 or less)</td>', 'VERY nice, there is alot of "interest" in this photo.  My only problem is, I have consistantly downgraded others for small parts of people shots (mostly lame efforts), but this is soo good!  You get an exception.Photo 10  Creativity 10 People 8 (minus only 2 for very partial person) total 9  (all the other partials got 5 or less)', '2002-05-28 18:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66606, 1947, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very emotive. I like the way some of the cracks run parallel to the eyebrow.</td>', 'Very emotive. I like the way some of the cracks run parallel to the eyebrow.', '2002-05-29 03:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66607, 1947, 301, '<td valign="top">I think the positioning of the face here could have been done better.  Because the eye and eyebrow are the main point of interest in the photo, I would have preferred to have seen them without any cracks over them.  Would have cropped the edge of the window too.</td>', 'I think the positioning of the face here could have been done better.  Because the eye and eyebrow are the main point of interest in the photo, I would have preferred to have seen them without any cracks over them.  Would have cropped the edge of the window too.', '2002-05-29 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66608, 1947, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well shot.  My only thing is that I would''ve placed the eye on a more clear part of the broken glass.</td>', 'Nice idea, well shot.  My only thing is that I would''ve placed the eye on a more clear part of the broken glass.', '2002-05-29 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66609, 1947, 308, '<td valign="top">people in glass houses shouldn''t submit photos of whores.</td>', 'people in glass houses shouldn''t submit photos of whores.', '2002-05-29 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66610, 1947, 255, '<td valign="top">Wow! I do love artsy pictures! I''m guessing Kimbly or Lisae? I wouldn''t change a thing about this picture...10!</td>', 'Wow! I do love artsy pictures! I''m guessing Kimbly or Lisae? I wouldn''t change a thing about this picture...10!', '2002-05-29 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66611, 1947, 1009, '<td valign="top">Very artistic...</td>', 'Very artistic...', '2002-05-29 18:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66612, 1947, 1847, '<td valign="top">Very intriguing shot.  Perfect use for B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very intriguing shot.  Perfect use for B&W.', '2002-05-29 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66613, 1947, 1910, '<td valign="top">cool composition..</td>', 'cool composition..', '2002-05-30 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66614, 1947, 885, '<td valign="top">Really neat.  I love the detail in the eyelashes, and the black negative space, as well as the way that the cracks in the glass frame the eye.  Good job.</td>', 'Really neat.  I love the detail in the eyelashes, and the black negative space, as well as the way that the cracks in the glass frame the eye.  Good job.', '2002-05-30 07:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66615, 1947, 862, '<td valign="top">The skin tone seems a little off to me.</td>', 'The skin tone seems a little off to me.', '2002-05-30 08:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66616, 1947, 1066, '<td valign="top">Very nice....One of my top 10 photos this week and just missed getting a 10 if I could have seen a little more light/detail in the eye...When a photo is so good but leaves me just wanting a little more...I give you a 9....</td>', 'Very nice....One of my top 10 photos this week and just missed getting a 10 if I could have seen a little more light/detail in the eye...When a photo is so good but leaves me just wanting a little more...I give you a 9....', '2002-05-30 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66617, 1947, 1651, '<td valign="top">very cool.</td>', 'very cool.', '2002-05-30 22:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66618, 1947, 1078, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Only two "I wish" comments:  First is that the streak/scratch/crack that''s running through her eye wasn''t there.  Second, that we didn''t have the edge of the glass/plexiglass over on the right hand side -- I almost took it for another crack -- maybe even if it had a cracked edge, instead?</td>', 'Very nice.  Only two "I wish" comments:  First is that the streak/scratch/crack that''s running through her eye wasn''t there.  Second, that we didn''t have the edge of the glass/plexiglass over on the right hand side -- I almost took it for another crack -- maybe even if it had a cracked edge, instead?', '2002-05-31 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66619, 1947, 1175, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  I like the use of Black &amp; White. Interesting photo.</td>', 'Great composition.  I like the use of Black & White. Interesting photo.', '2002-05-31 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66620, 1947, 1202, '<td valign="top">The solomn expression and the broken glass go together to make ones imagination build a story.  GReat B/W shot.</td>', 'The solomn expression and the broken glass go together to make ones imagination build a story.  GReat B/W shot.', '2002-06-01 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66621, 1947, 205, '<td valign="top">This rocks</td>', 'This rocks', '2002-06-01 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66622, 1947, 312, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for the kind comments. I totally didn''t expect this shot to do so well when I submitted it, but I''m glad it did. My original concept for this shot was to take a framed piece of glass and shoot it with a bb gun to crack it up a bit and shoot a picture of a person through the broken glass, preferably outdoors. Unfortunately, I never got a chance to put things together for that so I modified it at the last minute late Sunday afternoon. I cracked a plastic CD jewel case with a hammer and took some shots through that. I started with the whole face, then a profile, and finally after about 3 or 4 different sessions of taking pictures and seeing what they looked like, I decided to focus in on the eye area. Since the lighting in my apartment is pretty dark, I used a Canon Speedlight 420ex external flash to light the shot. If I had more time and a more patient model, I would have fixed a few things, especially the lack of detail in the eye itself and the one crack/highlight that goes right through the eye. I did, however, make a concious decision to leave the border on the right side of the shot. I thought it framed it better and added some life to the black.<br/><br/>Anyway, thanks again for the comments.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for the kind comments. I totally didn''t expect this shot to do so well when I submitted it, but I''m glad it did. My original concept for this shot was to take a framed piece of glass and shoot it with a bb gun to crack it up a bit and shoot a picture of a person through the broken glass, preferably outdoors. Unfortunately, I never got a chance to put things together for that so I modified it at the last minute late Sunday afternoon. I cracked a plastic CD jewel case with a hammer and took some shots through that. I started with the whole face, then a profile, and finally after about 3 or 4 different sessions of taking pictures and seeing what they looked like, I decided to focus in on the eye area. Since the lighting in my apartment is pretty dark, I used a Canon Speedlight 420ex external flash to light the shot. If I had more time and a more patient model, I would have fixed a few things, especially the lack of detail in the eye itself and the one crack/highlight that goes right through the eye. I did, however, make a concious decision to leave the border on the right side of the shot. I thought it framed it better and added some life to the black.Anyway, thanks again for the comments.', '2002-06-03 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66623, 1947, 1859, '<td valign="top">I''m glad this shot placed 4th, but I really feel that it should have placed higher.  For me, it ranked right up there with the shot of the kid with the umbrella.  You definitely deserved a ribbon.  Nice job!</td>', 'I''m glad this shot placed 4th, but I really feel that it should have placed higher.  For me, it ranked right up there with the shot of the kid with the umbrella.  You definitely deserved a ribbon.  Nice job!', '2002-06-03 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66624, 1947, 1066, '<td valign="top">Great photo:-)  You did with your eye photo what I could not with mine.  Capture their imagination.  You did a better job of getting the clarity right on the eye as well.  Thanks for the tip of breaking a CD case for the glass effect.  It works and I will definitely be stealing that idea :-)<br/>Great photo again :-)<br/></td>', 'Great photo:-)  You did with your eye photo what I could not with mine.  Capture their imagination.  You did a better job of getting the clarity right on the eye as well.  Thanks for the tip of breaking a CD case for the glass effect.  It works and I will definitely be stealing that idea :-)Great photo again :-)', '2002-06-04 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66625, 1948, 509, '<td valign="top">Awesome silhouette shot!  I love the brightness of the colors</td>', 'Awesome silhouette shot!  I love the brightness of the colors', '2002-05-27 01:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66626, 1948, 1831, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite. Love the colours.</td>', 'This is my favourite. Love the colours.', '2002-05-27 02:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66627, 1948, 1357, '<td valign="top">Love this photo. The colours are fantastic.</td>', 'Love this photo. The colours are fantastic.', '2002-05-27 03:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66628, 1948, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love it! The silhouette is like a little doll, she almost doesn''t seem real, and the garish colours of the fountain set that off in a nice, surreal way. Great job.</td>', 'I love it! The silhouette is like a little doll, she almost doesn''t seem real, and the garish colours of the fountain set that off in a nice, surreal way. Great job.', '2002-05-27 03:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66629, 1948, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great, great shot.  Would be perfect if the contrast was a bit more so that I couldn''t make out details on the face, but only the silhouette.  Fantastic colors.</td>', 'Great, great shot.  Would be perfect if the contrast was a bit more so that I couldn''t make out details on the face, but only the silhouette.  Fantastic colors.', '2002-05-27 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66630, 1948, 1569, '<td valign="top">Nice--and no hot pixels.Good camera.</td>', 'Nice--and no hot pixels.Good camera.', '2002-05-27 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66631, 1948, 472, '<td valign="top">incredible!  a top pic.</td>', 'incredible!  a top pic.', '2002-05-27 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66632, 1948, 327, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great colors. Nice job.</td>', 'Great idea, great colors. Nice job.', '2002-05-27 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66633, 1948, 1061, '<td valign="top">Best of contest, IMO.  I give it a 10!</td>', 'Best of contest, IMO.  I give it a 10!', '2002-05-27 21:30:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(66634, 1948, 1820, '<td valign="top">Very creative and beautiful!</td>', 'Very creative and beautiful!', '2002-05-27 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66635, 1948, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good color appeal, but the challenge was people.  Your person is could have been substitued with a cardboard cutout.  Great effect, but not for this challenge.  Also, note the extranious lights in the background, the street light top center and the bar lights dead center distract from the shot.  Move both you and subject to the right to avoid these lights.<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 5 total 6 (weighted most heavily on the people challenge, sorry for the low grade)</td>', 'Good color appeal, but the challenge was people.  Your person is could have been substitued with a cardboard cutout.  Great effect, but not for this challenge.  Also, note the extranious lights in the background, the street light top center and the bar lights dead center distract from the shot.  Move both you and subject to the right to avoid these lights.Photo 9 Creativity 8 People 5 total 6 (weighted most heavily on the people challenge, sorry for the low grade)', '2002-05-28 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66636, 1948, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo... I love this silhouette against the colorful and soft water fountain in the background.  The only improvement I could suggest here is to have framed it with less black space at the bottom of the frame.  This possibly could have helped you capture the top of the fountains as well... Nice work !! = 9</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo... I love this silhouette against the colorful and soft water fountain in the background.  The only improvement I could suggest here is to have framed it with less black space at the bottom of the frame.  This possibly could have helped you capture the top of the fountains as well... Nice work !! = 9', '2002-05-28 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66637, 1948, 1041, '<td valign="top">Now there''s an interesting take on the people challenge.  I actually thought I wouldn''t like something like this because it''s really not the person you see, but I do like it!  The picture doesn''t seem to be quite level, and the one fountain that seems to be coming straight out the girl''s head (or going into it), was there a way of placing her so that it didn''t look like that?  Good shot anyway.</td>', 'Now there''s an interesting take on the people challenge.  I actually thought I wouldn''t like something like this because it''s really not the person you see, but I do like it!  The picture doesn''t seem to be quite level, and the one fountain that seems to be coming straight out the girl''s head (or going into it), was there a way of placing her so that it didn''t look like that?  Good shot anyway.', '2002-05-28 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66638, 1948, 773, '<td valign="top">Love the silhouette against the brilliant color!</td>', 'Love the silhouette against the brilliant color!', '2002-05-28 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66639, 1948, 2, '<td valign="top">This picture is really outstanding -- I only wish it weren''t so off-balance.  It''s leannnning to the left :)</td>', 'This picture is really outstanding -- I only wish it weren''t so off-balance.  It''s leannnning to the left :)', '2002-05-28 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66640, 1948, 737, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo, but I lose a little on the "people". Still, I rate it well above average.</td>', 'Very nice photo, but I lose a little on the "people". Still, I rate it well above average.', '2002-05-28 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66641, 1948, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very colorful. Good capture of the fountain. I''m not sure how one would get more form from the silhouette, but that is what I would work towards.</td>', 'Very colorful. Good capture of the fountain. I''m not sure how one would get more form from the silhouette, but that is what I would work towards.', '2002-05-28 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66642, 1948, 255, '<td valign="top">the concept of this is cool--i however might have switched angles on this and put her into a corner to keep it from looking so centered.</td>', 'the concept of this is cool--i however might have switched angles on this and put her into a corner to keep it from looking so centered.', '2002-05-29 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66643, 1948, 1024, '<td valign="top">My favorite silloutte photo of the week.  Great job!</td>', 'My favorite silloutte photo of the week.  Great job!', '2002-05-29 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66644, 1948, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great color, Nice feeling of movement.  the ROT might suggest that you move your subect out of the center of the frame.</td>', 'Great color, Nice feeling of movement.  the ROT might suggest that you move your subect out of the center of the frame.', '2002-05-29 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66645, 1948, 1009, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture... frame it.</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture... frame it.', '2002-05-29 18:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66646, 1948, 312, '<td valign="top">great silhouette and great colors. i like the real dark blacks here. my only suggestion would be to try this with the subject off to one side instead of centered, and maybe zoom out a tad to increase the off-center effect. i think it would add a lot to this shot. good job.</td>', 'great silhouette and great colors. i like the real dark blacks here. my only suggestion would be to try this with the subject off to one side instead of centered, and maybe zoom out a tad to increase the off-center effect. i think it would add a lot to this shot. good job.', '2002-05-30 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66647, 1948, 573, '<td valign="top">Nice use of backlighting to create a striking composition.</td>', 'Nice use of backlighting to create a striking composition.', '2002-05-30 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66648, 1948, 878, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I would of tried to get the head in more fo the middle of the fountain but then the shot would be slightly off.  Nice job.</td>', 'Cool shot, I would of tried to get the head in more fo the middle of the fountain but then the shot would be slightly off.  Nice job.', '2002-05-30 16:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66649, 1948, 1679, '<td valign="top">Vrey nice and well thought, although the horizon is not level. But still bery good as it is. Nice pose, too.</td>', 'Vrey nice and well thought, although the horizon is not level. But still bery good as it is. Nice pose, too.', '2002-05-30 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66650, 1948, 543, '<td valign="top">The girl is placed just right.  Getting the rim of light around the back of her head was key, and you pulled it off.  Great colors and exposure.  Shame about the streetlight, but what can you do?  High marks.</td>', 'The girl is placed just right.  Getting the rim of light around the back of her head was key, and you pulled it off.  Great colors and exposure.  Shame about the streetlight, but what can you do?  High marks.', '2002-05-31 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66651, 1948, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the silhouette against the predominately pink background</td>', 'I really like the silhouette against the predominately pink background', '2002-05-31 15:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66652, 1948, 1031, '<td valign="top">I wish they''d used different colors, but I like the overall composition.effect.<br/>I can just see a HINT of detail in the head/face. If you wanted it there (and I like the effect) it could be a teeny bit lighter (at least per my monitor). If you wanted a complete silhouette, it needs to be a touch darker.</td>', 'I wish they''d used different colors, but I like the overall composition.effect.I can just see a HINT of detail in the head/face. If you wanted it there (and I like the effect) it could be a teeny bit lighter (at least per my monitor). If you wanted a complete silhouette, it needs to be a touch darker.', '2002-06-01 20:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66653, 1948, 142, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative interpretation.</td>', 'Very imaginative interpretation.', '2002-06-01 22:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66654, 1948, 1750, '<td valign="top">Like this one best out of the previous 55. The silhouette backed up by color adds drama.</td>', 'Like this one best out of the previous 55. The silhouette backed up by color adds drama.', '2002-06-02 03:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66655, 1949, 47, '<td valign="top">a hat and sunglasses.. hm.</td>', 'a hat and sunglasses.. hm.', '2002-05-27 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66656, 1949, 1528, '<td valign="top">little blurry<br/>busy background, would''ve helped if it was thrown a tad out-of-focus</td>', 'little blurrybusy background, would''ve helped if it was thrown a tad out-of-focus', '2002-05-27 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66657, 1949, 327, '<td valign="top">Good catch, colorful and nice skin tones. Well done. Little OOF.</td>', 'Good catch, colorful and nice skin tones. Well done. Little OOF.', '2002-05-27 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66658, 1949, 1061, '<td valign="top">Like a test pattern for your color saturation settings</td>', 'Like a test pattern for your color saturation settings', '2002-05-27 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66659, 1949, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the colors on these hats and they way the shadows hide their eyes.. good shot!</td>', 'I love the colors on these hats and they way the shadows hide their eyes.. good shot!', '2002-05-27 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66660, 1949, 1750, '<td valign="top">Not seeing the eyes actually helps make this photo. The colors are great. Good Separation from background and composition.</td>', 'Not seeing the eyes actually helps make this photo. The colors are great. Good Separation from background and composition.', '2002-05-28 02:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66661, 1949, 1041, '<td valign="top">Oh, man, what a great idea!  A couple of things to try differently though:  get lower and use backfill flash so you can see the eyes - the eyes are the most important thing to have visible and in focus in both human and animal shots - they make you connect with the subject of the photo.  The background is good, expcept for the bright yellow rope on the right.</td>', 'Oh, man, what a great idea!  A couple of things to try differently though:  get lower and use backfill flash so you can see the eyes - the eyes are the most important thing to have visible and in focus in both human and animal shots - they make you connect with the subject of the photo.  The background is good, expcept for the bright yellow rope on the right.', '2002-05-28 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66662, 1949, 1844, '<td valign="top">LIke the colours, composition is great. Too bad can''t see the eyes. That spoils it for me.</td>', 'LIke the colours, composition is great. Too bad can''t see the eyes. That spoils it for me.', '2002-05-28 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66663, 1949, 1520, '<td valign="top">Would''ve been nice to see a little more of the girl''s eyes/expression.  Might''ve tried a fill flash.  I like the way the various colours of the hats and shirts frame the faces.<br/></td>', 'Would''ve been nice to see a little more of the girl''s eyes/expression.  Might''ve tried a fill flash.  I like the way the various colours of the hats and shirts frame the faces.', '2002-05-28 11:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66664, 1949, 1759, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The softness gives almost a surreal look. I''m wondering if a little fill flash might have shown us the little girls eyes while still leaving a noteable shadow.</td>', 'Nice composition. The softness gives almost a surreal look. I''m wondering if a little fill flash might have shown us the little girls eyes while still leaving a noteable shadow.', '2002-05-28 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66665, 1949, 2, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject of this photo, but the image itself seems a little off -- even a little grainy.  I''m not sure if this is just the camera or your settings you were using.</td>', 'I really like the subject of this photo, but the image itself seems a little off -- even a little grainy.  I''m not sure if this is just the camera or your settings you were using.', '2002-05-28 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66666, 1949, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Color appears close to right, but why do I keep thinking over the top?  Did you turn the color up?  Try down a half step.  Look at the orange lip on mom''s hat, do you see a bright orange line at the shade line?  Little girl''s shirt almost washed out, it''s tan, right?<br/>Photo 8 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8</td>', 'Cute idea.  Color appears close to right, but why do I keep thinking over the top?  Did you turn the color up?  Try down a half step.  Look at the orange lip on mom''s hat, do you see a bright orange line at the shade line?  Little girl''s shirt almost washed out, it''s tan, right?Photo 8 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8', '2002-05-29 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66667, 1949, 1379, '<td valign="top">The apple does not fall far from the tree, they say...  I like how the child is checking you out from beneath the brim.  Very cute.</td>', 'The apple does not fall far from the tree, they say...  I like how the child is checking you out from beneath the brim.  Very cute.', '2002-05-29 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66668, 1949, 1679, '<td valign="top">If it only weren''t for those harsh shadows under the rim of the hats! A fill-in would probably make the job.</td>', 'If it only weren''t for those harsh shadows under the rim of the hats! A fill-in would probably make the job.', '2002-05-29 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66669, 1949, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice colors -- I have a shirt that would match perfectly. :-)  The little girl''s expression and how she is looking at the camera is precious.</td>', 'Nice colors -- I have a shirt that would match perfectly. :-)  The little girl''s expression and how she is looking at the camera is precious.', '2002-05-30 21:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66670, 1949, 689, '<td valign="top">The hats and sun worked to your disadvantage on this .... they made the faces mostly dark ... that makes a nice photo, with a lot of color only OK ... try getting them in the shade or with some more direct lighting or a fill flash.</td>', 'The hats and sun worked to your disadvantage on this .... they made the faces mostly dark ... that makes a nice photo, with a lot of color only OK ... try getting them in the shade or with some more direct lighting or a fill flash.', '2002-05-31 00:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66671, 1949, 1, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a bit saturated from all the light, I''d suggest a faster shutter speed or a smaller aperture.</td>', 'Colors seem a bit saturated from all the light, I''d suggest a faster shutter speed or a smaller aperture.', '2002-05-31 09:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66672, 1949, 1175, '<td valign="top">Looks like an average snapshot I''d find in someone''s photo albumn.  I would have prefered to see some interaction between mother and daughter, some emotion or facial expression.  Sun is also too bright and the shadow across the eyes by the hats kills the picture.</td>', 'Looks like an average snapshot I''d find in someone''s photo albumn.  I would have prefered to see some interaction between mother and daughter, some emotion or facial expression.  Sun is also too bright and the shadow across the eyes by the hats kills the picture.', '2002-05-31 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66673, 1949, 142, '<td valign="top">This is so cute!</td>', 'This is so cute!', '2002-06-01 23:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66674, 1949, 1031, '<td valign="top">With a less busy backdrop (like a catalog shot) I think they''d have a great look of serious sophistication -- which I love juxtaposed with the tie-dyed hats.<br/>I hope they weren''t just upset with you for taking the photo...</td>', 'With a less busy backdrop (like a catalog shot) I think they''d have a great look of serious sophistication -- which I love juxtaposed with the tie-dyed hats.I hope they weren''t just upset with you for taking the photo...', '2002-06-01 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66675, 1949, 1908, '<td valign="top">Nice and the colours are great. Tis a pity that they are slighty out of focus. The objects in the backgroung are infocus</td>', 'Nice and the colours are great. Tis a pity that they are slighty out of focus. The objects in the backgroung are infocus', '2002-06-02 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
