(66685, 1950, 1005, '<td valign="top">Where''s the rest of the face.   It''s interesting, and there''s nothing really wrong with this photo, per say, but I want to see more of the "people" or person in this case.  I don''t require the whole person, but I would have liked more...........................................<br/>Photo 9 Creativity 9 People .5 (partial point for partial person) total 5  (takes your chances......)</td>', 'Where''s the rest of the face.   It''s interesting, and there''s nothing really wrong with this photo, per say, but I want to see more of the "people" or person in this case.  I don''t require the whole person, but I would have liked more...........................................Photo 9 Creativity 9 People .5 (partial point for partial person) total 5  (takes your chances......)', '2002-05-28 15:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
