(66696, 1950, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, I''m wondering if you had to crop or you''re just that good with the framing even when you''re not looking.</td>', 'Nice framing, I''m wondering if you had to crop or you''re just that good with the framing even when you''re not looking.', '2002-06-02 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66697, 1950, 1956, '<td valign="top">i rated this an 8.  people are lame. : P</td>', 'i rated this an 8.  people are lame. : P', '2002-06-03 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66698, 1950, 139, '<td valign="top">Re: Wanting to see more of the face<br/><br/>That was part of my goal.  I wanted the viewers to wonder "what''s he thinking about, and who is he?".<br/><br/>Re: Cropped, or just that good at framing<br/><br/>Just that good.  (It''s just math, you know).<br/><br/>Re: Not cropping the glasses<br/><br/>Well, it wasn''t cropping.  If you mean you wanted more of the glasses on the right, well, I could have done that, but it wasn''t in the picture to begin with and it didn''t distract me enough to fix it.  If you meant you wanted to see the bottoms of the glasses, then you would also have had to be looking up my nostrils.</td>', 'Re: Wanting to see more of the faceThat was part of my goal.  I wanted the viewers to wonder "what''s he thinking about, and who is he?".Re: Cropped, or just that good at framingJust that good.  (It''s just math, you know).Re: Not cropping the glassesWell, it wasn''t cropping.  If you mean you wanted more of the glasses on the right, well, I could have done that, but it wasn''t in the picture to begin with and it didn''t distract me enough to fix it.  If you meant you wanted to see the bottoms of the glasses, then you would also have had to be looking up my nostrils.', '2002-06-03 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66699, 1950, 139, '<td valign="top">I hadn''t even thought about Kilroy.  :)</td>', 'I hadn''t even thought about Kilroy.  :)', '2002-06-04 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66700, 1952, 1867, '<td valign="top">i expect u should be able to get great images of the child alone.  he looks fantastic!</td>', 'i expect u should be able to get great images of the child alone.  he looks fantastic!', '2002-05-27 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66701, 1952, 1379, '<td valign="top">They are both beautiful subjects. It seems kind of strained, though, because mom has to support the weight of child, and he''s hanging onto her, too.  I think maybe sitting would have been more relaxed and a bit more tender.  It just seems like the child is beginning to feel heavy.</td>', 'They are both beautiful subjects. It seems kind of strained, though, because mom has to support the weight of child, and he''s hanging onto her, too.  I think maybe sitting would have been more relaxed and a bit more tender.  It just seems like the child is beginning to feel heavy.', '2002-05-27 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66702, 1952, 1073, '<td valign="top">A very nice picture good DOF I like it.</td>', 'A very nice picture good DOF I like it.', '2002-05-27 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66703, 1952, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice b&amp;w and good portrait. Handsome/pretty _people_. Job well done.</td>', 'Nice b&w and good portrait. Handsome/pretty _people_. Job well done.', '2002-05-27 18:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66704, 1952, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very good shot.  Good choice of b&amp;w as well.  The boy''s shirt looks as if it is quite colorful and I think that would''ve been distracting.</td>', 'Very good shot.  Good choice of b&w as well.  The boy''s shirt looks as if it is quite colorful and I think that would''ve been distracting.', '2002-05-28 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66705, 1952, 656, '<td valign="top">interesting portrait attempt, but she doesn''t look very comfortable/ happy.  Maybe would have worked better if they were looking at each other/ interacting more, rather than looking straight into the camera ?</td>', 'interesting portrait attempt, but she doesn''t look very comfortable/ happy.  Maybe would have worked better if they were looking at each other/ interacting more, rather than looking straight into the camera ?', '2002-05-28 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66706, 1952, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait!  The composition is excellent and the lighting is nice and even trhoughout the photo.  I think the only element of this shot that could be better, in my opinion, is the depth of field.  I prefer a more shallow depth of field in a shot like this to further blur out the background.  When I make photos like this, I usually back away from the subject and use my zoom to help enhance this effect... nice job! = 9</td>', 'Very nice portrait!  The composition is excellent and the lighting is nice and even trhoughout the photo.  I think the only element of this shot that could be better, in my opinion, is the depth of field.  I prefer a more shallow depth of field in a shot like this to further blur out the background.  When I make photos like this, I usually back away from the subject and use my zoom to help enhance this effect... nice job! = 9', '2002-05-28 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66707, 1952, 1446, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus.  Is that a "blue Steel" look?</td>', 'Excellent focus.  Is that a "blue Steel" look?', '2002-05-28 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66708, 1952, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot...and subjects.</td>', 'beautiful shot...and subjects.', '2002-05-28 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66709, 1952, 737, '<td valign="top">Good shot, though I would have prefered color myself for this one (unless the shirt really dominated). Well above agerage.</td>', 'Good shot, though I would have prefered color myself for this one (unless the shirt really dominated). Well above agerage.', '2002-05-28 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66710, 1952, 332, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot. Good job.</td>', 'Nice clean shot. Good job.', '2002-05-28 20:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66711, 1952, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice looking pair,  I really like the "thoughtful" look on the boy''s face.  If the colors of the shirts matched, this would be a nice shot in color, too, I think.</td>', 'Nice looking pair,  I really like the "thoughtful" look on the boy''s face.  If the colors of the shirts matched, this would be a nice shot in color, too, I think.', '2002-05-29 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66712, 1952, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo, sharp focus, but skin tone needs a little more contrast.  Was this horrible in color?  Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8 <br/>(I was very tempted to score down for lack of color, but didn''t)</td>', 'Good photo, sharp focus, but skin tone needs a little more contrast.  Was this horrible in color?  Photo 9 Creativity 7 People 9 total 8 (I was very tempted to score down for lack of color, but didn''t)', '2002-05-29 15:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66713, 1952, 301, '<td valign="top">lovely portrait.  Very well composed.  The only thing is that mum and her son seem just slightly tense</td>', 'lovely portrait.  Very well composed.  The only thing is that mum and her son seem just slightly tense', '2002-05-29 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66714, 1952, 885, '<td valign="top">Well controlled, attractive black and white.  I might have cropped tighter though, I think the most interesting part is his hands around her nack.</td>', 'Well controlled, attractive black and white.  I might have cropped tighter though, I think the most interesting part is his hands around her nack.', '2002-05-29 15:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
