(66716, 1952, 573, '<td valign="top">I like this snapshot, technical is really well done, good contrast and brightness, focus is right on, but it is still a snapshot.</td>', 'I like this snapshot, technical is really well done, good contrast and brightness, focus is right on, but it is still a snapshot.', '2002-05-30 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66717, 1952, 142, '<td valign="top">Great photo!</td>', 'Great photo!', '2002-06-01 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66718, 1952, 671, '<td valign="top">A lovely picture.  The boy and mother have the same eyes.  I notice some comments about the fact that the boy seems heavy, mother seems tense.  I liked that effect.  The rather wary look in both of their eyes, combined with how they are holding each other gives a powerful emotional undercurrent to what would otherwise be just another family picture.</td>', 'A lovely picture.  The boy and mother have the same eyes.  I notice some comments about the fact that the boy seems heavy, mother seems tense.  I liked that effect.  The rather wary look in both of their eyes, combined with how they are holding each other gives a powerful emotional undercurrent to what would otherwise be just another family picture.', '2002-06-08 21:44:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66719, 1953, 1360, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2002-05-27 02:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
