(66728, 1953, 1061, '<td valign="top">Would have been perfect IMO with just the shadow, moved back a little to be better aimed at the the cue ball, which is moved nearer the corner, and not have the actual person in the picture at all.. and I think this would be within the parameters of the challenge.  Try this one again, I think you''re on to something</td>', 'Would have been perfect IMO with just the shadow, moved back a little to be better aimed at the the cue ball, which is moved nearer the corner, and not have the actual person in the picture at all.. and I think this would be within the parameters of the challenge.  Try this one again, I think you''re on to something', '2002-05-27 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
