(66751, 1954, 449, '<td valign="top">these  days, that phrase has two meanings in an airport. what a sad world this has become.</td>', 'these  days, that phrase has two meanings in an airport. what a sad world this has become.', '2002-05-27 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66752, 1954, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective, clean, clear shot. I like it.</td>', 'Cool perspective, clean, clear shot. I like it.', '2002-05-27 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66753, 1954, 554, '<td valign="top">you have poor taste, at the least.</td>', 'you have poor taste, at the least.', '2002-05-27 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66754, 1954, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love airports....  You caught some AWESOME rhythm in this photo.  Those black airport chairs, dotted with travel-heads, are intense!  The reflections on the floor make it al click together.  Very nice, and a rather surreal glimpse of the world we take for granted...</td>', 'I love airports....  You caught some AWESOME rhythm in this photo.  Those black airport chairs, dotted with travel-heads, are intense!  The reflections on the floor make it al click together.  Very nice, and a rather surreal glimpse of the world we take for granted...', '2002-05-28 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66755, 1954, 205, '<td valign="top">did you mean that time to kill or time TO kill?</td>', 'did you mean that time to kill or time TO kill?', '2002-05-28 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66756, 1954, 1005, '<td valign="top">I don''t buy this as people, the main focus of this shot (IMO) is a relatively empty airport.  Basically, an O.K. pic, but nothing grabs me.  At least ask the man to help you, and sit him facing you, or find a large group of milling, waiting people.<br/>Photo 9 (nothing really all that wrong technically)  Creativity 3 People 4 total 5</td>', 'I don''t buy this as people, the main focus of this shot (IMO) is a relatively empty airport.  Basically, an O.K. pic, but nothing grabs me.  At least ask the man to help you, and sit him facing you, or find a large group of milling, waiting people.Photo 9 (nothing really all that wrong technically)  Creativity 3 People 4 total 5', '2002-05-29 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66757, 1954, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice patterns.  I think it could work in B&amp;W too.</td>', 'Nice patterns.  I think it could work in B&W too.', '2002-05-30 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66758, 1954, 1175, '<td valign="top">To broad of a shot.  Your subject should be people and your subject fill the frame or the area around your subject should some how contribute to your subject.  That is not happening here.</td>', 'To broad of a shot.  Your subject should be people and your subject fill the frame or the area around your subject should some how contribute to your subject.  That is not happening here.', '2002-05-31 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
