(66762, 1954, 1377, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments.  For those of you who understood my title in the literal sense, let me say I was only using it as an expression. I had 2 hours between flights. I think my title cost me some votes.</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments.  For those of you who understood my title in the literal sense, let me say I was only using it as an expression. I had 2 hours between flights. I think my title cost me some votes.', '2002-06-04 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66763, 1955, 1750, '<td valign="top">Pretty subject, like the warm tone.  What''s she wearing on her head?</td>', 'Pretty subject, like the warm tone.  What''s she wearing on her head?', '2002-05-27 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66764, 1955, 1211, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Really like her pose.  The light behind her head is distracting.  I''m not sure if sepia works for this shot.</td>', 'Good shot.  Really like her pose.  The light behind her head is distracting.  I''m not sure if sepia works for this shot.', '2002-05-27 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66765, 1955, 1519, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photograph!</td>', 'This is a beautiful photograph!', '2002-05-27 08:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66766, 1955, 1808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of beautiful woman.</td>', 'Beautiful picture of beautiful woman.', '2002-05-27 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66767, 1955, 668, '<td valign="top">please</td>', 'please', '2002-05-27 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66768, 1955, 472, '<td valign="top">she''s lovely. i would have cropped it a little lower so that the black thing isnt at the top of the frame.  how was this as a color?</td>', 'she''s lovely. i would have cropped it a little lower so that the black thing isnt at the top of the frame.  how was this as a color?', '2002-05-27 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66769, 1955, 327, '<td valign="top">I love the grace, and the beauty of this shot. Very nice feeling here, and the tones are soooo nice. Lovely shot.</td>', 'I love the grace, and the beauty of this shot. Very nice feeling here, and the tones are soooo nice. Lovely shot.', '2002-05-27 17:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66770, 1955, 1061, '<td valign="top">Nice, but why not in color?</td>', 'Nice, but why not in color?', '2002-05-27 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66771, 1955, 656, '<td valign="top">shame about the light growing out of her head!  Need to pay a bit more attention to what''s in the whole frame when taking people pictures</td>', 'shame about the light growing out of her head!  Need to pay a bit more attention to what''s in the whole frame when taking people pictures', '2002-05-28 09:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66772, 1955, 1037, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. Her skin glows like porcelain, but her hands and face are full of life and expression. The dress and surroundings are beautifully exotic.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. Her skin glows like porcelain, but her hands and face are full of life and expression. The dress and surroundings are beautifully exotic.', '2002-05-28 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66773, 1955, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like the contrast between her skin and the background of this image... I would love to see this one in color...</td>', 'Very nice!  I like the contrast between her skin and the background of this image... I would love to see this one in color...', '2002-05-28 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66774, 1955, 156, '<td valign="top">would rather see the subject herself filling the frame</td>', 'would rather see the subject herself filling the frame', '2002-05-28 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66775, 1955, 773, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and lovely subject.</td>', 'Lovely shot and lovely subject.', '2002-05-28 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66776, 1955, 737, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred color for this shot. Well composed, though.</td>', 'I would have preferred color for this shot. Well composed, though.', '2002-05-28 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66777, 1955, 1379, '<td valign="top">Beauty.....  She could be a 1920''s movie star...    Awesome composition.</td>', 'Beauty.....  She could be a 1920''s movie star...    Awesome composition.', '2002-05-28 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66778, 1955, 1759, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I would like to see this in color.</td>', 'Very nice! I would like to see this in color.', '2002-05-28 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66779, 1955, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good photo, great focus, etc.  maybe it''s your software, but the contrast seems a bit low.  Arm skin appears almost washed out, more like shades of grey, rather than black and white.<br/>Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 8 total 7</td>', 'Good photo, great focus, etc.  maybe it''s your software, but the contrast seems a bit low.  Arm skin appears almost washed out, more like shades of grey, rather than black and white.Photo 7 Creativity 7 People 8 total 7', '2002-05-29 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66780, 1955, 301, '<td valign="top">brilliant.  Would have been nice to see the colour in this photo, but the duotone give it a feeling of authenticity.  Great choice of pose and background.</td>', 'brilliant.  Would have been nice to see the colour in this photo, but the duotone give it a feeling of authenticity.  Great choice of pose and background.', '2002-05-29 07:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66781, 1955, 1009, '<td valign="top">Excellent...</td>', 'Excellent...', '2002-05-29 18:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66782, 1955, 1585, '<td valign="top">I''m speachless. Very nice.</td>', 'I''m speachless. Very nice.', '2002-05-29 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66783, 1955, 616, '<td valign="top">I love that pose.</td>', 'I love that pose.', '2002-05-29 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66784, 1955, 674, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured detail in this shot the arms look a little overexposed though</td>', 'Nicely captured detail in this shot the arms look a little overexposed though', '2002-05-30 00:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66785, 1955, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice, but very posed looking.  And I''m not so sure about the sepia, either.</td>', 'Nice, but very posed looking.  And I''m not so sure about the sepia, either.', '2002-05-30 08:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66786, 1955, 689, '<td valign="top">Watch the background ... the branches of the tree look like they are coming out of her neck and head ... her hands and arms look a little too posed ... go for a more natural look.</td>', 'Watch the background ... the branches of the tree look like they are coming out of her neck and head ... her hands and arms look a little too posed ... go for a more natural look.', '2002-05-31 00:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66787, 1955, 1175, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  I like the use of Sepia.  Very pretty model.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  I like the use of Sepia.  Very pretty model.', '2002-05-31 07:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66788, 1955, 142, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  The use of sepia looks good..</td>', 'Very nice photo.  The use of sepia looks good..', '2002-06-01 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66789, 1955, 878, '<td valign="top">Good shot, I am sure that the color of that dress is fantastic, not sure why you did away with the color.</td>', 'Good shot, I am sure that the color of that dress is fantastic, not sure why you did away with the color.', '2002-06-02 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66790, 1955, 2, '<td valign="top">Why''d you chose sepia for this shot?  I''d have to assume because the other objects in the image were distracting, but I''d really like to see the bold colors of her dress (if they were bold! :)</td>', 'Why''d you chose sepia for this shot?  I''d have to assume because the other objects in the image were distracting, but I''d really like to see the bold colors of her dress (if they were bold! :)', '2002-06-02 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66791, 1955, 1, '<td valign="top">She looks a bit cross-eyed, I would''ve chosen a different angle so it wouldn''t look like this.  The inclusion of the wood engraving and japanese style light is very nice.</td>', 'She looks a bit cross-eyed, I would''ve chosen a different angle so it wouldn''t look like this.  The inclusion of the wood engraving and japanese style light is very nice.', '2002-06-02 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66792, 1955, 543, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments.  This was taken while Ms. Miao was posing for a professional photographer for her wedding album.  The Chinese make the album in the studio and various locations with lots of costume changes well in advance of the actual wedding, which isn''t usually photographed.  So the pose wasn''t mine, and I couldn''t really pick my perspective, either, as I had to shoot around the guy with the Hassy and three assistants.  I thought the sepia was kind of a no-brainer - period costume, period location, etc.  First submission (I think) with no 1s.  Somebody asleep?  {g}</td>', 'Thanks for the comments.  This was taken while Ms. Miao was posing for a professional photographer for her wedding album.  The Chinese make the album in the studio and various locations with lots of costume changes well in advance of the actual wedding, which isn''t usually photographed.  So the pose wasn''t mine, and I couldn''t really pick my perspective, either, as I had to shoot around the guy with the Hassy and three assistants.  I thought the sepia was kind of a no-brainer - period costume, period location, etc.  First submission (I think) with no 1s.  Somebody asleep?  {g}', '2002-06-03 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(66793, 1956, 772, '<td valign="top">Is that whiskey? lol... interesting photo...</td>', 'Is that whiskey? lol... interesting photo...', '2002-05-27 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66794, 1956, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, although, for some reason, I''m not getting the title ... it''s early, so it could be just me!</td>', 'Nice photo, although, for some reason, I''m not getting the title ... it''s early, so it could be just me!', '2002-05-27 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66795, 1956, 806, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but I don''t understand the title.....</td>', 'I like the photo, but I don''t understand the title.....', '2002-05-27 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
