(66798, 1956, 661, '<td valign="top">Caught in the act (I''m not sure what act...)</td>', 'Caught in the act (I''m not sure what act...)', '2002-05-27 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66799, 1956, 1569, '<td valign="top">Very confising.</td>', 'Very confising.', '2002-05-27 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66800, 1956, 327, '<td valign="top">This shot looks like it is from the 50''s.  I love the tones, light. Nice work.</td>', 'This shot looks like it is from the 50''s.  I love the tones, light. Nice work.', '2002-05-27 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66801, 1956, 741, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and detail but I think onbe of the few cases of too much eye contact.  Having him more absorbed in the boat would have made a more interesting picture.</td>', 'Lovely tones and detail but I think onbe of the few cases of too much eye contact.  Having him more absorbed in the boat would have made a more interesting picture.', '2002-05-28 00:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66802, 1956, 1680, '<td valign="top">i dont get the title</td>', 'i dont get the title', '2002-05-28 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66803, 1956, 811, '<td valign="top">This pic seems to have a story to tell.   Maybe cropping it so that there is more room at the top, and less at the bottom would give it somewhere to "go."</td>', 'This pic seems to have a story to tell.   Maybe cropping it so that there is more room at the top, and less at the bottom would give it somewhere to "go."', '2002-05-29 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66804, 1956, 1041, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I don''t usually like photographs that "look down" on people, but somehow that actually works well here.  B&amp;w is a good choice, the face is crisp and stands out well.  One thing I would consider is cropping the left and bottom a little more, there''s too much empty foreground IMO.</td>', 'Cool shot, I don''t usually like photographs that "look down" on people, but somehow that actually works well here.  B&w is a good choice, the face is crisp and stands out well.  One thing I would consider is cropping the left and bottom a little more, there''s too much empty foreground IMO.', '2002-05-29 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66805, 1956, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. composition, good contrast, but here''s the nits:  The subject appears to be the boat (see title), but the boat is not easily viewable and is cut off, then there''s the challenge issue (people).  The man does appear to be the real focus of this photo, so back to the title (why)?<br/>Photo (w/title 7) w/o title 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8 (didn''t grade you down for the title confusion, your person shot is very good.)</td>', 'O.K. composition, good contrast, but here''s the nits:  The subject appears to be the boat (see title), but the boat is not easily viewable and is cut off, then there''s the challenge issue (people).  The man does appear to be the real focus of this photo, so back to the title (why)?Photo (w/title 7) w/o title 9 Creativity 7 People 8 total 8 (didn''t grade you down for the title confusion, your person shot is very good.)', '2002-05-29 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66806, 1956, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very special.... I kind of don''t understand what I''m looking at, but I like it!  The model''s expression is intense.  He''s got an interesting Timothy McVeigh (but before he was evil) thing going on.</td>', 'Very special.... I kind of don''t understand what I''m looking at, but I like it!  The model''s expression is intense.  He''s got an interesting Timothy McVeigh (but before he was evil) thing going on.', '2002-05-29 17:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66807, 1958, 1040, '<td valign="top">Hey this guy looks familiar ...</td>', 'Hey this guy looks familiar ...', '2002-05-27 01:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66808, 1958, 327, '<td valign="top">Here''s a people planting it looks like. &amp;lt;?&amp;gt;<br/>A bit dark and ya cropped his buns a little too tight. Sitll I like the shot, good job.</td>', 'Here''s a people planting it looks like. &lt;?&gt;A bit dark and ya cropped his buns a little too tight. Sitll I like the shot, good job.', '2002-05-27 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66809, 1958, 772, '<td valign="top">I need his number... i have some gardening that needs to be done :)</td>', 'I need his number... i have some gardening that needs to be done :)', '2002-05-27 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66810, 1958, 671, '<td valign="top">Good framing, nice colors.  I like the color of the watch, the man''s face and hair.  The brim partically obscuring the face puts attention on the hand with its curved fingers, which is interesting.</td>', 'Good framing, nice colors.  I like the color of the watch, the man''s face and hair.  The brim partically obscuring the face puts attention on the hand with its curved fingers, which is interesting.', '2002-05-27 23:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66811, 1958, 1446, '<td valign="top">Great color.  I know you where using natural light here, but it seems a little washed out at the top and on the subjects left arm.</td>', 'Great color.  I know you where using natural light here, but it seems a little washed out at the top and on the subjects left arm.', '2002-05-28 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66812, 1958, 1005, '<td valign="top">Plant color is very good, but the man''s nose is RED, arm is pink and blurred.  I don''t know what to suggest, keep trying, it''s almost there!<br/>Photo 7 Creativity 8 People 7 total 7</td>', 'Plant color is very good, but the man''s nose is RED, arm is pink and blurred.  I don''t know what to suggest, keep trying, it''s almost there!Photo 7 Creativity 8 People 7 total 7', '2002-05-28 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66813, 1958, 1379, '<td valign="top">Rats!  I love this photo, but for the cigarette!  The pose, the colors, the subject matter.... But I''m having an emotional response to the pollutant quality of your model.  I know you probably didn''t have a choice in this, but....    Anyway, the daylight is awesome...</td>', 'Rats!  I love this photo, but for the cigarette!  The pose, the colors, the subject matter.... But I''m having an emotional response to the pollutant quality of your model.  I know you probably didn''t have a choice in this, but....    Anyway, the daylight is awesome...', '2002-05-28 18:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66814, 1958, 1024, '<td valign="top">I believe this photo would have more impact if you could see more of the mans face.</td>', 'I believe this photo would have more impact if you could see more of the mans face.', '2002-05-29 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66815, 1958, 436, '<td valign="top">your colors are so rich. nicely done (or spiffed up)</td>', 'your colors are so rich. nicely done (or spiffed up)', '2002-05-29 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66816, 1958, 1041, '<td valign="top">I really like the pose and how your camera is almost level with the gardener''s head.  If he had turned his head to more face the camera (or alternatively, if you had moved further to the left, if that was possible), this would be a much stronger shot, because then his eyes would be visible, and that''s whas the viewer usually connects with.</td>', 'I really like the pose and how your camera is almost level with the gardener''s head.  If he had turned his head to more face the camera (or alternatively, if you had moved further to the left, if that was possible), this would be a much stronger shot, because then his eyes would be visible, and that''s whas the viewer usually connects with.', '2002-05-29 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66817, 1958, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but the colors look off, maybe as a result of overexposure?  The man''s hand is a little blurry too, as is the plant he''s holding.</td>', 'Nice scene, but the colors look off, maybe as a result of overexposure?  The man''s hand is a little blurry too, as is the plant he''s holding.', '2002-05-29 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66818, 1958, 573, '<td valign="top">This picture is just a snapshot</td>', 'This picture is just a snapshot', '2002-05-30 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66819, 1958, 811, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh to me, I assume it was a very bright day.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh to me, I assume it was a very bright day.', '2002-06-01 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66820, 1959, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice, gentle treatment of such an angelic child. The title stops it from being too sickeningly sweet :) Yes, it''s all an act.</td>', 'Very nice, gentle treatment of such an angelic child. The title stops it from being too sickeningly sweet :) Yes, it''s all an act.', '2002-05-27 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66821, 1959, 1211, '<td valign="top">I''m weak from the cuteness....</td>', 'I''m weak from the cuteness....', '2002-05-27 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66822, 1959, 1519, '<td valign="top">This is a darling photo! Nice choice of title too, very humorous!</td>', 'This is a darling photo! Nice choice of title too, very humorous!', '2002-05-27 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66823, 1959, 806, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!</td>', 'What a cutie!', '2002-05-27 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66824, 1959, 117, '<td valign="top">nice subject</td>', 'nice subject', '2002-05-27 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66825, 1959, 661, '<td valign="top">The foot up only adds to the title.</td>', 'The foot up only adds to the title.', '2002-05-27 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66826, 1959, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love the big wristwatch with the plastic lidded cup!  The way he''s got his feet makes the picture for me.  He reminds me of the child in the movie "Life is Beautiful".</td>', 'I love the big wristwatch with the plastic lidded cup!  The way he''s got his feet makes the picture for me.  He reminds me of the child in the movie "Life is Beautiful".', '2002-05-27 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66827, 1959, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done! Good work, composition. Maybe a tad OOF but this is just a wonderful little _people_!!!!!!!</td>', 'Well done! Good work, composition. Maybe a tad OOF but this is just a wonderful little _people_!!!!!!!', '2002-05-27 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66828, 1959, 773, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot!  Love the eyes!</td>', 'Excellent shot!  Love the eyes!', '2002-05-27 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66829, 1959, 1820, '<td valign="top">Beautiful smile and very lovely eyes!!!  Very cute!!! =D</td>', 'Beautiful smile and very lovely eyes!!!  Very cute!!! =D', '2002-05-27 23:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66830, 1959, 671, '<td valign="top">What great colors!  And the feet are very expressive.</td>', 'What great colors!  And the feet are very expressive.', '2002-05-27 23:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66831, 1959, 1041, '<td valign="top">How cute!  I love the pose, as well as the crispiness of the shot.  Areas for improvement I see are (a) a more neutral background if possible, (b) get lower, down to the eye-level, and (c) if you have horizontal lines running through your picture, make sure they are indeed horizontal.  Nevertheless, a good shot!</td>', 'How cute!  I love the pose, as well as the crispiness of the shot.  Areas for improvement I see are (a) a more neutral background if possible, (b) get lower, down to the eye-level, and (c) if you have horizontal lines running through your picture, make sure they are indeed horizontal.  Nevertheless, a good shot!', '2002-05-28 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66832, 1959, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture :)</td>', 'Very nice capture :)', '2002-05-28 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66833, 1959, 907, '<td valign="top">what a honey - the ''eyes'' have it!! great capture!!</td>', 'what a honey - the ''eyes'' have it!! great capture!!', '2002-05-28 11:57:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(66834, 1959, 1680, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I think this is one of the best photos of kids that i have seen on here.  Most people just try to throw any photo of their kid up and think it''s cute.  It looks like there''s been an actual attempt at composition here.</td>', 'Good shot.  I think this is one of the best photos of kids that i have seen on here.  Most people just try to throw any photo of their kid up and think it''s cute.  It looks like there''s been an actual attempt at composition here.', '2002-05-28 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66835, 1959, 1759, '<td valign="top">Great pose, and those eyes! I like the brick, but hate the background. If this had a garden background or something besides the reflective glass and framing, the mood would be complete.</td>', 'Great pose, and those eyes! I like the brick, but hate the background. If this had a garden background or something besides the reflective glass and framing, the mood would be complete.', '2002-05-28 14:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66836, 1959, 1005, '<td valign="top">Killer cute!  You may win on cuteness alone.  No gripes, I can''t see anything "wrong" (sorry).  Good job!  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 9 total 9</td>', 'Killer cute!  You may win on cuteness alone.  No gripes, I can''t see anything "wrong" (sorry).  Good job!  Photo 10 Creativity 7 People 9 total 9', '2002-05-28 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66837, 1959, 1, '<td valign="top">Very cute, nicely framed as well, though I would have centered the child more.</td>', 'Very cute, nicely framed as well, though I would have centered the child more.', '2002-05-28 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66838, 1959, 1446, '<td valign="top">This little boy is Adorable!  I love the expression.  The only thing I might change is the background.  The sliding glass door??  is kind of distracting. I bet you have 1000''s of picture of this little guy.  I cant get over how cute he is.</td>', 'This little boy is Adorable!  I love the expression.  The only thing I might change is the background.  The sliding glass door??  is kind of distracting. I bet you have 1000''s of picture of this little guy.  I cant get over how cute he is.', '2002-05-28 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66839, 1959, 737, '<td valign="top">I''m caught by the expression, nice. A top 10 shot.</td>', 'I''m caught by the expression, nice. A top 10 shot.', '2002-05-28 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66840, 1959, 1325, '<td valign="top">You will get a lot of negative comments because you used the photo of a child but pay them no mind.  It may not be "creative and artsy" but those who critize obviously don''t know that you can take 100 shots and only one will really capture the quicksilver moods of a small child, which is what you did beautifully.  Congrats!</td>', 'You will get a lot of negative comments because you used the photo of a child but pay them no mind.  It may not be "creative and artsy" but those who critize obviously don''t know that you can take 100 shots and only one will really capture the quicksilver moods of a small child, which is what you did beautifully.  Congrats!', '2002-05-29 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66841, 1959, 142, '<td valign="top">This is precious.  I love pictures of children and you did a great job.</td>', 'This is precious.  I love pictures of children and you did a great job.', '2002-05-29 18:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66842, 1959, 301, '<td valign="top">very cute.  Well done</td>', 'very cute.  Well done', '2002-05-30 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66843, 1959, 1024, '<td valign="top">The best of the child pictures this week.  Good sharp focus and understated colors..</td>', 'The best of the child pictures this week.  Good sharp focus and understated colors..', '2002-05-30 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66844, 1959, 885, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, nice use of the repetitive khaki color of his clothes, hat and the steps there.  I think the toys distract from his expression a bit though...maybe either the dog or the cup but not both.  and you probably know that the reflection in the door doesn''t add anything...</td>', 'Cute kid, nice use of the repetitive khaki color of his clothes, hat and the steps there.  I think the toys distract from his expression a bit though...maybe either the dog or the cup but not both.  and you probably know that the reflection in the door doesn''t add anything...', '2002-05-30 19:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66845, 1959, 811, '<td valign="top">You have filled up the frame nicely.  This picture is one that would be good centered exactly, I think.  As it is, it is just slightly left of center and it gives it a slightly off-balanced feeling to me.  Great capture of the kids'' expression.</td>', 'You have filled up the frame nicely.  This picture is one that would be good centered exactly, I think.  As it is, it is just slightly left of center and it gives it a slightly off-balanced feeling to me.  Great capture of the kids'' expression.', '2002-05-30 21:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
