(66871, 1960, 1882, '<td valign="top">It''s not the pic of the faucet that caused me to give this one a "10."  It''s that goofy little face in the forefront reflection.  Whether it''s the actual look of surprise or "awe" in the face or just the distortion from the reflection off the faucet, it worked.  Creative and well done.</td>', 'It''s not the pic of the faucet that caused me to give this one a "10."  It''s that goofy little face in the forefront reflection.  Whether it''s the actual look of surprise or "awe" in the face or just the distortion from the reflection off the faucet, it worked.  Creative and well done.', '2002-05-28 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66872, 1960, 1446, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the people challenge.  Taking a few extra minutes and shining the chrome would have made this a better shot I think.</td>', 'Interesting take on the people challenge.  Taking a few extra minutes and shining the chrome would have made this a better shot I think.', '2002-05-28 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66873, 1960, 811, '<td valign="top">Ah, wide-eyed wonder.  Good composition, and interesting approach to the challenge.</td>', 'Ah, wide-eyed wonder.  Good composition, and interesting approach to the challenge.', '2002-05-28 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66874, 1960, 1005, '<td valign="top">Clever, good surprise and interest, but ......As a "people" shot, this leaves lots to be desired.  The focus, lighting, and even the water droplets on the faucet are great touches, but I have such a hard time giving high scores to partial people shots like this one.<br/>My interpretation of PEOPLE includes more than just enough features to be able to figure out that it is a person.  You have a great idea here that is very well done.  Clever ideas get good scores, but meeting the challenge completely gets TOP scores. O.K?<br/>Photo 10 Creativity 10 People 5 (most other "partial" people like this got much, much lower scores) total 6 (weighted heavily on challange issue)</td>', 'Clever, good surprise and interest, but ......As a "people" shot, this leaves lots to be desired.  The focus, lighting, and even the water droplets on the faucet are great touches, but I have such a hard time giving high scores to partial people shots like this one.My interpretation of PEOPLE includes more than just enough features to be able to figure out that it is a person.  You have a great idea here that is very well done.  Clever ideas get good scores, but meeting the challenge completely gets TOP scores. O.K?Photo 10 Creativity 10 People 5 (most other "partial" people like this got much, much lower scores) total 6 (weighted heavily on challange issue)', '2002-05-28 19:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
