(66891, 1961, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, this is how I like to take people shots, too, when they don''t know... ;)  Interesting composition.  I think this shot would''ve benefited from the alternate cropping (cropping some off the left side to make it 640x480) so that there''s less gray in the picture.  Also, if you could''ve snuck this shot while the guy was looking up so his eyes were visible - now that would''ve been cool.</td>', 'Hehehe, this is how I like to take people shots, too, when they don''t know... ;)  Interesting composition.  I think this shot would''ve benefited from the alternate cropping (cropping some off the left side to make it 640x480) so that there''s less gray in the picture.  Also, if you could''ve snuck this shot while the guy was looking up so his eyes were visible - now that would''ve been cool.', '2002-05-29 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
