(66921, 1965, 1379, '<td valign="top">You just can''t stage things like this...  I love it!  I didn''t really realize people still do this.  I spent lots of childhood hours helping my mom do the back of that little bonnet thing...   I''m giving this a 10 just because you got a strong emotional response from me!</td>', 'You just can''t stage things like this...  I love it!  I didn''t really realize people still do this.  I spent lots of childhood hours helping my mom do the back of that little bonnet thing...   I''m giving this a 10 just because you got a strong emotional response from me!', '2002-05-29 17:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66922, 1965, 1847, '<td valign="top">Love the story being told here.  If that''s not candid, you''ve got a good model!  Color might have been neat, but all that monochromatic tile might have made B&amp;W a good choice.</td>', 'Love the story being told here.  If that''s not candid, you''ve got a good model!  Color might have been neat, but all that monochromatic tile might have made B&W a good choice.', '2002-05-29 19:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
