(66924, 1965, 811, '<td valign="top">Hilarious.  If this wasn''t set up, I can imagine that somebody came chasing after you! :-)  Black and white works well to tone down the variety of colors that are obviously there.</td>', 'Hilarious.  If this wasn''t set up, I can imagine that somebody came chasing after you! :-)  Black and white works well to tone down the variety of colors that are obviously there.', '2002-05-31 15:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
