(66936, 1967, 1446, '<td valign="top">Very nice Photograph. The motion of the water add''s a great deal of interest.  One of my top 10.</td>', 'Very nice Photograph. The motion of the water add''s a great deal of interest.  One of my top 10.', '2002-05-28 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66937, 1967, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  i think this is an excellent photo... It is slightly over exposed maybe but interesting, none-the-less :)</td>', 'Nice work!  i think this is an excellent photo... It is slightly over exposed maybe but interesting, none-the-less :)', '2002-05-28 09:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66938, 1967, 378, '<td valign="top">People seem a little washed out</td>', 'People seem a little washed out', '2002-05-28 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66939, 1967, 1037, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot that I like about this photo, but the strong sunlight is a bit harsh, I guess, and the water everywhere just seems chaotic and distracting instead of enhancing the image.</td>', 'There''s a lot that I like about this photo, but the strong sunlight is a bit harsh, I guess, and the water everywhere just seems chaotic and distracting instead of enhancing the image.', '2002-05-28 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66940, 1967, 1519, '<td valign="top">This photo is very sweet.  A cute pose by the couple and really neat how the fountains are spraying water. Well done!</td>', 'This photo is very sweet.  A cute pose by the couple and really neat how the fountains are spraying water. Well done!', '2002-05-28 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66941, 1967, 509, '<td valign="top">Good subject, the water helps convey emotion in this shot.  I think it would be better without the garbage can behind them = ) but there isn''t anything you could have done about it and it doesn''t detract too much.  Also, I wish there was more detail in the couple, but 640x480 is very limiting there.</td>', 'Good subject, the water helps convey emotion in this shot.  I think it would be better without the garbage can behind them = ) but there isn''t anything you could have done about it and it doesn''t detract too much.  Also, I wish there was more detail in the couple, but 640x480 is very limiting there.', '2002-05-28 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66942, 1967, 1759, '<td valign="top">I''m not certain, but I think a tighter crop would bring the subject closer to the viewer. The water on the right is nice, but distracts so much that it makes the primary subjects more of just a background.</td>', 'I''m not certain, but I think a tighter crop would bring the subject closer to the viewer. The water on the right is nice, but distracts so much that it makes the primary subjects more of just a background.', '2002-05-28 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66943, 1967, 1379, '<td valign="top">What a secret moment!  I''ll bet they didn''t even know you were there.  The scene looks so bright and inviting!</td>', 'What a secret moment!  I''ll bet they didn''t even know you were there.  The scene looks so bright and inviting!', '2002-05-28 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66944, 1967, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great idea, wonderful subject, but the fountain dominates this shot.  Saving grace, the couple does stand out and the fountain is beautiful.  I would have preferred more of the subject.  <br/>One of the biggest downfalls in the digital photography world is the loss of detail in background subjects.  This media doesn''t have the complete depth of field that film has.  <br/>This photo is wonderful, digital done you dirt, one of the few times you will hear me say this.  Photo 9 Creativity 10 People 9 total 9<br/>I tried really, really hard to not discount this shot due to the nature of digital.  Expressed at a much higher resolution, this would have been a 10 ++</td>', 'Great idea, wonderful subject, but the fountain dominates this shot.  Saving grace, the couple does stand out and the fountain is beautiful.  I would have preferred more of the subject.  One of the biggest downfalls in the digital photography world is the loss of detail in background subjects.  This media doesn''t have the complete depth of field that film has.  This photo is wonderful, digital done you dirt, one of the few times you will hear me say this.  Photo 9 Creativity 10 People 9 total 9I tried really, really hard to not discount this shot due to the nature of digital.  Expressed at a much higher resolution, this would have been a 10 ++', '2002-05-29 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66945, 1967, 1357, '<td valign="top">The people are meant to be the focus of the pictures surely ?</td>', 'The people are meant to be the focus of the pictures surely ?', '2002-05-29 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66946, 1967, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d b tempted to make grayscale to see if I could disguise the live couple as more atatues...</td>', 'I''d b tempted to make grayscale to see if I could disguise the live couple as more atatues...', '2002-05-31 21:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(66947, 1967, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot with great DOF.   Yours is a picture that I looked at several times, so it has the quality that brought me bakt to look again.   That is an important factor in a quality picture.</td>', 'Nice candid shot with great DOF.   Yours is a picture that I looked at several times, so it has the quality that brought me bakt to look again.   That is an important factor in a quality picture.', '2002-06-01 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
