(314402, 1924, 2586, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! I actually like the guy being in soft focus. However, some of the tiles seem in sharper focus (they probably aren''t but it just seems that way) and therefore compete with the guy for attention. Imho, this shot would have tremendous power if the whole thing would be very soft (gaussian blur on the tiles maybe? ;)